RODUCTION ---'\nPYTHON..."}]}]},"trace":[{"operation":"run","key":"bundle-runner-corrected-review","state":"started"},{"operation":"run","key":"bundle-runner-corrected-review","state":"completed","durationMs":344082,"runId":"839a50b2"}],"emits":[],"console":[]},"chatProgress":{"mode":"live-card","repoRelation":"same","repoLabel":"yinshi"},"missionId":"23264ada-ecd7-456c-9fec-9b506e1d21f9","missionPath":"/Users/user/projects/yinshi/.pi-subagents/missions/23264ada-ecd7-456c-9fec-9b506e1d21f9.json","mission":{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"23264ada-ecd7-456c-9fec-9b506e1d21f9","title":"Read-only corrected-change review. Use software-design.","objective":"Read-only corrected-change review. Use software-design.\nReview backend/src/yinshi/services/git.py, backend/tests/test_git_bytes_runner.py, backend/src/yinshi/services/workspace_replica_bundle.py, and backend/tests/test_workspace_replica_bundle.py.\nPrior findings: bounded cleanup deadlock and repeat-cancellation risk; stderr limit ignored with unbounded stdout; refs not required to peel to commits; status-based HEAD target corruption.\nCorrections: bounded readers kill on first overflow then continue draining without accumulation; cleanup shields one completion through cancellation; explicit stderr bounds select bounded mode while stdout may remain unbounded; bounded stdout defaults stderr to 16 KiB; return codes can be narrowly declared; refs must peel to commits; HEAD uses symbolic-ref with exact target and detached/unborn distinction; verification uses a private empty bare repository with matching object format; tests now use actual live processes, actual ref mutation, nonbranch HEAD with corrupt index, nested and noncommit tags, replacement objects, SHA-256, exact names and OIDs.\nCurrent checks: 69 focused tests pass. Ruff lint and format pass. Strict source mypy and py_compile pass.\nInspect actual current diff. Each finding needs severity, location, impact, correction, validation, and remediation. If none remain, state no remediation is needed. Do not edit.","status":"completed","createdAt":"2026-09-12T17:37:03.133Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-12T17:42:47.354Z","runs":[{"runId":"call_Jwl5PcvKR7imVkm5haGWQ5VT|fc_0212e7de83dbbd32016aa58db7589c87d08393c7251bad5ee0","mode":"workflow","agent":"final-review","status":"completed","startedAt":"2026-09-12T17:42:47.354Z","completedAt":"2026-09-12T17:42:47.354Z","usage":{"tokens":86460}}],"decisions":[],"artifacts":[{"kind":"output","path":"/Users/user/projects/yinshi/.pi-subagents/artifacts/839a50b2_final-review_0_output.md"},{"kind":"other","path":"/Users/user/projects/yinshi/.pi-subagents/artifacts/839a50b2_final-review_0_transcript.jsonl","description":"Child transcript"}],"receipts":[],"cwd":"/Users/user/projects/yinshi","ownerSessionId":"/Users/user/.pi/agent/sessions/--Users-user-projects-yinshi--/2026-09-04T04-44-52-550Z_01a06abb-dfc5-7c65-82bb-7c5f2081ee64.jsonl","summary":"Workflow completed.\n\nReturn:\n{\n  \"key\": \"bundle-runner-corrected-review\",\n  \"ok\": true,\n  \"runId\": \"839a50b2\",\n  \"output\": \"Turn budget wrap-up was requested after 6 assistant turns (soft limit 6, grace 2). Process-mode live steering is unavailable, so the child was warned at launch to wrap up by this budget. Output may be partial.\\n\\n## Review result\\n\\nReview blocked. One high-severity finding remains.\\n\\n### Finding\\n\\n**High — `backend/src/yinshi/services/workspace_replica_bundle.py:145-150`**\\n\\n- `git symbolic-ref --quiet HEAD` recursively resolves symbolic refs.\\n- A `HEAD` targeting `refs/yinshi/alias` was captured as `refs/heads/main`.\\n- This violates exact symbolic HEAD preservation. Replica restoration could flatten valid symbolic-ref topology.\\n- Correction: invoke `git symbolic-ref --quiet --no-recurse HEAD`.\\n- Validation: add a live nested-symbolic-ref test beside `backend/tests/test_workspace_replica_bundle.py:97-109`.\\n- The test must assert the direct target remains `refs/yinshi/alias`.\\n- Remediation: `worker`.\\n- Required checks: focused 69-test command, Ruff lint and format, strict source mypy, and `py_compile`.\\n\\n### Prior findings\\n\\n- Bounded draining and repeated-cancellation cleanup: resolved.\\n- Explicit stderr bounds with unbounded stdout: resolved.\\n- Commit peeling for requested refs: resolved.\\n- Nonbranch symbolic HEAD parsing: partly resolved. Nested symbolic targets remain incorrect.\\n\\n### Residual risks and limits\\n\\n- No production caller references the new bundle service. Cross-module restoration behavior could not be reviewed.\\n- Broad unrelated `git.py` changes outside subprocess-runner regions were not fully inspected due truncated diff output.\\n- No files were edited. No files are staged.\",\n  \"artifactPaths\": [\n    \"/Users/user/.pi/agent/sessions/--Users-user-projects-yinshi--/2026-09-04T04-44-52-550Z_01a06abb-dfc5-7c65-82bb-7c5f2081ee64/839a50b2/run-0/session.jsonl\"\n  ],\n  \"results\": [\n    {\n      \"index\": 0,\n      \"ag...","acceptance":{"status":"attested","evidenceStatus":"attested","explicit":false,"effectiveAcceptance":{"level":"attested","explicit":false,"inferredReason":["read-only task wording"],"criteria":[{"id":"criterion-1","must":"Return concrete findings with file paths and severity when applicable","evidence":["review-findings","residual-risks"],"severity":"required"}],"evidence":["review-findings","residual-risks"],"verify":[],"stopRules":[]},"inferredReason":["read-only task wording"],"criteria":[{"id":"criterion-1","must":"Return concrete findings with file paths and severity when applicable","evidence":["review-findings","residual-risks"],"severity":"required"}],"runtimeChecks":[],"verifyRuns":[],"childReport":{"criteriaSatisfied":[{"id":"criterion-1","status":"satisfied","evidence":"One high-severity finding identifies backend/src/yinshi/services/workspace_replica_bundle.py:145-150 with impact, correction, validation, and remediation."}],"changedFiles":["backend/src/yinshi/services/git.py","backend/tests/test_git_bytes_runner.py","backend/src/yinshi/services/workspace_replica_bundle.py","backend/tests/test_workspace_replica_bundle.py"],"testsAddedOrUpdated":["backend/tests/test_git_bytes_runner.py","backend/tests/test_workspace_replica_bundle.py"],"commandsRun":[{"command":"cd backend && ../.venv/bin/pytest -q tests/test_git.py tests/test_git_bytes_runner.py tests/test_workspace_replica_bundle.py","result":"passed","summary":"69 tests passed in 26.39 seconds against the current working-tree candidate."},{"command":"nested symbolic HEAD reproduction using git symbolic-ref and PYTHONPATH=src ../.venv/bin/python","result":"passed","summary":"HEAD file targeted refs/yinshi/alias, but create_committed_bundle captured refs/heads/main."},{"command":"cd backend && pytest -q tests/test_git.py tests/test_git_bytes_runner.py tests/test_workspace_replica_bundle.py","result":"failed","summary":"System pytest imported an older installed package. The repository virtual environment command then passed."}],"validationOutput":["Focused suite: 69 passed.","Reproduction: head_file=ref: refs/yinshi/alias.","Reproduction: captured_target=refs/heads/main.","Target status shows two modified files and two untracked files. No target file is staged."],"residualRisks":["Nested symbolic HEAD targets are flattened by Git's default recursive symbolic-ref behavior.","No production caller exists for cross-module restoration review.","Unrelated git.py diff regions were not fully inspected because tool output was truncated."],"noStagedFiles":true,"diffSummary":"Git runner adds bounded stream ownership and return-code controls. Bundle service adds bounded committed-ref capture, verification, and metadata.","reviewFindings":["high: backend/src/yinshi/services/workspace_replica_bundle.py:145-150 - symbolic-ref recursively resolves nested symbolic HEAD targets instead of preserving the direct target"],"manualNotes":"Review remains blocked. Remediation is required. Reported Ruff, strict source mypy, a