on code.\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"command\": \"cd backend && pytest -q tests/test_workspace_replica_artifact.py tests/test_workspace_replica_bundle.py tests/test_workspace_replica_publication.py\",\n              \"result\": \"not-run\",\n              \"summary\": \"Planning task was read-only. Proposed publication test file does not exist yet.\"\n            }\n          ],\n          \"validationOutput\": [\n            \"Artifact codec already enforces deterministic bounded decoding and source-state digest computation.\",\n            \"Root protocol currently exposes only prepare, launch, and reclaim.\",\n            \"Current replica journal receipts do not satisfy required pair-length and declared-limit binding.\",\n            \"Current broker transport cannot carry configured artifact sizes.\"\n          ],\n          \"residualRisks\": [\n            \"Artifact transport and broker-owned persistence remain unapproved.\",\n            \"Artifact-pair publication may not match intended runnable-replica publication semantics.\",\n            \"Current journal authority is not part of the signed request payload.\",\n            \"Current journal response validation does not cryptographically verify the broker signature.\",\n            \"Production limit ceilings may exceed safe broker memory.\"\n          ],\n          \"noStagedFiles\": true,\n          \"diffSummary\": \"Read-only planning review. No repository diff was created.\",\n          \"reviewFindings\": [\n            \"blocker: backend/src/yinshi/services/broker_replica_journal.py - signed request payload omits replica authority and declared limits.\",\n            \"blocker: backend/src/yinshi/services/broker_protocol.py - 65536-byte frame limit has no corresponding external artifact transport.\",\n            \"blocker: backend/src/yinshi/root_launcher.py - root prepare expects repo and home trees, not an artifact pair.\",\n            \"high: backend/src/yinshi/services/broker_replica_journal.py - verify and publish receipts do not bind both artifact lengths and full pair metadata.\",\n            \"high: backend/src/yinshi/services/workspace_replica_bundle.py - no public trust-boundary verifier exists for externally supplied bundle bytes.\",\n            \"high: backend/src/yinshi/services/broker_replica_journal.py - stored response validation checks signature shape but not the Ed25519 signature.\"\n          ],\n          \"manualNotes\": \"Standalone publication store should precede broker wiring. Existing gates must remain disabled.\"\n        }\n      },\n      \"toolCalls\": [\n        {\n          \"text\": \"ls {\\\"path\\\":\\\".\\\",\\\"limit\\\":200}\",\n          \"expandedText\": \"ls {\\\"path\\\":\\\".\\\",\\\"limit\\\":200}\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"find {\\\"path\\\":\\\".\\\",\\\"pattern\\\":\\\"**/{AGENTS.md,CLA...\",\n          \"expandedText\": \"find {\\\"path\\\":\\\".\\\",\\\"pattern\\\":\\\"**/{AGENTS.md,CLAUDE.md,CONTRIBUTING.md,README.md}\\\",\\\"limit\\\":100}\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"$ git status --short && printf '\\\\n--- branch ---\\\\n' && git bra...\",\n          \"expandedText\": \"$ git status --short && printf '\\\\n--- branch ---\\\\n' && git branch --show-current && printf '\\\\n--- recent commits ---\\\\n' && git log -8 --oneline --decorate\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"find {\\\"path\\\":\\\"backend\\\",\\\"pattern\\\":\\\"**/*replica...\",\n          \"expandedText\": \"find {\\\"path\\\":\\\"backend\\\",\\\"pattern\\\":\\\"**/*replica*.py\\\",\\\"limit\\\":200}\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"find {\\\"path\\\":\\\"backend\\\",\\\"pattern\\\":\\\"**/test*pub...\",\n          \"expandedText\": \"find {\\\"path\\\":\\\"backend\\\",\\\"pattern\\\":\\\"**/test*publication*.py\\\",\\\"limit\\\":200}\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"read CLAUDE.md\",\n          \"expandedText\": \"read CLAUDE.md\"\n   