anonical path safety, canonical (raw_path, stage) ordering, duplicate keys, stage-zero/conflict exclusion, modes 100644/100755/120000, no gitlink or sparse directory, and nonzero OIDs. Preserve exact index bytes.\nAllow only explicitly approved extensions TREE, REUC, UNTR, FSMN, EOIE, IEOT with exact signature plus u32 length framing. Reject split-index link, sparse sdir, unknown optional, unknown mandatory, truncation, overflow, or malformed framing. Extension payload may remain opaque after framing checks.\nROOTS must equal sorted unique HEAD OID when present plus every parsed index OID. Apply on encode and decode. No index means no index entries and roots equal HEAD only. Existing fixture now uses valid empty index.\nKeep artifact envelope version 1 and source digest unchanged. No filesystem, Git, SQLite, network, or broker calls in production module.\nRun focused tests, Ruff lint and format check, strict source mypy, py_compile, and diff check. Report all modifications and any test correction. Escalate if tests encode invalid Git format assumptions.","status":"completed","createdAt":"2026-09-12T18:22:11.683Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-12T18:29:25.674Z","runs":[{"runId":"call_0fhA284nX2OfD7cKoVmbtVUv|fc_0212e7de83dbbd32016aa59847489487d0ae5baa98d7600d6a","mode":"workflow","agent":"worker-expert","status":"completed","startedAt":"2026-09-12T18:29:25.674Z","completedAt":"2026-09-12T18:29:25.674Z","usage":{"tokens":62086}}],"decisions":[],"artifacts":[{"kind":"output","path":"/Users/user/projects/yinshi/.pi-subagents/artifacts/021aa4e8_worker-expert_0_output.md"},{"kind":"other","path":"/Users/user/projects/yinshi/.pi-subagents/artifacts/021aa4e8_worker-expert_0_transcript.jsonl","description":"Child transcript"}],"receipts":[],"cwd":"/Users/user/projects/yinshi","ownerSessionId":"/Users/user/.pi/agent/sessions/--Users-user-projects-yinshi--/2026-09-04T04-44-52-550Z_01a06abb-dfc5-7c65-82bb-7c5f2081ee64.jsonl","summary":"Workflow completed.\n\nReturn:\n{\n  \"key\": \"artifact-index-parser\",\n  \"ok\": true,\n  \"runId\": \"021aa4e8\",\n  \"output\": \"Turn budget wrap-up was requested after 10 assistant turns (soft limit 10, grace 2). Process-mode live steering is unavailable, so the child was warned at launch to wrap up by this budget. Output may be partial.\\n\\nImplemented strict Git index parsing and exact ROOTS validation.\\n\\nCausal account:\\n- Codec previously treated index bytes as opaque.\\n- ROOTS only required valid unique OIDs plus HEAD containment.\\n- Parser now owns index validation and derives exact ROOTS from HEAD plus index entries.\\n\\nTest fixture corrections:\\n- Replaced invalid placeholder index with checksummed empty index.\\n- Added matching SHA-256 empty index.\\n- Removed extra ROOT OID.\\n- Sorted conflict ROOT OIDs.\\n- Updated root-limit boundary from one to zero.\\n\\nRejected explanations:\\n- Envelope format required no change. Version `1` and source digest domain remain unchanged.\\n- Object format support was not faulty. Real SHA-1 and SHA-256 indexes now pass.\\n- Extension payload parsing was unnecessary. Contract permits opaque approved payloads after framing validation.\\n\\nInitial Ruff commands using backend virtual environment failed because Ruff was unavailable there. Final checks used installed Python 3.12 Ruff.\",\n  \"artifactPaths\": [\n    \"/Users/user/.pi/agent/sessions/--Users-user-projects-yinshi--/2026-09-04T04-44-52-550Z_01a06abb-dfc5-7c65-82bb-7c5f2081ee64/021aa4e8/run-0/session.jsonl\"\n  ],\n  \"results\": [\n    {\n      \"index\": 0,\n      \"agent\": \"worker-expert\",\n      \"task\": \"Implement strict Git index parsing and exact ROOTS validation in current checkout. Do not commit.\\nFiles: backend/src/yinshi/services/workspace_replica_artifact.py and existing red tests in backend/tests/test_workspace_replica_artifact.py. You may correct test fixture bugs, but preserve behavior requirements.\\nAdd frozen ArtifactIndexEntry with raw_path bytes, mode int, object_id bytes, stage int...","acceptance":{"status":"checked","evidenceStatus":"checked","explicit":true,"effectiveAcceptance":{"level":"checked","explicit":true,"inferredReason":["write-capable worker/task"],"criteria":[{"id":"criterion-1","must":"All artifact tests pass","evidence":["changed-files","tests-added","commands-run","residual-risks","no-staged-files","validation-output"],"severity":"required"},{"id":"criterion-2","must":"Parser enforces exact ROOTS equality","evidence":["changed-files","tests-added","commands-run","residual-risks","no-staged-files","validation-output"],"severity":"required"},{"id":"criterion-3","must":"Existing envelope compatibility remains for valid inputs","evidence":["changed-files","tests-added","commands-run","residual-risks","no-staged-files","validation-output"],"severity":"required"},{"id":"criterion-4","must":"Static checks pass","evidence":["changed-files","tests-added","commands-run","residual-risks","no-staged-files","validation-output"],"severity":"required"}],"evidence":["changed-files","tests-added","commands-run","residual-risks","no-staged-files","validation-output"],"verify":[],"stopRules":[]},"inferredReason":["write-capable worker/task"],"criteria":[{"id":"criterion-1","must":"All artifact tests pass","evidence":["changed-files","tests-added","commands-run","residual-risks","no-staged-files","validation-output"],"severity":"required"},{"id":"criterion-2","must":"Parser enforces exact ROOTS equality","evidence":["changed-files","tests-added","commands-run","residual-risks","no-staged-files","validation-output"],"severity":"required"},{"id":"criterion-3","must":"Existing envelope compatibility remains for valid inputs","evidence":["changed-files","tests-added","commands-run","residual-risks","no-staged-files","validation-output"],"severity":"required"},{"id":"criterion-4","must":"Static checks pass","evidence":["changed-files","tests-added","commands-run","residual-risks","no-staged-files","validation-output"],"severity":"requir