e, and diff check previously passed before parent one-test edit.\nEach finding needs severity, location, impact, correction, validation, and remediation. If none remain, state no remediation needed. Do not edit.","status":"completed","createdAt":"2026-09-12T18:30:39.513Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-12T18:38:05.911Z","runs":[{"runId":"call_QUxEDBLnxypaFWZVnjEVrO9a|fc_0212e7de83dbbd32016aa59a485bb487d08ec4b2195b80c885","mode":"workflow","agent":"final-review","status":"completed","startedAt":"2026-09-12T18:38:05.910Z","completedAt":"2026-09-12T18:38:05.910Z","usage":{"tokens":99822}}],"decisions":[],"artifacts":[{"kind":"output","path":"/Users/user/projects/yinshi/.pi-subagents/artifacts/e46c95b1_final-review_0_output.md"},{"kind":"other","path":"/Users/user/projects/yinshi/.pi-subagents/artifacts/e46c95b1_final-review_0_transcript.jsonl","description":"Child transcript"}],"receipts":[],"cwd":"/Users/user/projects/yinshi","ownerSessionId":"/Users/user/.pi/agent/sessions/--Users-user-projects-yinshi--/2026-09-04T04-44-52-550Z_01a06abb-dfc5-7c65-82bb-7c5f2081ee64.jsonl","summary":"Workflow completed.\n\nReturn:\n{\n  \"key\": \"artifact-index-final-review\",\n  \"ok\": true,\n  \"runId\": \"e46c95b1\",\n  \"output\": \"Turn budget wrap-up was requested after 7 assistant turns (soft limit 7, grace 2). Process-mode live steering is unavailable, so the child was warned at launch to wrap up by this budget. Output may be partial.\\n\\n## Confirmed finding\\n\\n**Medium — `backend/src/yinshi/services/workspace_replica_artifact.py:408-418`**\\n\\nParser accepts extensions after `EOIE`. Git requires `EOIE` to be final extension.\\n\\n`backend/tests/test_workspace_replica_artifact.py:649-666` preserves this defect by placing `IEOT` after `EOIE`.\\n\\nImpact: malformed indexes become verified artifacts. Git may ignore index acceleration metadata or reject restored index behavior.\\n\\nCorrection: enforce one final `EOIE`. Reject duplicate `EOIE` or any following extension. Keep extension policy inside `_parse_index`.\\n\\nValidation:\\n- Accept `IEOT` before final `EOIE`.\\n- Reject `EOIE` followed by `IEOT`.\\n- Reject duplicate `EOIE`.\\n- Exercise encoding and decoding paths.\\n- Run focused pytest, Ruff, strict mypy, and `py_compile`.\\n\\nRemediation: `worker`. Correction is localized with settled format rules.\\n\\n## Unanswered questions\\n\\nNone.\\n\\n## Review limits and residual risks\\n\\n- Review covered full requested files and current scoped diff.\\n- Repository contains many unrelated unstaged changes.\\n- Approved design leaves extension payload internals opaque.\\n- Tests lack explicit `0xFFF` long-path boundary coverage.\\n- Supplemental object pack remains outside this change.\\n- Earlier Ruff, mypy, and compile results apply before parent test edit.\",\n  \"artifactPaths\": [\n    \"/Users/user/.pi/agent/sessions/--Users-user-projects-yinshi--/2026-09-04T04-44-52-550Z_01a06abb-dfc5-7c65-82bb-7c5f2081ee64/e46c95b1/run-0/session.jsonl\"\n  ],\n  \"results\": [\n    {\n      \"index\": 0,\n      \"agent\": \"final-review\",\n      \"task\": \"Read-only final review. Use software-design.\\nReview current diff ...","acceptance":{"status":"attested","evidenceStatus":"attested","explicit":false,"effectiveAcceptance":{"level":"attested","explicit":false,"inferredReason":["read-only task wording"],"criteria":[{"id":"criterion-1","must":"Return concrete findings with file paths and severity when applicable","evidence":["review-findings","residual-risks"],"severity":"required"}],"evidence":["review-findings","residual-risks"],"verify":[],"stopRules":[]},"inferredReason":["read-only task wording"],"criteria":[{"id":"criterion-1","must":"Return concrete findings with file paths and severity when applicable","evidence":["review-findings","residual-risks"],"severity":"required"}],"runtimeChecks":[],"verifyRuns":[],"childReport":{"criteriaSatisfied":[{"id":"criterion-1","status":"satisfied","evidence":"One medium finding identifies exact pro