{"type":"message","id":"c891555b","parentId":"fe566bad","timestamp":"2026-09-12T18:53:34.000Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"**Verifying pack integrity and inventory handling**\n\n**Designing bundle verification with closure checking**\n\n**Planning red test delegation to worker-advanced**","thinkingSignature":"{\"id\":\"rs_0212e7de83dbbd32016aa59f90fdb487d0bd2c8129b9f95f4d\",\"type\":\"reasoning\",\"content\":[],\"encrypted_content\":\"REDACTED\",\"summary\":[{\"type\":\"summary_text\",\"text\":\"**Verifying pack integrity and inventory handling**\"},{\"type\":\"summary_text\",\"text\":\"**Designing bundle verification with closure checking**\"},{\"type\":\"summary_text\",\"text\":\"**Planning red test delegation to worker-advanced**\"}]}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_d7FjzD2PlzGcUGGKa9RuyEG5|fc_0212e7de83dbbd32016aa59f9cae7487d0b7503faac9df2712","name":"subagent","arguments":{"workflowScript":"return runs.run('index-object-pack', {agent:'worker-advanced', task:[\n  'Implement next approved Phase 6 milestone. Do not commit.',\n  'Files allowed: backend/src/yinshi/services/git.py, backend/tests/test_git_bytes_runner.py, backend/src/yinshi/services/workspace_replica_bundle.py, backend/tests/test_workspace_replica_bundle.py, new backend/src/yinshi/services/workspace_replica_object_pack.py, new backend/tests/test_workspace_replica_object_pack.py.',\n  'Owners: source Git repository owns immutable objects. Generator captures them. Consumer verifies in a private empty bare quarantine. No SQLite, broker, root, network, or production gate changes.',\n  'First add red tests. Then implement.',\n  'Extend run_git_bytes with exact bytes stdin support. Bounded mode must write stdin without deadlock, stop and reap on overflow, timeout, or cancellation, and reject invalid input types. Existing callers remain compatible.',\n  'Add public VerifiedCommittedBundle and verify_committed_bundle. Verify external bytes in an empty bare repository with matching SHA-1 or SHA-256. Check size before filesystem work, bundle verify/list-heads/unbundle, exact canonical refs, each advertised ref peels to commit, inventory all actual objects, derive advertised-tip closure, and require exact inventory equality. Reject refs/replace, extra unreachable objects, malformed output, object-format mismatch, empty or over-limit bytes. create_committed_bundle must use this verifier.',\n  'Add object pack module. Frozen types: IndexObjectPackLimits, PackedObject, VerifiedIndexObjectPack, CreatedIndexObjectPack. Generator receives required index OIDs plus committed-bundle inventory. E is sorted required minus committed inventory. Validate OID widths and uniqueness. Preflight each E through cat-file batch-check with GIT_NO_REPLACE_OBJECTS=1 and GIT_NO_LAZY_FETCH=1. Require blobs. Enforce object count, each inflated size, aggregate inflated size, pack bytes, and listing bytes. Create a complete non-thin pack with git pack-objects --stdout --no-reuse-delta --no-reuse-object --window=0. Send sorted E OIDs on stdin. Empty E produces valid zero-object pack.',\n  'Public verifier accepts pack bytes, expected object format, exact expected missing OIDs, and explicit limits. Precheck PACK header, supported pack version, count, total bytes, and object count before Git. Run index-pack --strict --stdin in empty bare quarantine. Inventory every object. Require exact E, every object blob, size bounds, aggregate bounds, and digest/length results. Reject thin packs, external bases, missing, duplicate, extra, wrong type, bad trailer, wrong format, replacement/promisor dependence.',\n  'Use immutable bounded result metadata. Do not carry bytes in verification receipts. Created result may carry bytes like current bundle API.',\n  'Tests: SHA-1/SHA-256 staged-only blob, conflict blobs, staged content differs from worktree, bundle-reachable excluded, empty pack, exact bounds, tamper, wrong type, missing/extra expected OIDs, thin/external base, replacement ignored, public bundle verifier exact inventory and extra-object rejection, stdin overflow/cancellation.',\n  'Run focused tests for git runner, bundle, object pack, artifact. Run Ruff, format check, strict source mypy, py_compile, diff check. Escalate any Git-version behavior mismatch with command output.'\n].join('\\n')})","async":false,"cwd":"/Users/user/projects/yinshi","timeoutMs":1800000,"turnBudget":{"maxTurns":12,"graceTurns":3},"toolBudget":{"soft":42,"hard":60,"block":["read","grep","find","ls"]},"acceptance":{"level":"checked","evidence":["changed-files","tests-added","commands-run","validation-output","residual-risks","no-staged-files"],"criteria":["Public bundle verifier proves exact refs-only inventory","Supplemental pack verifies exact missing blob inventory","SHA-1 and SHA-256 pass","Bounds and child cleanup fail closed","Static checks pass"]},"chatProgress":"live-card"}}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.6-sol","usage":{"input":620,"output":1372,"cacheRead":143232,"cacheWrite":0,"reasoning":490,"totalTokens":145224,"cost":{"input":0.0031000000000000003,"output":0.04116,"cacheRead":0.071616,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.115876}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1789239181977,"responseId":"resp_0212e7de83dbbd32016aa59f8ec12087d0b427ebc2f7520657","rawStopReason":"completed"}}
