{"type":"message","id":"a70559f8","parentId":"db360c58","timestamp":"2026-09-12T19:31:28.642Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"**Extending bundle listing limit to 128MB**\n\n**Validating committed inventory object kinds**\n\n**Identifying duplicate objects in pack**","thinkingSignature":"{\"id\":\"rs_0212e7de83dbbd32016aa5a879701c87d08f0d4e8c90c68e6f\",\"type\":\"reasoning\",\"content\":[],\"encrypted_content\":\"REDACTED\",\"summary\":[{\"type\":\"summary_text\",\"text\":\"**Extending bundle listing limit to 128MB**\"},{\"type\":\"summary_text\",\"text\":\"**Validating committed inventory object kinds**\"},{\"type\":\"summary_text\",\"text\":\"**Identifying duplicate objects in pack**\"}]}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_iz8hiegOWNn0labwVB9TZUoY|fc_0212e7de83dbbd32016aa5a88833f487d0ae634068145dda1c","name":"subagent","arguments":{"workflowScript":"return runs.run('bundle-object-pack-review', {agent:'final-review', task:[\n  'Read-only final review. Use software-design.',\n  'Review current diffs in git.py, test_git_bytes_runner.py, workspace_replica_bundle.py and tests, workspace_replica_object_pack.py and tests.',\n  'Goal: public consumer verification proves committed bundles contain exactly the closure of advertised committed refs. Supplemental pack transports exactly required index blobs absent from bundle inventory. Support SHA-1/SHA-256, zero-object pack, replacement/promisor exclusion, strict bounded parsing, exact inventory, non-thin self-contained packs, and child cleanup. No SQLite or broker changes.',\n  'Key invariants: bundle advertised refs peel to commits. refs/replace rejected. Bundle actual inventory equals rev-list closure. Required index OIDs all name blobs even when bundle-reachable. E equals required minus bundle inventory. Supplemental pack actual inventory equals E. Pack header limits checked before Git. index-pack runs in empty bare quarantine. All limits immutable.',\n  'Current focused result: 112 artifact, bundle, object-pack, and runner tests pass before minor formatting-only edits. Strict source mypy and py_compile passed before formatting-only edits. Ruff lint passed and formatting suggestions were manually applied.',\n  'Inspect Git command semantics, stdin deadlock/cancellation, inventories, resource bounds, type validation, empty/thin packs, exact tests, and public API consistency. Each finding needs severity, location, impact, correction, validation, and remediation. If none remain, state no remediation needed. Do not edit.'\n].join('\\n')})","async":false,"cwd":"/Users/user/projects/yinshi","timeoutMs":1200000,"turnBudget":{"maxTurns":8,"graceTurns":2},"toolBudget":{"soft":30,"hard":45,"block":["read","grep","find","ls"]},"chatProgress":"live-card"}}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.6-sol","usage":{"input":434,"output":859,"cacheRead":170624,"cacheWrite":0,"reasoning":440,"totalTokens":171917,"cost":{"input":0.00217,"output":0.02577,"cacheRead":0.085312,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.11325199999999999}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1789241462586,"responseId":"resp_0212e7de83dbbd32016aa5a8771e6487d09e59bac4f4227d9b","rawStopReason":"completed"}}
{"type":"message","id":"239ab0f9","parentId":"a70559f8","timestamp":"2026-09-12T19:37:01.048Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_iz8hiegOWNn0labwVB9TZUoY|fc_0212e7de83dbbd32016aa5a88833f487d0ae634068145dda1c","toolName":"subagent","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Workflow completed.\n\nReturn:\n{\n  \"key\": \"bundle-object-pack-review\",\n  \"ok\": true,\n  \"runId\": \"79da9540\",\n  \"output\": \"## Finding\\n\\n**Medium — Required fail-closed tests are missing**\\n\\nLocations:\\n\\n- `backend/tests/test_git_bytes_runner.py:117-241`\\n- `backend/tests/test_workspace_replica_object_pack.py:48-163`\\n- `backend/tests/test_workspace_replica_bundle.py:231-284`\\n\\nImpact:\\n\\nCurrent tests do not attest several approved guarantees:\\n\\n- Bounded stdin cancellation or overflow while child does not read stdin\\n- Thin pack and external-base rejection\\n- Promisor or lazy-fetch exclusion\\n- Exact object-count, per-object, aggregate, and listing limits\\n- Zero-object pack behavior under SHA-256\\n- Staged content remaining authoritative after worktree divergence\\n- Public verifier rejection of replacement refs and advertised non-commits\\n\\nReported 112 passing tests cannot prove these behaviors because corresponding cases are absent.\\n\\nCorrection:\\n\\nAdd deterministic tests for each guarantee. Assert child PID reaping after bounded stdin cancellation and overflow. Construct a thin pack with an external base. Exercise every limit at boundary and one beyond. Parameterize empty packs across both object formats.\\n\\nValidation:\\n\\nRun focused artifact, bundle, object-pack, and runner tests. Then run Ruff lint and format checks, strict source mypy, `py_compile`, and scoped diff checks.\\n\\nRemediation: `worker-advanced`. Concurrency cleanup and Git pack construction involve interacting guarantees.\\n\\n## Review disposition\\n\\nCompletion blocked by unresolved test-contract finding. No other correctness defect was confirmed through direct source inspection.\\n\\nNo production callers currently use the new object-pack API. Review covered only requested files. Repository contains many unrelated unstaged changes.\\n\\nReported tests and static checks were not repeated. Their results predate formatting-only edits, but their coverage remains incomplete.\",\n  \"artifactPaths\": [\n    \"/Users/user/.pi/agent/sessions/--Users-user-projects-yinshi--/2026-09-04T04-44-52-550Z_01a06abb-dfc5-7c65-82bb-7c5f2081ee64/79da9540/run-0/session.jsonl\"\n  ],\n  \"results\": [\n    {\n      \"index\": 0,\n      \"agent\": \"final-review\",\n      \"task\": \"Read-only final review. Use software-design.\\nReview current diffs in git.py, test_git_bytes_runner.py, workspace_replica_bundle.py and tests, workspace_replica_object_pack.py and tests.\\nGoal: public consumer verification proves committed bundles contain exactly the closure of advertised committed refs. Supplemental pack transports exactly required index blobs absent from bundle inventory. Support SHA-1/SHA-256, zero-object pack, replacement/promisor exclusion, strict bounded parsing, exact inventory, non-thin self-contained packs, and child cleanup. No SQLite or broker changes.\\nKey invariants: bundle advertised refs peel to commits. refs/replace rejected. Bundle actual inventory equals rev-list closure. Required index OIDs all name blobs even when bundle-reachable. E equals required minus bundle inventory. Supplemental pack actual inventory equals E. Pack header limits checked before Git. index-pack runs in empty bare quarantine. All limits immutable.\\nCurrent focused result: 112 artifact, bundle, object-pack, and runner tests pass before minor formatting-only edits. Strict source mypy and py_compile passed before formatting-only edits. Ruff lint passed and formatting suggestions were manually applied.\\nInspect Git command semantics, stdin deadlock/cancellation, inventories, resource bounds, type validation, empty/thin packs, exact tests, and public API consi