ing, exact inventory, non-thin self-contained packs, and child cleanup. No SQLite or broker changes.\nKey invariants: bundle advertised refs peel to commits. refs/replace rejected. Bundle actual inventory equals rev-list closure. Required index OIDs all name blobs even when bundle-reachable. E equals required minus bundle inventory. Supplemental pack actual inventory equals E. Pack header limits checked before Git. index-pack runs in empty bare quarantine. All limits immutable.\nCurrent focused result: 112 artifact, bundle, object-pack, and runner tests pass before minor formatting-only edits. Strict source mypy and py_compile passed before formatting-only edits. Ruff lint passed and formatting suggestions were manually applied.\nInspect Git command semantics, stdin deadlock/cancellation, inventories, resource bounds, type validation, empty/thin packs, exact tests, and public API consistency. Each finding needs severity, location, impact, correction, validation, and remediation. If none remain, state no remediation needed. Do not edit.","routingContract":{"version":1,"agent":"final-review","model":"openai-codex/gpt-5.6-sol","thinking":"max","policyDigest":"8590d2fc0420152aad3f867aba1c18a56b3632f2d90e01d30d3f04676cd46ac5"},"launchContractDigest":"353a3cbf317f0096fee7d3f3d6f8a4f5dcecc8ea11aa7d73eb83692dc3b1e43f","launchResolvedExtensions":{"version":1,"source":"launch-resolved","disableAmbientExtensions":false,"runtime":["sha256:cb00ccf63b7cf9f4"],"configured":[],"effective":["sha256:cb00ccf63b7cf9f4"],"omitted":{"runtime":0,"configured":0,"effective":0}},"exitCode":0,"outputState":"present","usage":{"input":68675,"output":14579,"cacheRead":128640,"cacheWrite":0,"cost":0.845065,"turns":6},"model":"openai-codex/gpt-5.6-sol:max","thinking":"max","artifactPaths":{"inputPath":"/Users/user/projects/yinshi/.pi-subagents/artifacts/79da9540_final-review_0_input.md","outputPath":"/Users/user/projects/yinshi/.pi-subagents/artifacts/79da9540_final-review_0_output.md","jsonlPath"