lt":"not-run","summary":"User reports success before later test-only edits."},{"command":"cd backend && ruff check src/yinshi/services/workspace_replica_publication.py tests/test_workspace_replica_publication.py","result":"not-run","summary":"User states Ruff remains pending."}],"validationOutput":["Public inspection now returns ReplicaInspectionReceipt without publication authority.","Bundled index entries now require bundled objects to be blobs.","Publication final inspection reopens root authority and does not bind final identity to pending identity.","Late directory ownership and mode changes are not rechecked.","Rename-state inspection errors can be downgraded to safe rejection.","Cleanup does not bind opened and removed directories to recorded identity.","Declaration version lacks exact primitive type validation."],"residualRisks":["Five unresolved findings block completion.","Reported tests were not independently repeated.","Future caller authorization and restart recovery remain outside this milestone.","Unrelated workspace changes were outside review scope."],"noStagedFiles":false,"diffSummary":"Two untracked files add corrected publication logic and expanded tests. Five authority, race, and validation defects remain.","reviewFindings":["blocker: backend/src/yinshi/services/workspace_replica_publication.py:730-870,886-980 - final inspection can attest a different root or directory than atomic publication synchronized.","high: backend/src/yinshi/services/workspace_replica_publication.py:450-529,912-974 - late directory metadata and file ownership changes are not rechecked.","high: backend/src/yinshi/services/workspace_replica_publication.py:671-692,840-859,879-882 - rename-state lookup errors can become safe rejection.","high: backend/src/yinshi/services/workspace_replica_publication.py:630-665 - cleanup does not bind opened and removed directories to recorded identity.","medium: backend/src/yinshi/services/workspace_replica_publication.py:229-260 - values e