oot` instead of using retained, synchronized root descriptor.\n- Impact: It never requires final directory identity to equal pending directory identity.\n- Impact: Root or final replacement can produce a receipt for storage atomic helper never moved or synchronized.\n- Correction: Inspect through retained root descriptor. Require final identity to equal `pending_identity`. Recheck root pathname identity before minting receipt.\n- Validation: Replace root or final directory after rename with an exact copy. Publication must return unresolved without a receipt.\n- Remediation: `worker-advanced`\n\n### 2. High: final metadata reinspection remains incomplete\n\n- Location: `backend/src/yinshi/services/workspace_replica_publication.py:450-529,912-974`\n- Impact: Final directory ownership and mode are checked only before awaited verification.\n- Impact: File ownership is also absent from `_recheck_pinned_regular`.\n- Impact: A directory changed to `0777` during verification can still receive an inspection or publication receipt.\n- Correction: Record and recheck directory type, identity, ownership, mode, and entries. Record and recheck file ownership.\n- Validation: Pause verification, change directory mode or file group, then resume. Both inspection and publication must reject or remain unresolved.\n- Remediation: `worker-advanced`\n\n### 3. High: rename-state inspection errors become safe rejection\n\n- Location: `backend/src/yinshi/services/workspace_replica_publication.py:671-692,840-859,879-882`\n- Impact: `_rename_state` catches only `FileNotFoundError`.\n- Impact: Another `OSError` escapes while `moved` remains false. Outer handling then reports `ReplicaPublicationRejectedError`.\n- Impact: Caller may retry as safe although rename might have completed.\n- Correction: Treat every identity-inspection failure as `unknown`. Only return rejection after confirmed matching pending state and absent final state.\n- Validation: Move final, raise helper failure, then fail one identity lookup. Result must be unresolved with final state retained.\n- Remediation: `worker-advanced`\n\n### 4. High: cleanup directory removal is not identity-bound\n\n- Location: `backend/src/yinshi/services/workspace_replica_publication.py:630-665`\n- Impact: Code checks pending pathname before opening it, but never compares opened directory identity with `pending_identity`.\n- Impact: It closes directory descriptor before pathname-based `rmdir`.\n- Impact: Concurrent replacement can redirect unlink checks or remove a foreign empty directory.\n- Correction: Verify opened directory identity. Quarantine it atomically under retained root authority before deletion. Revalidate every name before destructive removal.\n- Validation: Swap pending directory between stat and open. Also swap it before `rmdir`. Foreign state must remain and outcome must be unresolved.\n- Remediation: `worker-advanced`\n\n### 5. Medium: malformed declaration version still passes validation\n\n- Location: `backend/src/yinshi/services/workspace_replica_publication.py:229-260`\n- Impact: `version=2.0` passes because equality is checked without exact type validation.\n- Impact: Other objects equal to `2` can reach canonicalization or execute custom equality behavior.\n- Correction: Require `type(declaration.version) is int and declaration.version == 2` before other access.\n- Validation: Test `2.0`, `2 + 0j`, and a custom equality object. Each must raise `ReplicaPublicationRejectedError`.\n- Remediation: `worker`\n\n## Prior findings status\n\n- Resolved: distinct inspection receipt, bundled blob enforcement, direct pending reinspection, and expanded fault tests.\n- Partially resolved: stale-state checks, rename classification, cleanup ownership, and malformed type validation.\n- Test coverage improved. It does not cover root substitution, late metadata changes, identity-inspection failure, or cleanup swap races.\n\n## Required checks after remediation\n\n```bash\ncd backend\npytest -q tests/test_workspace_replica_publication.py\npytest -q \\\n  tests/test_workspace_replica_artifact.py \\\n  tests/test_workspace_replica_bundle.py \\\n  tests/test_workspace_replica_object_pack.py\nmypy src/yinshi/services/workspace_replica_publication.py\nruff check src/yinshi/services/workspace_replica_publication.py tests/test_workspace_replica_publication.py\nruff format --check src/yinshi/services/workspace_replica_publication.py tests/test_workspace_replica_publication.py\n```\n\nNo unanswered material questions. Remediation remains required.","controlEvents":[{"type":"active_long_running","to":"active_long_running","ts":1789244309580,"runId":"0530e84a","agent":"final-review","index":0,"message":"final-review is still active but long-running","reason":"time_threshold","turns":6,"tokens":152436,"toolCount":31,"elapsedMs":240621}],"attemptedModels":["openai-codex/gpt-5.6-sol:max"],"modelAttempts":[{"model":"openai-codex/gpt-5.6-sol:max","success":true,"exitCode":0,"usage":{"input":155692,"output":16895,"cacheRead":144896,"cacheWrite":0,"cost":1.3577580000000002,"turns":7}}],"sessionFile":"/Users/user/.pi/agent/sessions/--Users-user-projects-yinshi--/2026-09-04T04-44-52-550Z_01a06abb-dfc5-7c65-82bb-7c5f2081ee64/0530e84a/run-0/session.jsonl","acceptance":{"status":"attested","evidenceStatus":"attested","explicit":false,"effectiveAcceptance":{"level":"attested","explicit":false,"inferredReason":["read-only task wording"],"criteria":[{"id":"criterion-1","must":"Return concrete findings with file paths and severity when applicable","evidence":["review-findings","residual-risks"],"severity":"required"}],"evidence":["review-findings","residual-risks"],"verify":[],"stopRules":[]},"inferredReason":["read-only task wording"],"criteria":[{"id":"criterion-1","must":"Return concrete findings with file paths and severity when applicable","evidence":["review-findings","residual-risks"],"severity":"required"}],"runtimeChecks":[],"verifyRuns":[],"childReport":{"criteriaSatisfied":[{"id":