ss. Strict source mypy passed before last test-only edits. Ruff and format will run after review.\nInspect current code. Report each finding with severity, location, impact, correction, validation, and remediation. If none remain, state no remediation needed. Do not edit.","status":"completed","createdAt":"2026-09-12T20:14:28.674Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-12T20:22:29.385Z","runs":[{"runId":"call_hyVqUFOujLgrA9dltoueZkFA|fc_0212e7de83dbbd32016aa5b29c0b1887d0b69c821de7ff80da","mode":"workflow","agent":"final-review","status":"completed","startedAt":"2026-09-12T20:22:29.385Z","completedAt":"2026-09-12T20:22:29.385Z","usage":{"tokens":172587}}],"decisions":[],"artifacts":[{"kind":"output","path":"/Users/user/projects/yinshi/.pi-subagents/artifacts/0530e84a_final-review_0_output.md"},{"kind":"other","path":"/Users/user/projects/yinshi/.pi-subagents/artifacts/0530e84a_final-review_0_transcript.jsonl","description":"Child transcript"}],"receipts":[],"cwd":"/Users/user/projects/yinshi","ownerSessionId":"/Users/user/.pi/agent/sessions/--Users-user-projects-yinshi--/2026-09-04T04-44-52-550Z_01a06abb-dfc5-7c65-82bb-7c5f2081ee64.jsonl","summary":"Workflow completed.\n\nReturn:\n{\n  \"key\": \"artifact-set-publication-corrected-review\",\n  \"ok\": true,\n  \"runId\": \"0530e84a\",\n  \"output\": \"Review blocked. Trusted `software-design` skill content guided review. Five findings remain.\\n\\n## Findings\\n\\n### 1. Blocker: final inspection can switch publication authority\\n\\n- Location: `backend/src/yinshi/services/workspace_replica_publication.py:730-870,886-980`\\n- Impact: `_inspect_final` reopens `self._root` instead of using retained, synchronized root descriptor.\\n- Impact: It never requires final directory identity to equal pending directory identity.\\n- Impact: Root or final replacement can produce a receipt for storage atomic helper never moved or synchronized.\\n- Correction: Inspect through retained root descriptor. Require final identity to equal `pending_ident