{"type":"message","id":"97d02971","parentId":"e4c8fa48","timestamp":"2026-09-12T20:34:47.407Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","thinkingSignature":"{\"id\":\"rs_0212e7de83dbbd32016aa5b75e5df087d0a33b4b8b50ec0a28\",\"type\":\"reasoning\",\"content\":[],\"encrypted_content\":\"REDACTED\",\"summary\":[]}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_YMr8L4piK9PCXc9LKDzSVhcO|fc_0212e7de83dbbd32016aa5b75efc3887d092f89a87b53814af","name":"subagent","arguments":{"workflowScript":"return runs.run('artifact-set-publication-clearance', {agent:'final-review', task:[\n  'Read-only final corrected review. Use software-design.',\n  'Review current workspace_replica_publication.py and its tests. Prior review 0530e84a had five findings.',\n  'Dispositions:',\n  '1. Publication now passes retained root descriptor, original root identity, and staged directory identity into final inspection. It requires exact final identity and rechecks root pathname plus descriptor before minting.',\n  '2. After awaited verification, it rechecks final directory type, identity, owner, group, mode, and entries. It rechecks file descriptor plus name identity, type, owner, group, mode, link count, length, and bytes.',\n  '3. Rename-state returns unknown on any non-absence identity lookup error. Only confirmed matching pending plus absent final permits safe rejection.',\n  '4. Cleanup first uses atomic no-replace rename to a fixed abandoned quarantine under retained root identity. It verifies opened quarantine and every file against recorded identities before deletion. It retains the empty owned quarantine directory, avoiding pathname-based directory deletion. Swapped foreign state remains untouched and unresolved.',\n  '5. Declaration version requires exact int before equality.',\n  'Tests cover root and final swaps during final await, late directory mode change, unknown rename-state lookup, cleanup swap, float/complex/custom version values, plus prior cases.',\n  'Validation: