{"type":"message","id":"841050c3","parentId":"97d02971","timestamp":"2026-09-12T20:43:14.146Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_YMr8L4piK9PCXc9LKDzSVhcO|fc_0212e7de83dbbd32016aa5b75efc3887d092f89a87b53814af","toolName":"subagent","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Workflow completed.\n\nReturn:\n{\n  \"key\": \"artifact-set-publication-clearance\",\n  \"ok\": true,\n  \"runId\": \"2e95fc05\",\n  \"output\": \"Review blocked. Three findings remain. Trusted `software-design` content guided review.\\n\\n## Findings\\n\\n### 1. High: cleanup can delete swapped foreign files\\n\\n- Location: `backend/src/yinshi/services/workspace_replica_publication.py:650-708`, `_cleanup_pending`\\n- Impact: Code validates all file identities before unlinking them in a later loop.\\n- Impact: A file replaced after its check can be unlinked without validating its new identity.\\n- Correction: Treat atomic quarantine as cleanup completion. Retain quarantined contents instead of unlinking mutable names.\\n- Validation: Swap an already-checked file while another file is checked. Foreign file must remain, with an unresolved result.\\n- Remediation: `worker-advanced`\\n\\n### 2. High: non-regular entries can block inspection\\n\\n- Location: `backend/src/yinshi/services/workspace_replica_publication.py:448-530`, `_open_pinned_regular`\\n- Impact: `os.open(..., O_RDONLY)` occurs before type validation.\\n- Impact: Opening a FIFO without a writer blocks the event loop. Cancellation and rejection cannot proceed.\\n- Correction: Add `O_NONBLOCK` before opening untrusted entries. Validate regular-file type before reading.\\n- Validation: Replace an artifact with a FIFO. Inspection must reject promptly without a writer.\\n- Remediation: `worker-advanced`\\n\\n### 3. High: publication-root mode policy conflicts\\n\\n- Location: `backend/src/yinshi/services/workspace_replica_publication.py:364-393`, `_root_identity`\\n- Location: `backend/src/yinshi/services/workspace_replica_publication.py:1020-1070`, `_inspect_final`\\n- Impact: Initial validation accepts modes such as `0755`, since they lack group or other write bits.\\n- Impact: Final inspection requires exactly `0700`. Publication can become visible before returning unresolved every time.\\n- Correction: Define one root-mode invariant. Enforce it before staging and recheck the same invariant after verification.\\n- Validation: Test a `0755` root. It must either fail before effects or succeed under a consistently supported policy.\\n- Remediation: `worker`\\n\\n## Prior findings\\n\\n- Resolved: retained root and final identities.\\n- Resolved: late final directory and file rechecks.\\n- Resolved: unknown rename-state lookup handling.\\n- Partially resolved: cleanup quarantine ownership. File deletion still has a race.\\n- Resolved: exact integer version validation.\\n\\n## Required checks after remediation\\n\\n```bash\\ncd backend\\npytest -q tests/test_workspace_replica_publication.py\\nruff check src/yinshi/services/workspace_replica_publication.py tests/test_workspace_replica_publication.py\\nruff format --check src/yinshi/services/workspace_replica_publication.py tests/test_workspace_replica_publication.py\\nmypy src/yinshi/services/workspace_replica_publication.py\\npython -m py_compile src/yinshi/services/workspace_replica_publication.py tests/test_workspace_replica_publication.py\\ngit diff --check\\n```\\n\\nAdd targeted FIFO, cleanup interleaving, and root-mode tests. Reported 141 tests do not cover these cases.\\n\\nNo unanswered material questions. Remediation remains required.\",\n  \"artifactPaths\": [\n    \"/Users/user/.pi/agent/sessions/--Users-user-projects-yinshi--/2026-09-04T04-44-52-550Z_01a06abb-dfc5-7c65-82bb-7c5f2081ee64/2e95fc05/run-0/session.jsonl\"\n  ],\n  \"results\": [\n    {\n      \"index\": 0,\n      \"agent\": \"final-review\",\n      \"task\": \"Read-only final corrected review. Use software-design.\\nReview current workspace_replica_publication.py and its