on, remediation. If none remain, state no remediation needed. Do not edit.","routingContract":{"version":1,"agent":"final-review","model":"openai-codex/gpt-5.6-sol","thinking":"max","policyDigest":"8590d2fc0420152aad3f867aba1c18a56b3632f2d90e01d30d3f04676cd46ac5"},"launchContractDigest":"e5802f890735ae6b426cb6a8817deee794eb08bcb8652577e48444d56dc717b7","launchResolvedExtensions":{"version":1,"source":"launch-resolved","disableAmbientExtensions":false,"runtime":["sha256:cb00ccf63b7cf9f4"],"configured":[],"effective":["sha256:cb00ccf63b7cf9f4"],"omitted":{"runtime":0,"configured":0,"effective":0}},"exitCode":0,"outputState":"present","usage":{"input":108772,"output":16952,"cacheRead":29184,"cacheWrite":0,"cost":1.067012,"turns":5},"model":"openai-codex/gpt-5.6-sol:max","thinking":"max","artifactPaths":{"inputPath":"/Users/user/projects/yinshi/.pi-subagents/artifacts/2e95fc05_final-review_0_input.md","outputPath":"/Users/user/projects/yinshi/.pi-subagents/artifacts/2e95fc05_final-review_0_output.md","jsonlPath":"/Users/user/projects/yinshi/.pi-subagents/artifacts/2e95fc05_final-review_0.jsonl","transcriptPath":"/Users/user/projects/yinshi/.pi-subagents/artifacts/2e95fc05_final-review_0_transcript.jsonl","metadataPath":"/Users/user/projects/yinshi/.pi-subagents/artifacts/2e95fc05_final-review_0_meta.json"},"transcriptPath":"/Users/user/projects/yinshi/.pi-subagents/artifacts/2e95fc05_final-review_0_transcript.jsonl","skills":["software-design"],"turnBudget":{"maxTurns":7,"graceTurns":2,"outcome":"within-budget","turnCount":5},"toolBudget":{"hard":40,"soft":26,"block":["read","grep","find","ls"],"toolCount":26,"outcome":"soft-reached","softReachedAt":26},"context":"fresh","progressSummary":{"toolCount":26,"tokens":125724,"durationMs":506085},"effects":{"fileMutation":{"status":"not-applicable","expected":false,"attempted":false}},"outputMode":"inline","finalOutput":"Review blocked. Three findings remain. Trusted `software-design` content guided review.\n\n## Findings\n\n### 1. High: cleanup can delete swapped foreign files\n\n- Location: `backend/src/yinshi/services/workspace_replica_publication.py:650-708`, `_cleanup_pending`\n- Impact: Code validates all file identities before unlinking them in a later loop.\n- Impact: A file replaced after its check can be unlinked without validating its new identity.\n- Correction: Treat atomic quarantine as cleanup completion. Retain quarantined contents instead of unlinking mutable names.\n- Validation: Swap an already-checked file while another file is checked. Foreign file must remain, with an unresolved result.\n- Remediation: `worker-advanced`\n\n### 2. High: non-regular entries can block inspection\n\n- Location: `backend/src/yinshi/services/workspace_replica_publication.py:448-530`, `_open_pinned_regular`\n- Impact: `os.open(..., O_RDONLY)` occurs before type validation.\n- Impact: Opening a FIFO without a writer blocks the event loop. Cancellation and rejection cannot proceed.\n- Correction: Add `O_NONBLOCK` before opening untrusted entries. Validate regular-file type before reading.\n- Validation: Replace an artifact with a FIFO. Inspection must reject promptly without a writer.\n- Remediation: `worker-advanced`\n\n### 3. High: publication-root mode policy conflicts\n\n- Location: `backend/src/yinshi/services/workspace_replica_publication.py:364-393`, `_root_identity`\n- Location: `backend/src/yinshi/services/workspace_replica_publication.py:1020-1070`, `_inspect_final`\n- Impact: Initial validation accepts modes such as `0755`, since they lack group or other write bits.\n- Impact: Final inspection requires exactly `0700`. Publication can become visible before returning unresolved every time.\n- Correction: Define one root-mode invariant. Enforce it before staging and recheck the same invariant after verification.\n- Validation: Test a `0755` root. It must either fail before effects or succeed under a consistently supported policy.\n- Remediation: `worker`\n\n## Prior findings\n\n- Resolved: retained root and final identities.\n- Resolved: late final directory and file rechecks.\n- Resolved: unknown rename-state lookup handling.\n- Partially resolved: cleanup quarantine ownership. File deletion still has a race.\n- Resolved: exact integer version validation.\n\n## Required checks after remediation\n\n```bash\ncd backend\npytest -q tests/test_workspace_replica_publication.py\nruff check src/yinshi/services/workspace_replica_publication.py tests/test_workspace_replica_publication.py\nruff format --check src/yinshi/services/workspace_replica_publication.py tests/test_workspace_replica_publication.py\nmypy src/yinshi/services/workspace_replica_publication.py\npython -m py_compile src/yinshi/services/workspace_replica_publication.py tests/test_workspace_replica_publication.py\ngit diff --check\n```\n\nAdd targeted FIFO, cleanup interleaving, and root-mode tests. Reported 141 tests do not cover these cases.\n\nNo unanswered material questions. Remediation remains required.","controlEvents":[{"type":"active_long_running","to":"active_long_running","ts":1789245527843,"runId":"2e95fc05","agent":"final-review","index":0,"message":"final-review is still active but long-running","reason":"time_threshold","turns":4,"tokens":49736,"toolCount":26,"elapsedMs":240005}],"attemptedModels":["openai-codex/gpt-5.6-sol:max"],"modelAttempts":[{"model":"openai-codex/gpt-5.6-sol:max","success":true,"exitCode":0,"usage":{"input":108772,"output":16952,"cacheRead":29184,"cacheWrite":0,"cost":1.067012,"turns":5}}],"sessionFile":"/Users/user/.pi/agent/sessions/--Users-user-projects-yinshi--/2026-09-04T04-44-52-550Z_01a06abb-dfc5-7c65-82bb-7c5f2081ee64/2e95fc05/run-0/session.jsonl","acceptance":{"status":"attested","evidenceStatus":"attested","explicit":false,"effectiveAcceptance":{"level":"attested","explicit":false,"inferredReason":["read-only task wording"],"criteria":[{"id":"criterion-1","must":"Return concrete findings with file paths and severity when applicable","eviden