annot proceed.\n- Correction: Add `O_NONBLOCK` before opening untrusted entries. Validate regular-file type before reading.\n- Validation: Replace an artifact with a FIFO. Inspection must reject promptly without a writer.\n- Remediation: `worker-advanced`\n\n### 3. High: publication-root mode policy conflicts\n\n- Location: `backend/src/yinshi/services/workspace_replica_publication.py:364-393`, `_root_identity`\n- Location: `backend/src/yinshi/services/workspace_replica_publication.py:1020-1070`, `_inspect_final`\n- Impact: Initial validation accepts modes such as `0755`, since they lack group or other write bits.\n- Impact: Final inspection requires exactly `0700`. Publication can become visible before returning unresolved every time.\n- Correction: Define one root-mode invariant. Enforce it before staging and recheck the same invariant after verification.\n- Validation: Test a `0755` root. It must either fail before effects or succeed under a consistently supported policy.\n- Remediation: `worker`\n\n## Prior findings\n\n- Resolved: retained root and final identities.\n- Resolved: late final directory and file rechecks.\n- Resolved: unknown rename-state lookup handling.\n- Partially resolved: cleanup quarantine ownership. File deletion still has a race.\n- Resolved: exact integer version validation.\n\n## Required checks after remediation\n\n```bash\ncd backend\npytest -q tests/test_workspace_replica_publication.py\nruff check src/yinshi/services/workspace_replica_publication.py tests/test_workspace_replica_publication.py\nruff format --check src/yinshi/services/workspace_replica_publication.py tests/test_workspace_replica_publication.py\nmypy src/yinshi/services/workspace_replica_publication.py\npython -m py_compile src/yinshi/services/workspace_replica_publication.py tests/test_workspace_replica_publication.py\ngit diff --check\n```\n\nAdd targeted FIFO, cleanup interleaving, and root-mode tests. Reported 141 tests do not cover these cases.\n\nNo unanswered material questions. Remediation remains required.","controlEvents":[{"type":"active_long_running","to":"active_long_running","ts":1789245527843,"runId":"2e95fc05","agent":"final-review","index":0,"message":"final-review is still active but long-running","reason":"time_threshold","turns":4,"tokens":49736,"toolCount":26,"elapsedMs":240005}],"attemptedModels":["openai-codex/gpt-5.6-sol:max"],"modelAttempts":[{"model":"openai-codex/gpt-5.6-sol:max","success":true,"exitCode":0,"usage":{"input":108772,"output":16952,"cacheRead":29184,"cacheWrite":0,"cost":1.067012,"turns":5}}],"sessionFile":"/Users/user/.pi/agent/sessions/--Users-user-projects-yinshi--/2026-09-04T04-44-52-550Z_01a06abb-dfc5-7c65-82bb-7c5f2081ee64/2e95fc05/run-0/session.jsonl","acceptance":{"status":"attested","evidenceStatus":"attested","explicit":false,"effectiveAcceptance":{"level":"attested","explicit":false,"inferredReason":["read-only task wording"],"criteria":[{"id":"criterion-1","must":"Return concrete findings with file paths and severity when applicable","evidence":["review-findings","residual-risks"],"severity":"required"}],"evidence":["review-findings","residual-risks"],"verify":[],"stopRules":[]},"inferredReason":["read-only task wording"],"criteria":[{"id":"criterion-1","must":"Return concrete findings with file paths and severity when applicable","evidence":["review-findings","residual-risks"],"severity":"required"}],"runtimeChecks":[],"verifyRuns":[],"childReport":{"criteriaSatisfied":[{"id":"criterion-1","status":"satisfied","evidence":"Three concrete high-severity findings include paths, locations, impact, corrections, validation, and worker tiers."}],"changedFiles":["backend/src/yinshi/services/workspace_replica_publication.py","backend/tests/test_workspace_replica_publication.py"],"testsAddedOrUpdated":["backend/tests/test_workspace_replica_publication.py"],"commandsRun":[{"command":"git status --short --branch && git diff --stat && git diff --cached --stat","result":"passed","summary":"Can