{"type":"message","id":"e7f7a59c","parentId":"d41f5f2d","timestamp":"2026-09-12T21:21:47.840Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_0WmoVZQg3GsOqmh1QuLJgLyA|fc_0212e7de83dbbd32016aa5c26afab487d0894c39f86582d8e5","toolName":"subagent","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Transcript target: run ec7ce656\nSpawn budget: unlimited\nRun: ec7ce656\nState: completed\nChild: 0 (worker-advanced)\nSession: /Users/user/.pi/agent/sessions/--Users-user-projects-yinshi--/2026-09-04T04-44-52-550Z_01a06abb-dfc5-7c65-82bb-7c5f2081ee64/ec7ce656/run-0/session.jsonl\nTranscript: /Users/user/projects/yinshi/.pi-subagents/artifacts/ec7ce656_worker-advanced_0_transcript.jsonl\nOutput: /Users/user/projects/yinshi/.pi-subagents/artifacts/ec7ce656_worker-advanced_0_output.md\nResult transcript tail:\n      if stage == \"verify\" and isinstance(receipt, VerifyReceipt):\n          if (\n              receipt.bundle_sha256 != expected_bundle.sha256\n              or receipt.worktree_sha256 != expected_worktree.sha256\n              or receipt.index_objects_sha256 != expected_index_objects.sha256\n              or receipt.source_state_sha256 != payload[\"source_state_sha256\"]\n              or receipt.reconciliation_fingerprint != payload[\"reconciliation_fingerprint\"]\n              or receipt.artifact_set_sha256 != expected_artifact_set\n          ):\n              raise ValueError(\"replica verification receipt conflicts with accepted state\")\n          return\n      if stage == \"publish\" and isinstance(receipt, PublishReceipt):\n          if (\n              receipt.physical_target_id != authority.physical_target_id\n              or receipt.replica_generation != authority.replica_generation\n              or receipt.artifact_set_sha256 != expected_artifact_set\n          ):\n              raise ValueError(\"replica publication receipt conflicts with authority\")\n          return\n      if (\n          stage == \"admission\"\n          and isinstance(receipt, AdmissionReceipt)\n          and receipt.execution_owner_id != authority.execution_owner_id\n      ):\n          raise ValueError(\"replica admission receipt conflicts with authority\")\n  >>>>>>> new\n  ```\n  Notes on contract preservation: SQL schema, `REPLICA_JOURNAL_SCHEMA_VERSION = 1`, stage order (`_STAGES`), transition triggers, response-frame validation, commit-uncertainty/recovery path, and idempotency keying are untouched. Replay of old forms fails closed because `_replay` → `_request_from_frame` → `_validate_replica_payload` revalidates the stored accepted frame, and `_validate_receipt` revalidates stored receipts; both raise before any decision, and `_validate` wraps the failure as `ReplicaJournalSyncError`. No bytes/nested inline content path is added: receipts remain canonical bounded JSON (≤ 2048 bytes) of tokens/digests/lengths only.\n  ### Part D — Green run + checks\n  ```bash\n  cd backend && venv/bin/python -m pytest tests/test_broker_replica_journal.py -q   # expect: 37 passed\n  ruff check src/yinshi/services/broker_replica_journal.py tests/test_broker_replica_journal.py\n  ruff format --check src/yinshi/services/broker_replica_journal.py tests/test_broker_replica_journal.py\n  venv/bin/python -m mypy src/yinshi/services/broker_replica_journal.py            # strict via pyproject\n  venv/bin/python -m py_compile src/yinshi/services/broker_replica_journal.py tests/test_broker_replica_journal.py\n  git status --short && git diff --cached --name-only                              # expect: no staged files; only pre-existing unrelated changes + the 2 untracked files\n  ```\n  ## Unresolved questions\n  1. **artifact_set_sha256 ownership/derivation** (see design decision above): packet derives broker-side over `[bundle, worktree, index_objects]` in fixed lifecycle order. If the application must supply it, the payload contract must be widened by the parent.\n  2. Old-form journals become unreadable after this change (fail-closed by design, consistent with \"module is not yet released\" + \"reject during replay\"); confirm no deployment holds pre-contract journals."}],"details":{"mode":"single","results":[],"spawnBudget":{"used":0,"configuredLimit":null,"granted":0,"limit":null,"remaining":null,"grantRemaining":null,"grantHistory":[]}},"isError":false,"timestamp":1789248107840}}
