F, 0600 regular files, link count one, owner, descriptor/name identity. File and directory sync precede atomic no-replace rename. Exact retry consumes and verifies all bytes. Failure quarantines owned pending state without deleting contents. Cancellation waits for blocking writes before descriptor close, then quarantines. Opened descriptor context permits post-await recheck.\nRed: missing module. Current: 47 artifact-store+journal tests passed. Ruff lint passes. Format was corrected after reported diffs. Strict mypy, py_compile, and diff check pass.\nInspect current files. Find races, cancellation faults, descriptor leaks, classification errors, blocking event-loop paths, unbounded allocations, path attacks, replay gaps, or API contract issues. Report every finding with severity, location, impact, correction, validation, and remediation. If none, state no remediation needed. Do not edit.","status":"completed","createdAt":"2026-09-12T21:59:28.891Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-12T22:09:22.236Z","runs":[{"runId":"call_I14EaNVdYpUS3Hf9EEAowz8l|fc_0212e7de83dbbd32016aa5cb364dec87d0acad3af8a5f43f51","mode":"workflow","agent":"final-review","status":"completed","startedAt":"2026-09-12T22:09:22.235Z","completedAt":"2026-09-12T22:09:22.235Z","usage":{"tokens":194723}}],"decisions":[],"artifacts":[{"kind":"output","path":"/Users/user/projects/yinshi/.pi-subagents/artifacts/d2ea7e81_final-review_0_output.md"},{"kind":"other","path":"/Users/user/projects/yinshi/.pi-subagents/artifacts/d2ea7e81_final-review_0_transcript.jsonl","description":"Child transcript"}],"receipts":[],"cwd":"/Users/user/projects/yinshi","ownerSessionId":"/Users/user/.pi/agent/sessions/--Users-user-projects-yinshi--/2026-09-04T04-44-52-550Z_01a06abb-dfc5-7c65-82bb-7c5f2081ee64.jsonl","summary":"Workflow completed.\n\nReturn:\n{\n  \"key\": \"broker-artifact-store-review\",\n  \"ok\": true,\n  \"runId\": \"d2ea7e81\",\n  \"output\": \"Turn budget wrap-up was requested after 8 assistant turns (soft limit 8, grace 2). Process-mode live steering is unavailable, so the child was warned at launch to wrap up by this budget. Output may be partial.\\n\\nReview blocked. Ten findings remain. No files changed.\\n\\n## Review findings\\n\\n### F1. High: Attempt state can publish one outcome, then report another\\n\\nLocation: `backend/src/yinshi/services/broker_artifact_store.py:436-469`\\n\\n- Rename collision quarantines at line 445.\\n- Raised collision reaches the outer rejection handler.\\n- Outer handler quarantines the same missing pending directory again.\\n- Successful publication leaves `pending_identity` active.\\n- Cancellation during final inspection then tries to quarantine the already-published source.\\n\\nImpact: Confirmed collision becomes unresolved. Post-publication cancellation can leave durable files while replacing `CancelledError` with an unresolved error.\\n\\nCorrection: Model attempt state explicitly as live, quarantined, or published. Centralize cleanup. Mark state immediately after each rename.\\n\\nValidation: Inject a late publication collision. Cancel during final inspection. Assert one durable outcome and one quarantine attempt.\\n\\nRemediation: `worker-advanced`.\\n\\n### F2. Medium: Quarantine is neither repeat-safe nor complete\\n\\nLocation: `backend/src/yinshi/services/broker_artifact_store.py:340-358, 389-405`\\n\\nQuarantine always targets `.<operation>.pending.abandoned`. A second failed attempt collides with the first quarantine.\\n\\nAn error after `mkdir` but before `pending_identity` assignment leaves `.pending` unquarantined.\\n\\nImpact: Failed retries leave live pending state. Later attempts collide permanently.\\n\\nCorrection: Use broker-generated unique quarantine names. Track created state before reopening it. Quarantine through verified descriptor-relative identity....","acceptance":{"status":"rejected","evidenceStatus":"rejected","explicit":false,"effectiveAcceptance":{"level":"attested","explicit":false,"inferredReason":["read-only task wording"],"criteria":[{"id":"criterion-1","must":"Return concrete findings with file paths and severity when applicable","evidence":["review-findings","residual-risks"],"severity":"required"}],"evidence":["review-findings","residual-risks"],"verify":[],"stopRules":[]},"inferredReason":["read-only task wording"],"criteria":[{"id":"criterion-1","must":"Return concrete findings with file paths and severity when applicable","evidence":["review-findings","residual-risks"],"severity":"required"}],"runtimeChecks":[{"id":"attestation","status":"failed","message":"Failed to parse acceptance-report: Invalid acceptance-report: commandsRun[0].notes: unsupported acceptance command field; commandsRun[1].notes: unsupported acceptance command field; commandsRun[2].notes: unsupported acceptance command field; commandsRun[3].notes: unsupported acceptance command field; commandsRun[0].summary: expected non-empty string; got missing; commandsRun[1].summary: expected non-empty string; got missing; commandsRun[2].summary: expected non-empty string; got missing; commandsRun[3].summary: expected non-empty string; got missing"}],"verifyRuns":[],"childReportParseError":"Failed to parse acceptance-report: Invalid acceptance-report: commandsRun[0].notes: unsupported acceptance command field; commandsRun[1].notes: unsupported acceptance command field; commandsRun[2].notes: unsupported acceptance command field; commandsRun[3].notes: unsupported acceptance command field; commandsRun[0].summary: expected non-empty string; got missing; commandsRun[1].summary: expected non-empty string; got missing; commandsRun[2].summary: expected non-empty string; got missing; commandsRun[3].summary: expected non-empty string; got missing"}}},"isError":false,"timestamp":1789250962448}}
