 \"text\": \"read ~/projects/yinshi/backend/src/yinshi/services/broker_artifact_store.py\",\n          \"expandedText\": \"read ~/projects/yinshi/backend/src/yinshi/services/broker_artifact_store.py\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"read ~/projects/yinshi/.pi-subagents/artifacts/d2ea7e81_final-review_0_output.md\",\n          \"expandedText\": \"read ~/projects/yinshi/.pi-subagents/artifacts/d2ea7e81_final-review_0_output.md\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"read ~/projects/yinshi/.pi-subagents/artifacts/0f8a34af_final-review_0_output.md\",\n          \"expandedText\": \"read ~/projects/yinshi/.pi-subagents/artifacts/0f8a34af_final-review_0_output.md\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"read ~/Downloads/yinshi-thread-orchestration-plan.md\",\n          \"expandedText\": \"read ~/Downloads/yinshi-thread-orchestration-plan.md\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"read ~/projects/yinshi/backend/src/yinshi/services/replica_artifact_contract.py\",\n          \"expandedText\": \"read ~/projects/yinshi/backend/src/yinshi/services/replica_artifact_contract.py\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"$ cd backend && git status --short -- src/yinshi/services/brok...\",\n          \"expandedText\": \"$ cd backend && git status --short -- src/yinshi/services/broker_artifact_store.py src/yinshi/services/broker_replica_journal.py src/yinshi/services/replica_artifact_contract.py src/yinshi/services/workspace_replica_publication.py tests/test_...\"\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  ]\n}\n\nCall trace:\n- run artifact-final-review-2: started\n- run artifact-final-review-2: completed (763ded31) in 1058710ms\nMission: 3406268d-5c77-4907-a89d-95b8c7ab3443 (completed)"}],"details":{"mode":"workflow","runId":"call_VrbPCeceHsoHuTKwXqO13bUA|fc_0212e7de83dbbd32016aa5dadd98e487d0951417a01ba78984","results":[{"index":0,"agent":"final-review","task":"[Read from: /Users/user/projects/yinshi/backend/src/yinshi/services/broker_artifact_store.py, /Users/user/projects/yinshi/backend/src/yinshi/services/broker_replica_journal.py, /Users/user/projects/yinshi/backend/src/yinshi/services/replica_artifact_contract.py, /Users/user/projects/yinshi/backend/src/yinshi/services/workspace_replica_publication.py, /Users/user/projects/yinshi/backend/tests/test_broker_artifact_store.py, /Users/user/projects/yinshi/backend/tests/test_broker_replica_journal.py, /Users/user/projects/yinshi/backend/tests/test_workspace_replica_publication.py]\n\nLoad /Users/user/.pi/agent/skills/software-design/SKILL.md and references/red-flags.md in full.\nRead-only final review of current broker artifact milestone. Do not modify files. Files are untracked, so inspect file contents directly rather than relying on git diff.\nScope: backend/src/yinshi/services/broker_artifact_store.py, broker_replica_journal.py, replica_artifact_contract.py, workspace_replica_publication.py and three matching test files.\nContract: exact three artifacts; fixed names; no bytes in SQLite; bounded streams with idle plus absolute deadlines; 0700 root/directories; 0600 regular single-link files; descriptor and named identity checks; atomic no-replace; unique retained quarantine; restart attempt reconciliation; post-publication interruption unresolved; configured immutable limit profile shared by journal and publication; canonical artifact set includes authority, references, source, fingerprint, object format, and limit profile; fail-closed replay; no SQLite handle across external effects or await.\nCurrent checks: 79 focused tests pass. Ruff lint, strict mypy, and py_compile pass. Formatter will be rerun after two manual line changes.\nReview correctness, security, crash states, cancellation, restart behavior, resource closure, bounds, and design information ownership. Reassess prior ten findings.\nFor each finding give file and line, impact, exact correction, and validation. Mark blockers versus optional hardening. If none remain, explicitly state no remediation is needed. Keep response focused.","routingContract":{"version":1,"agent":"final-review","model":"openai-codex/gpt-5.6-sol","thinking":"max","policyDigest":"8590d2fc0420152aad3f867aba1c18a56b3632f2d90e01d30d3f04676cd46ac5"},"launchContractDigest":"8e276d6198f04902c763528572f60feb7273444f7344010558cc07ff983696b2","launchResolvedExtensions":{"version":1,"source":"launch-resolved","disableAmbientExtensions":false,"runtime":["sha256:cb00ccf63b7cf9f4"],"configured":[],"effective":["sha256:cb00ccf63b7cf9f4"],"omitted":{"runtime":0,"configured":0,"effective":0}},"exitCode":0,"outputState":"present","usage":{"input":224270,"output":32589,"cacheRead":42112,"cacheWrite":0,"cost":2.120076,"turns":6},"model":"openai-codex/gpt-5.6-sol:max","thinking":"max","artifactPaths":{"inputPath":"/Users/user/projects/yinshi/.pi-subagents/artifacts/763ded31_final-review_0_input.md","outputPath":"/Users/user/projects/yinshi/.pi-subagents/artifacts/763ded31_final-review_0_output.md","jsonlPath":"/Users/user/projects/yinshi/.pi-subagents/artifacts/763ded31_final-review_0.jsonl","transcriptPath":"/Users/user/projects/yinshi/.pi-subagents/artifacts/763ded31_final-review_0_transcript.jsonl","metadataPath":"/Users/user/projects/yinshi/.pi-subagents/artifacts/763ded31_final-review_0_meta.json"},"transcriptPath":"/Users/user/projects/yinshi/.pi-subagents/artifacts/763ded31_final-review_0_transcript.jsonl","skills":["software-design"],"turnBudget":{"maxTurns":8,"graceTurns":2,"outcome":"within-budget","turnCount":6},"toolBudget":{"hard":40,"soft":25,"block":["read","grep","find","ls"],"toolCount":29,"outcome":"soft-reached","softReachedAt":25},"context":"fresh","processSignal":"SIGKILL","progressSummary":{"toolCount":29,"tokens":256859,"durationMs":1058489},"effects":{"fileMutation":{"status":"not-applicable","expected":false,"attempted":true}},"outputMode":"inline","finalOutput":"Review blocked. Six blockers remain. No files changed.\n\n## Confirmed blockers\n\n### 1. High: Failed attempt can retain blocking `.pending` state\n\nLocation: `backend/src/yinshi/services/broker_artifact_store.py:475-515,572-601`\n\n`attempt_state` becomes `live` before `pending_identity` exists. A `stat`, open, or `fstat` failure leaves cleanup unable to quarantine the directory.\n\nImpact: A retry collides with retained `.pending` state until separate reconciliation runs.\n\nCorrection: Use random per-attempt pending names. Establish descriptor identity before writing. Reconcile every recognized attempt name after restart.\n\nRemediation: `worker-advanced`\n\nValidation:\n\n- Inject failures after `mkdir`, named `stat`, open, and `fstat`.\n- Confirm no failed attempt blocks a retry.\n- Confirm uncertain state remains retained, never deleted.\n\n### 2. High: Restart reconciliation treats invalid final state as valid incoming state\n\nLocation:\n\n- `backend/src/yinshi/services/broker_artifact_store.py:798-876`\n- `backend/tests/test_broker_artifact_store.py:308-318`\n\nAny root entry matching an operation ID becomes `incoming_present`. The test confirms this using an empty directory.\n\nImpact: Restart logic can mistake a symlink, file, empty directory, or malformed artifact set for valid ingestion.\n\nCorrection: Reconcile against operation manifests. Verify final directories through pinned descriptors before returning an authoritative state. Otherwise return `unverified_final_present`.\n\nRemediation: `worker-advanced`\n\nValidation: Cover empty directories, symlinks, wrong modes, extra files, wrong digests, and valid exact sets.\n\n### 3. Medium: Cancellation during async acquisition lacks deterministic descriptor cleanup\n\nLocation: `backend/src/yinshi/services/broker_artifact_store.py:274-291,916-929`\n\n`_run_blocking(manager.__enter__)` discards its successful result when cancellation arrives. `manager.__exit__` is then never called explicitly.\n\nImpact: Pinned root, directory, and artifact descriptors can remain attached to context-manager finalization or retained cancellation tracebacks.\n\nCorrection: Await acquisition completion after cancellation. If acquisition succeeded, call `__exit__` before re-raising cancellation.\n\nRemediation: `worker-advanced`\n\nValidation: Pause `_inspect_named_set`, cancel acquisition, release it, then confirm descriptor counts return to baseline.\n\n### 4. High: Publication quarantine names are not unique\n\nLocation: `backend/src/yinshi/services/workspace_replica_publication.py:655-706`\n\n`_cleanup_pending` always uses `.<operation>.pending.abandoned`. A second failed publication collides with the retained first quarantine.\n\nImpact: Repeated failures become unresolved and can leave live pending state.\n\nCorrection: Add a cryptographically random suffix with bounded no-replace retries. Retain every quarantine.\n\nRemediation: `worker-advanced`\n\nValidation: Fail the same operation twice before visibility. Confirm two distinct quarantines and no live `.pending`.\n\n### 5. High: Replay accepts frames without cryptographic signature verification\n\nLocation:\n\n- `backend/src/yinshi/services/broker_replica_journal.py`, `_request_from_frame`, `_validate_request_frame`, `_validate_response_frame`, and `_replay`\n- `backend/tests/test_broker_replica_journal.py:168-186`\n\nRequest and response validation checks signature length only. Tests sign terminal responses with unrelated random keys, yet journal acceptance succeeds.\n\nImpact: Restart can replay a terminal frame that no trusted broker key authenticates. A request frame can also differ only by signature from its verified request object.\n\nCorrection: Accept verified frame envelopes instead of separate parsed objects and bytes. Persist signer identity. Verify historical signatures through a trusted keyring during replay.\n\nRemediation: `worker-expert`\n\nValidation:\n\n- Alter only a signature and update stored frame digest.\n- Confirm reopen fails.\n- Confirm valid historical keys survive restart.\n- Reject unknown signer identities and future key versions.\n\n### 6. Medium: Shared artifact contract still leaks policy across modules\n\nLocation:\n\n- `backend/src/yinshi/services/replica_artifact_contract.py:14-62`\n- `backend/src/yinshi/services/broker_artifact_store.py:24,48-101`\n- `backend/src/yinshi/services/broker_replica_journal.py`, `_token`, `_validate_replica_payload`, and journal metadata schema\n- `backend/src/yinshi/services/workspace_replica_publication.py:29,75-109,192-283,558-589`\n\nOnly digest calculation is shared. Identifier grammars differ. Duplicate artifact IDs are rejected by journal and ingestion, but publication accepts them.\n\nJournal metadata also omits the configured limit digest. An empty journal can reopen under a different profile.\n\nImpact: One module can accept authority that another rejects after artifact transfer. Limit-profile immutability depends on caller coordination.\n\nCorrection: Move identifiers, roles, media types, distinct-ID rules, and limit-profile identity into one contract module. Persist `limits_sha256` in journal metadata.\n\nRemediation: `worker-advanced`\n\nValidation:\n\n- Round-trip one declaration through journal, ingestion, and publication.\n- Apply the same invalid mutations to every boundary.\n- Reopen an empty journal under a different profile and require rejection.\n\n## Prior ten findings\n\nResolved: F1, F3, F4, F7, F8 broker paths, and F10 broker scanning.\n\nPartially resolved:\n\n- F2: unique quarantine exists, but pre-identity failures remain.\n- F5: journal recomputation exists, but shared policy still drifts.\n- F6: reconciliation exists, but final-state classification is not authoritative.\n- F9: direct post-open guards exist, but async acquisition cleanup remains incomplete.\n\nPost-publication cancellation now becomes unresolved as required.\n\n## Checks\n\nThis command ran against current untracked files:\n\n```text\ncd backend && pytest -q tests/test_broker_artifact_store.py tests/test_broker_replica_journal.py tests/test_workspace_replica_publication.py\n```\n\nResult: collection failed with three `ModuleNotFoundError` errors for `yinshi.services`. Therefore, reported 79 passing tests were not independently confirmed.\n\nRequired after correction:\n\n- Run focused tests in the configured project environment.\n- Run formatter after the two manual changes.\n- Repeat Ruff, strict mypy, and `py_compile`.\n- Add validations named under each finding.\n\n## Review limits\n\nAll seven scoped files were inspected directly. No production caller imports these new services, so end-to-end authority transfer remains unverified.\n\nPlan reading stopped at line 1973 due tool output limits. Lines 1974-2491 were unavailable before browsing stopped.\n\nRemediation is required.","controlEvents":[{"type":"active_long_running","to":"active_long_running","ts":1789254616741,"runId":"763ded31","agent":"final-review","index":0,"message":"final-review is still active but long-running","reason":"time_threshold","turns":5,"tokens":132836,"toolCount":29,"elapsedMs":240601}],"attemptedModels":["openai-codex/gpt-5.6-sol:max"],"modelAttempts":[{"model":"openai-codex/gpt-5.6-sol:max","success":true,"exitCode":0,"usage":{"input":224270,"output":32589,"cacheRead":42112,"cacheWrite":0,"cost":2.120076,"turns":6}}],"sessionFile":"/Users/user/.pi/agent/sessions/--Users-user-projects-yinshi--/2026-09-04T04-44-52-550Z_01a06abb-dfc5-7c65-82bb-7c5f2081ee64/763ded31/run-0/session.jsonl","acceptance":{"status":"not-required","evidenceStatus":"not-required","explicit":true,"effectiveAcceptance":{"level":"none","explicit":true,"inferredReason":["read-only task wording"],"criteria":[{"id":"criterion-1","must":"Return concrete findings with file paths and severity when applicable","evidence":[],"severity":"required"}],"evidence":[],"verify":[],"stopRules":[],"reason":"disabled by deprecated false shorthand"},"inferredReason":["read-only task wording"],"criteria":[{"id":"criterion-1","must":"Return concrete findings with file paths and sev