ll resolved, explicitly state no remediation is needed.'].join('\\n'); return runs.run('artifact-targeted-clearance', {agent:'final-review', task, reads:['backend/src/yinshi/services/broker_artifact_store.py','backend/src/yinshi/services/broker_replica_journal.py','backend/src/yinshi/services/replica_artifact_contract.py','backend/src/yinshi/services/workspace_replica_publication.py','backend/tests/test_broker_artifact_store.py','backend/tests/test_broker_replica_journal.py','backend/tests/test_workspace_replica_publication.py'], acceptance:false})","async":false,"cwd":"/Users/user/projects/yinshi","timeoutMs":900000,"turnBudget":{"maxTurns":4,"graceTurns":1},"toolBudget":{"soft":35,"hard":50,"block":["read","grep","find","ls"]},"chatProgress":"auto"}}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.6-sol","usage":{"input":4113,"output":584,"cacheRead":177408,"cacheWrite":0,"reasoning":102,"totalTokens":182105,"cost":{"input":0.020565000000000003,"output":0.01752,"cacheRead":0.08870399999999999,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.12678899999999999}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1789258254224,"responseId":"resp_0212e7de83dbbd32016aa5ea0ee63487d08568c57136f03c64","rawStopReason":"completed"}}
{"type":"message","id":"844edbc8","parentId":"d29e1ed6","timestamp":"2026-09-13T00:17:57.180Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_1nG62gcVQFnBERkHfw5Thvnc|fc_0212e7de83dbbd32016aa5ea34d82487d0a63b17aca69ed5ae","toolName":"subagent","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Workflow completed.\n\nReturn:\n{\n  \"key\": \"artifact-targeted-clearance\",\n  \"ok\": true,\n  \"runId\": \"0e505f45\",\n  \"output\": \"Turn budget wrap-up was requested after 4 assistant turns (soft limit 4, grace 1). Process-mode live steering is unavailable, so the child was warned at launch to wrap up by this budget. Output may be partial.\\n\\n## Confirmed finding\\n\\n**Medium: Root capacity lock is process-local**\\n\\nLocation: `broker_artifact_store.py`, `BrokerArtifactStore.__init__` and `_receive_with_cleanup` reservation block.\\n\\nEach instance owns a separate `asyncio.Lock`. Two broker processes can both count below `max_root_entries`, then create separate pending directories.\\n\\nImpact: Shared persistent root can exceed its configured entry bound. Existing concurrency test uses one store instance, so it misses this race.\\n\\nCorrection: Use root-scoped inter-process locking around final lookup, entry counting, and pending-directory creation.\\n\\nRemediation: `worker-advanced`. Concurrency, cancellation, and persistent-root ownership interact.\\n\\nRequired checks:\\n\\n- Add a test using two store instances in separate threads or processes.\\n- Force both reservations to overlap with `max_root_entries=1`.\\n- Assert one reservation succeeds and root never exceeds one entry.\\n- Rerun `test_broker_artifact_store.py`.\\n\\n## Region status\\n\\n1. `reconcile_attempts`: **Resolved.** Root identity revalidation prevents verification through a replaced root. Named test covers replacement before inspection.\\n2. Root capacity reservation: **Not resolved.** See confirmed finding.\\n3. Publication pending cleanup and allocation: **Resolved.** Unique pending and quarantine names preserve legacy state without blocking retries. Repeated failures remain distinct.\\n4. Journal authority replay: **Resolved.** Claimed broker incarnation must match authenticated request incarnation.\\n5. Operation validation: **Resolved.** Shared strict validator covers canonical request parsing and persisted event validation.\\n6. Export artifact IDs: **Resolved.** Construction and replay both reject duplicate IDs.\\n\\nNo other regression was visible within allowed regions.\\n\\n## Validation limit\\n\\nSelected seven tests did not execute. Pytest returned exit code 4 with collection errors for all three test modules, without diagnostics.\\n\\nThis result applies to current candidate files. Required checks remain incomplete. Finding blocks completion.\",\n  \"artifactPaths\": [\n    \"/Users/user/.pi/agent/sessions/--Users-user-projects-yinshi--/2026-09-04T04-44-52-550Z_01a06abb-dfc5-7c65-82bb-7c5f2081ee64/0e505f45/run-0/session.jsonl\"\n  ],\n  \"results\": [\n    {\n      \"index\": 0,\n      \"agent\": \"final-review\",\n      \"task\": \"[Read from: /Users/user/projects/yinshi/backend/src/yinshi/services/broker_artifact_store.py, /Users/user/projects/yinshi/backend/src/yinshi/services/broker_replica_journal.py, /Users/user/projects/yinshi/backend/src/yinshi/services/replica_artifact_contract.py, /Users/user/projects/yinshi/backend/src/yinshi/services/workspace_replica_publication.py, /Users/user/projects/yinshi/backend/tests/test_broker_artifact_store.py, /Users/user/projects/yinshi/backend/tests/test_broker_replica_journal.py, /Users/user/projects/yinshi/backend/tests/test_workspace_replica_publication.py]\\n\\nApply software-design review principles already named by parent. Review only these six corrected regions and their named tests. Do not inspect repository status, plans, docs, or unrelated files. Do not modify files.\\n1 broker_artifact_store.py reconcile_attempts and test_reconciliation_never_verifies_through_replaced_root.\\n2 broker_artifact_store.py _root_entry_count plus receive reservation block and test_root_entry_capacity_bounds_sequential_and_concurrent_attempts.\\n3 workspace_replica_publication.py _cleanup_pending plus publish_artifact_set pending allocation and test_retained_legacy_pending_does_not_block_retry plus repeated failure test.\\n4 broker_replica_journal.py _replay authority_claimed branch and test_replay_rejects_claimed_broker_different_from_authenticated_request.\\n5 broker_replica_journal.py operation validation sites plus replica_artifact_contract.py validate_replica_operation_id.\\n6 broker_replica_journal.py ExportReceipt and test_export_receipt_rejects_duplicate_artifact_ids plus test_replay_rejects_duplicate_export_artifact_ids.\\nPrior full reviews: 763ded31 and 480936c7. Review 78b64d44 found no defect but lacked inspection capacity.\\nFor each region state resolved or provide concrete finding with location, impact, correction, and validation. Also report any regression visible in these regions. If all resolved, explicitly state no remediation is needed.\",\n      \"routingContract\": {\n        \"version\": 1,\n        \"agent\": \"final-review\",\n        \"model\": \"openai-codex/gpt-5.6-sol\",\n        \"thinking\": \"max\",\n        \"policyDigest\": \"8590d2fc0420152aad3f867aba1c18a56b3632f2d90e01d30d3f04676cd46ac5\"\n      },\n      \"launchContractDigest\": \"087fa7cd28775312e796658d8f4be620b8e1cc0ef8a01fde26f9cdc5e4b19d6c\",\n      \"launchResolvedExtensions\": {\n        \"version\": 1,\n        \"source\": \"launch-resolved\",\n        \"disableAmbientExtensions\": false,\n        \"runtime\": [\n          \"sha256:cb00ccf63b7cf9f4\"\n        ],\n        \"configured\": [],\n        \"effective\": [\n          \"sha256:cb00ccf63b7cf9f4\"\n        ],\n        \"omitted\": {\n          \"runtime\": 0,\n          \"configured\": 0,\n          \"effective\": 0\n        }\n      },\n      \"exitCode\": 0,\n      \"outputState\": \"present\",\n      \"usage\": {\n       