ter 4 assistant turns (soft limit 4, grace 1). Process-mode live steering is unavailable, so the child was warned at launch to wrap up by this budget. Output may be partial.\\n\\n## Confirmed finding\\n\\n**Medium: Root capacity lock is process-local**\\n\\nLocation: `broker_artifact_store.py`, `BrokerArtifactStore.__init__` and `_receive_with_cleanup` reservation block.\\n\\nEach instance owns a separate `asyncio.Lock`. Two broker processes can both count below `max_root_entries`, then create separate pending directories.\\n\\nImpact: Shared persistent root can exceed its configured entry bound. Existing concurrency test uses one store instance, so it misses this race.\\n\\nCorrection: Use root-scoped inter-process locking around final lookup, entry counting, and pending-directory creation.\\n\\nRemediation: `worker-advanced`. Concurrency, cancellation, and persistent-root ownership interact.\\n\\nRequired checks:\\n\\n- Add a test using two store instances in separate threads or processes.\\n- Force both reservations to overlap with `max_root_entries=1`.\\n- Assert one reservation succeeds and root never exceeds one entry.\\n- Rerun `test_broker_artifact_store.py`.\\n\\n## Region status\\n\\n1. `reconcile_attempts`: **Resolved.** Root identity revalidation prevents verification through a replaced root. Named test covers replacement before inspection.\\n2. Root capacity reservation: **Not resolved.** See confirmed finding.\\n3. Publication pending cleanup and allocation: **Resolved.** Unique pending and quarantine names preserve legacy state without blocking retries. Repeated failures remain distinct.\\n4. Journal authority replay: **Resolved.** Claimed broker incarnation must match authenticated request incarnation.\\n5. Operation validation: **Resolved.** Shared strict validator covers canonical request parsing and persisted event validation.\\n6. Export artifact IDs: **Resolved.** Construction and replay both reject duplicate IDs.\\n\\nNo other regression was visible within allowed regions.\\n\\n## Validation limit\\n\\nSelected seven tests did not execute. Pytest returned exit code 4 with collection errors for all three test modules, without diagnostics.\\n\\nThis result applies to current candidate files. Required checks remain incomplete. Finding blocks completion.\",\n      \"controlEvents\": [\n        {\n          \"type\": \"active_long_running\",\n          \"to\": \"active_long_running\",\n          \"ts\": 1789258537539,\n          \"runId\": \"0e505f45\",\n          \"agent\": \"final-review\",\n          \"index\": 0,\n          \"message\": \"final-review is still active but long-running\",\n          \"reason\": \"time_threshold\",\n          \"turns\": 4,\n          \"tokens\": 80527,\n          \"toolCount\": 16,\n          \"elapsedMs\": 240505\n        }\n      ],\n      \"attemptedModels\": [\n        \"openai-codex/gpt-5.6-sol:max\"\n      ],\n      \"modelAttempts\": [\n        {\n          \"model\": \"openai-codex/gpt-5.6-sol:max\",\n          \"success\": true,\n          \"exitCode\": 0,\n          \"usage\": {\n            \"input\": 76034,\n            \"output\": 10519,\n            \"cacheRead\": 203264,\n            \"cacheWrite\": 0,\n            \"cost\": 0.7973720000000001,\n            \"turns\": 5\n          }\n        }\n      ],\n      \"sessionFile\": \"/Users/user/.pi/agent/sessions/--Users-user-projects-yinshi--/2026-09-04T04-44-52-550Z_01a06abb-dfc5-7c65-82bb-7c5f2081ee64/0e505f45/run-0/session.jsonl\",\n      \"acceptance\": {\n        \"status\": \"not-required\",\n        \"evidenceStatus\": \"not-required\",\n        \"explicit\": true,\n        \"effectiveAcceptance\": {\n          \"level\": \"none\",\n          \"explicit\": true,\n          \"inferredReason\": [\n            \"read-only task wording\"\n          ],\n          \"criteria\": [\n            {\n              \"id\": \"criterion-1\",\n              \"must\": \"Return concrete findings with file paths and severity