us\n\n1. `reconcile_attempts`: **Resolved.** Root identity revalidation prevents verification through a replaced root. Named test covers replacement before inspection.\n2. Root capacity reservation: **Not resolved.** See confirmed finding.\n3. Publication pending cleanup and allocation: **Resolved.** Unique pending and quarantine names preserve legacy state without blocking retries. Repeated failures remain distinct.\n4. Journal authority replay: **Resolved.** Claimed broker incarnation must match authenticated request incarnation.\n5. Operation validation: **Resolved.** Shared strict validator covers canonical request parsing and persisted event validation.\n6. Export artifact IDs: **Resolved.** Construction and replay both reject duplicate IDs.\n\nNo other regression was visible within allowed regions.\n\n## Validation limit\n\nSelected seven tests did not execute. Pytest returned exit code 4 with collection errors for all three test modules, without diagnostics.\n\nThis result applies to current candidate files. Required checks remain incomplete. Finding blocks completion.","artifactPaths":["/Users/user/.pi/agent/sessions/--Users-user-projects-yinshi--/2026-09-04T04-44-52-550Z_01a06abb-dfc5-7c65-82bb-7c5f2081ee64/0e505f45/run-0/session.jsonl"],"results":[{"index":0,"agent":"final-review","task":"[Read from: /Users/user/projects/yinshi/backend/src/yinshi/services/broker_artifact_store.py, /Users/user/projects/yinshi/backend/src/yinshi/services/broker_replica_journal.py, /Users/user/projects/yinshi/backend/src/yinshi/services/replica_artifact_contract.py, /Users/user/projects/yinshi/backend/src/yinshi/services/workspace_replica_publication.py, /Users/user/projects/yinshi/backend/tests/test_broker_artifact_store.py, /Users/user/projects/yinshi/backend/tests/test_broker_replica_journal.py, /Users/user/projects/yinshi/backend/tests/test_workspace_replica_publication.py]\n\nApply software-design review principles already named by parent. Review only these six corrected