al stages or record explicit materialization completion.\n\nRemediation: `worker-advanced`. Recovery interacts with Git state, persisted receipts, and cancellation.\n\nRequired checks:\n\n- Cancel after materialization returns but before `_persist_staged`.\n- Retry from the persisted `materializing` state.\n- Verify local and remote clone paths.\n- Run the full scoped test file.\n\n## Validation\n\n- `30 passed in 1.69s`.\n- Zero-row cancellation probe left `stage_exists=True` with receipt `('planned', None)`.\n- Valid-stage probe invoked `clone` again.\n- Raw Git probe confirmed a second clone into `.` fails.\n- Ruff was unavailable in `backend/.venv`.\n\n\n[1 more lines in file. Use offset=61 to continue.]"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1789259554482}}
