{"type":"message","id":"3135f569","parentId":"d6d6527b","timestamp":"2026-09-13T01:29:28.957Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"**Preparing final review instructions**","thinkingSignature":"{\"id\":\"rs_0212e7de83dbbd32016aa5fc6cb98887d0b407649641b58d3f\",\"type\":\"reasoning\",\"content\":[],\"encrypted_content\":\"REDACTED\",\"summary\":[{\"type\":\"summary_text\",\"text\":\"**Preparing final review instructions**\"}]}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_xPU4Um4uzW5C0R5XPCIejAr0|fc_0212e7de83dbbd32016aa5fc6f1f1c87d0b7b51fda2138a9f3","name":"subagent","arguments":{"workflowScript":"const design=['Apply software-design review rules: seek deep modules, hidden decisions, general focused interfaces, distinct abstraction levels, complexity pulled downward, avoidable errors removed, precise names, consistency, obvious code. Check shallow modules, information leakage, temporal decomposition, pass-through methods, overexposure, conjoined methods, repetition, vague names, comment defects, mixed special and general logic, nonobvious behavior, and excess exceptions.']; const task=['Final read-only review of current broker replica lifecycle milestone.',...design,'Original requirement: add broker-owned stateless coordinator for exact stages ingest, verify, publish, admission, drain, export, reclaim. Journal is sole durable authority. No SQLite handle crosses await or an external effect. Effects are explicit and all required. Unknown outcomes become exact stage unresolved. Timeout and cancellation must never allow late completion. Recovery must inspect a started effect, resume a confirmed absent effect, and block unknown effects. Reclaim completion has a signed response. Root protocol remains unchanged.','Review current versions of broker_replica_lifecycle.py, broker_replica_journal.py, test_broker_replica_lifecycle.py, plus relevant journal callers and tests. Inspect actual files, not prior packets.','Current checks: focused coordinator 11 passed. Coordinator plus journal 53 passed. Ruff lint passed. Strict mypy passed for both source files. py_compile passed. Ruff format now expected clean after manual fixes.','Return every finding with severity, exact location or requirement, impact, correction, and validation. If none, state no remediation needed. Read only.'].join('\\n'); return runs.run('coordinator-final-review', {agent:'final-review', task, reads:['backend/src/yinshi/services/broker_replica_lifecycle.py','backend/src/yinshi/services/broker_replica_journal.py','backend/tests/test_broker_replica_lifecycle.py','backend/tests/test_broker_replica_journal.py','backend/src/yinshi/services/execution_broker.py']})","async":false,"cwd":"/Users/user/projects/yinshi","timeoutMs":1200000,"turnBudget":{"maxTurns":8,"graceTurns":2},"toolBudget":{"soft":30,"hard":45,"block":["read","grep","find","ls"]},"chatProgress":"auto"}}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.6-sol","usage":{"input":305,"output":549,"cacheRead":100608,"cacheWrite":0,"reasoning":68,"totalTokens":101462,"cost":{"input":0.001525,"output":0.016470000000000002,"cacheRead":0.050303999999999995,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.068299}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1789262953726,"responseId":"resp_0212e7de83dbbd32016aa5fc6a36d087d0935dae1c58e758c5","rawStopReason":"completed"}}
{"type":"message","id":"14fc459f","parentId":"3135f569","timestamp":"2026-09-13T01:35:45.840Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_xPU4Um4uzW5C0R5XPCIejAr0|fc_0212e7de83dbbd32016aa5fc6f1f1c87d0b7b51fda2138a9f3","toolName":"subagent","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Workflow completed.\n\nReturn:\n{\n  \"key\": \"coordinator-final-review\",\n  \"ok\": true,\n  \"runId\": \"0856b674\",\n  \"output\": \"Turn budget wrap-up was requested after 8 assistant turns (soft limit 8, grace 2). Process-mode live steering is unavailable, so the child was warned at launch to wrap up by this budget. Output may be partial.\\n\\n## Findings\\n\\n### Blocker: duplicate requests can execute one stage twice\\n\\nLocation: `backend/src/yinshi/services/broker_replica_lifecycle.py:198-223`, `:314-325`\\n\\n`run()` ignores nonterminal decision state after `accept()` and `claim_authority()`. Same coordinator uses one owner token for every invocation.\\n\\nA concurrent duplicate therefore passes ownership checks. Idempotent `begin_stage()` then permits both calls to invoke the same external effect.\\n\\nImpact: admission, export, or reclaim can run twice. Concurrent callers can also attempt conflicting terminal outcomes.\\n\\nCorrection: add per-operation single-flight ownership. Re-read journal state after acquiring it. Never reapply an already active stage. Reconcile abandoned started stages before resumption.\\n\\nRemediation: `worker-advanced`. This fix interacts with concurrency, cancellation, durable ownership, and recovery.\\n\\nValidation:\\n\\n- Start two concurrent `run()` calls for one signed request.\\n- Block first effect before completion.\\n- Assert each stage effect runs once.\\n- Assert both callers receive one durable response.\\n- Repeat with cancellation and timeout during duplicate waiting.\\n- Test re-entry after a started-stage persistence failure.\\n\\n### High: stage interface loses receipt-stage type guarantees\\n\\nLocation: `backend/src/yinshi/services/broker_replica_lifecycle.py:89-145`, `:395-468`\\n\\nOne untyped `Mapping[str, ReplicaStageEffect]` accepts every receipt union for every stage. Stage policy is repeated across string maps and completion branches.\\n\\nA completed effect can return another stage's receipt. `_persist_completed()` then raises `TypeError` after the external effect ran. No exact unresolved response is persisted.\\n\\nImpact: malformed effect evidence leaves a started lifecycle without the required stage-specific terminal result. Mypy cannot prevent adapter miswiring.\\n\\nCorrection: use generic stage effects inside a typed `ReplicaLifecycleEffects` bundle. Keep runtime validation and convert invalid effect evidence into that stage's unresolved response.\\n\\nRemediation: `worker-advanced`. Receipt typing affects effect contracts, journal transitions, and recovery behavior.\\n\\nValidation:\\n\\n- Add wrong-receipt tests for every stage.\\n- Assert each becomes exact stage unresolved.\\n- Assert no later effect runs.\\n- Run strict mypy against all coordinator adapters.\\n\\n## Required checks\\n\\nCorrect validation commands were not completed independently. Attempts used repository-root paths instead of `backend/` paths.\\n\\nRun:\\n\\n```bash\\ncd backend\\n.venv/bin/pytest -q tests/test_broker_replica_lifecycle.py tests/test_broker_replica_journal.py\\n.venv/bin/ruff check src/yinshi/services/broker_replica_lifecycle.py src/yinshi/services/broker_replica_journal.py tests/test_broker_replica_lifecycle.py\\n.venv/bin/ruff format --check src/yinshi/services/broker_replica_lifecycle.py src/yinshi/services/broker_replica_journal.py tests/test_broker_replica_lifecycle.py\\n.venv/bin/mypy --strict src/yinshi/services/broker_replica_lifecycle.py src/yinshi/services/broker_replica_journal.py\\n.venv/bin/python -m py_compile src/yinshi/services/broker_replica_lifecycle.py src/yinshi/services/broker_replica_journal.py\\n```\\n\\n## Residual risks\\n\\nProduction dispatch and real stage adapters remain intentionally unwired under approved milestone scope. Fake-effect tests do not certify future admission, drain, export, or reclaim adapters.\\n\\nCompletion remains blocked by both findings.\",\n  \"artifactPaths\": [\n    \"/Users/user/.pi/agent/sessions/--Users-user-projects-yinshi--/2026-09-04T04-44-52-550Z_01a06abb-dfc5-7c65-82bb-7c5f2081ee64/0856b674/run-0/session.jsonl\"\n  ],\n  \"results\": [\n    {\n      \"index\": 0,\n      \"agent\": \"final-review\",\n      \"task\": \"[Read from: /Users/user/projects/yinshi/backend/src/yinshi/services/broker_replica_lifecycle.py, /Users/user/projects/yinshi/backend/src/yinshi/services/broker_replica_journal.py, /Users/user/projects/yinshi/backend/tests/test_broker_replica_lifecycle.py, /Users/user/projects/yinshi/backend/tests/test_broker_replica_journal.py, /Users/user/projects/yinshi/backend/src/yinshi/services/execution_broker.py]\\n\\nFinal read-only review of current broker replica lifecycle milestone.\\nApply software-design review rules: seek deep modules, hidden decisions, general focused interfaces, distinct abstraction levels, complexity pulled downward, avoidable errors removed, precise names, consistency, obvious code. Check shallow modules, information leakage, temporal decomposition, pass-through methods, overexposure, conjoined methods, repetition, vague names, comment defects, mixed special and general logic, nonobvious behavior, and excess exceptions.\\nOriginal requirement: add broker-owned stateless coordinator for exact stages ingest, verify, publish, admission, drain, export, reclaim. Journal is sole durable authority. No SQLite handle crosses await or an external effect. Effects are explicit and all required. Unknown outcomes become exact stage unresolved. Timeout and cancellation must never allow late completion. Recovery must inspect a started effect, resume a confirmed absent effect, and block unknown effects. Reclaim completion has a signed response. Root protocol remains unchanged