 a signed response. Root protocol remains unchanged.\nReview current versions of broker_replica_lifecycle.py, broker_replica_journal.py, test_broker_replica_lifecycle.py, plus relevant journal callers and tests. Inspect actual files, not prior packets.\nCurrent checks: focused coordinator 11 passed. Coordinator plus journal 53 passed. Ruff lint passed. Strict mypy passed for both source files. py_compile passed. Ruff format now expected clean after manual fixes.\nReturn every finding with severity, exact location or requirement, impact, correction, and validation. If none, state no remediation needed. Read only.","routingContract":{"version":1,"agent":"final-review","model":"openai-codex/gpt-5.6-sol","thinking":"max","policyDigest":"8590d2fc0420152aad3f867aba1c18a56b3632f2d90e01d30d3f04676cd46ac5"},"launchContractDigest":"d3a0bf08873eb0ec1aeff7ec327e5ef896553cb12fb40209bc23d567d3c438be","launchResolvedExtensions":{"version":1,"source":"launch-resolved","disableAmbientExtensions":false,"runtime":["sha256:cb00ccf63b7cf9f4"],"configured":[],"effective":["sha256:cb00ccf63b7cf9f4"],"omitted":{"runtime":0,"configured":0,"effective":0}},"exitCode":0,"outputState":"present","usage":{"input":128515,"output":13305,"cacheRead":187904,"cacheWrite":0,"cost":1.135677,"turns":9},"model":"openai-codex/gpt-5.6-sol:max","thinking":"max","artifactPaths":{"inputPath":"/Users/user/projects/yinshi/.pi-subagents/artifacts/0856b674_final-review_0_input.md","outputPath":"/Users/user/projects/yinshi/.pi-subagents/artifacts/0856b674_final-review_0_output.md","jsonlPath":"/Users/user/projects/yinshi/.pi-subagents/artifacts/0856b674_final-review_0.jsonl","transcriptPath":"/Users/user/projects/yinshi/.pi-subagents/artifacts/0856b674_final-review_0_transcript.jsonl","metadataPath":"/Users/user/projects/yinshi/.pi-subagents/artifacts/0856b674_final-review_0_meta.json"},"transcriptPath":"/Users/user/projects/yinshi/.pi-subagents/artifacts/0856b674_final-review_0_transcript.jsonl","skills":["software-design"],"turnBudget":{"maxTurns":8,"graceTurns":2,"turnCount":9,"outcome":"wrap-up-requested","wrapUpRequestedAtTurn":8},"toolBudget":{"hard":45,"soft":30,"block":["read","grep","find","ls"],"toolCount":32,"outcome":"soft-reached","softReachedAt":30},"context":"fresh","wrapUpRequested":true,"progressSummary":{"toolCount":32,"tokens":141820,"durationMs":376108},"effects":{"fileMutation":{"status":"not-applicable","expected":false,"attempted":true}},"outputMode":"inline","finalOutput":"Turn budget wrap-up was requested after 8 assistant turns (soft limit 8, grace 2). Process-mode live steering is unavailable, so the child was warned at launch to wrap up by this budget. Output may be partial.\n\n## Findings\n\n### Blocker: duplicate requests can execute one stage twice\n\nLocation: `backend/src/yinshi/services/broker_replica_lifecycle.py:198-223`, `:314-325`\n\n`run()` ignores nonterminal decision state after `accept()` and `claim_authority()`. Same coordinator uses one owner token for every invocation.\n\nA concurrent duplicate therefore passes ownership checks. Idempotent `begin_stage()` then permits both calls to invoke the same external effect.\n\nImpact: admission, export, or reclaim can run twice. Concurrent callers can also attempt conflicting terminal outcomes.\n\nCorrection: add per-operation single-flight ownership. Re-read journal state after acquiring it. Never reapply an already active stage. Reconcile abandoned started stages before resumption.\n\nRemediation: `worker-advanced`. This fix interacts with concurrency, cancellation, durable ownership, and recovery.\n\nValidation:\n\n- Start two concurrent `run()` calls for one signed request.\n- Block first effect before completion.\n- Assert each stage effect runs once.\n- Assert both callers receive one durable response.\n- Repeat with cancellation and timeout during duplicate waiting.\n- Test re-entry after a started-stage persistence failure.\n\n### High: stage interface loses receipt-stage type guarantees\n\nLocation: `backend/src/yinshi/services/broker_replica_lifecycle.py:89-145`, `:395-468`\n\nOne untyped `Mapping[str, ReplicaStageEffect]` accepts every receipt union for every stage. Stage policy is repeated across string maps and completion branches.\n\nA completed effect can return another stage's receipt. `_persist_completed()` then raises `TypeError` after the external effect ran. No exact unresolved response is persisted.\n\nImpact: malformed effect evidence leaves a started lifecycle without the required stage-specific terminal result. Mypy cannot prevent adapter miswiring.\n\nCorrection: use generic stage effects inside a typed `ReplicaLifecycleEffects` bundle. Keep runtime validation and convert invalid effect evidence into that stage's unresolved response.\n\nRemediation: `worker-advanced`. Receipt typing affects effect contracts, journal transitions, and recovery behavior.\n\nValidation:\n\n- Add wrong-receipt tests for every stage.\n- Assert each becomes exact stage unresolved.\n- Assert no later effect runs.\n- Run strict mypy against all coordinator adapters.\n\n## Required checks\n\nCorrect validation commands were not completed independently. Attempts used repository-root paths instead of `backend/` paths.\n\nRun:\n\n```bash\ncd backend\n.venv/bin/pytest -q tests/test_broker_replica_lifecycle.py tests/test_broker_replica_journal.py\n.venv/bin/ruff check src/yinshi/services/broker_replica_lifecycle.py src/yinshi/services/broker_replica_journal.py tests/test_broker_replica_lifecycle.py\n.venv/bin/ruff format --check src/yinshi/services/broker_replica_lifecycle.py src/yinshi/services/broker_replica_journal.py tests/test_broker_replica_lifecycle.py\n.venv/bin/mypy --strict src/yinshi/services/broker_replica_lifecycle.py src/yinshi/services/broker_replica_journal.py\n.venv/bin/python -m py_compile src/yinshi/services/broker_replica_lifecycle.py src/yinshi/services/broker_replica_journal.py\n```\n\n## Residual risks\n\nProduction dispatch and real stage adapters remain intentionally unwired under approved milestone scope. Fake-effect tests do not certify future admission, drain, export, or reclaim adapters.\n\nCompletion remains blocked by both findings.","controlEvents":[{"type":"active_long_running","to":"active_long_running","ts":1789263210008,"runId":"0856b674","agent":"final-review","index":0,"message":"final-review is still active but long-running","reason":"time_threshold","turns":8,"tokens":86760,"toolCount":32,"elapsedMs":240551}],"attemptedModels":["openai-codex/gpt-5.6-sol:max"],"modelAttempts":[{"model":"openai-codex/gpt-5.6-sol:max","success":true,"exitCode":0,"usage":{"input":128515,"output":13305,"cacheRead":187904,"cacheWrite":0,"cost":1.135677,"turns":9}}],"sessionFile":"/Users/user/.pi/agent/sessions/--Users-user-projects-yinshi--/2026-09-04T04-44-52-550Z_01a06abb-dfc5-7c65-82bb-7c5f2081ee64/0856b674/run-0/session.jsonl","acceptance":{"status":"attested","evidenceStatus":"attested","explicit":false,"effectiveAcceptance":{"level":"attested","explicit":false,"inferredReason":["read-only task wording"],"criteria":[{"id":"criterion-1","must":"Return concrete findings with file paths and severity when applicable","evidence":["review-findings","residual-risks"],"severity":"required"}],"evidence":["review-findings","residual-risks"],"verify":[],"stopRules":[]},"inferredReason":["read-only task wording"],"criteria":[{"id":"criterion-1","must":"Return concrete findings with file paths and severity when applicable","evidence":["review-findings","residual-risks"],"severity":"required"}],"runtimeChecks":[],"verifyRuns":[],"childReport":{"criteriaSatisfied":[{"id":"criterion-1","status":"satisfied","evidence":"Two concrete findings include severity, exact repository locations, impact, correction, worker tier, and validation."}],"changedFiles":["backend/src/yinshi/services/broker_replica_lifecycle.py","backend/src/yinshi/services/broker_replica_journal.py","backend/tests/test_broker_replica_lifecycle.py"],"