es, durable recovery, receipt checks, journal authority access, and response-code validation.","reviewFindings":["high: backend/src/yinshi/services/broker_replica_lifecycle.py:445-530 - semantically invalid effect evidence can leave a started lifecycle without durable unresolved outcome.","high: backend/src/yinshi/services/broker_replica_lifecycle.py:184-223,479-577 - signer mismatch is detected only after external effects, including reclaim."],"manualNotes":"Prior duplicate-execution finding is resolved. Prior effect-typing finding remains partially unresolved. Both corrections need worker-advanced."}}}},"isError":false,"timestamp":1789264009886}}
