"},{"operation":"run","key":"coordinator-final-clearance","state":"completed","durationMs":441166,"runId":"541cd5ae"}],"emits":[],"console":[]},"chatProgress":{"mode":"live-card","repoRelation":"same","repoLabel":"yinshi"},"missionId":"0398c620-b8e4-4735-812b-b2a42db885d2","missionPath":"/Users/user/projects/yinshi/.pi-subagents/missions/0398c620-b8e4-4735-812b-b2a42db885d2.json","mission":{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"0398c620-b8e4-4735-812b-b2a42db885d2","title":"Read-only final review of corrected broker replica lifecycle milestone. Use software-design skill...","objective":"Read-only final review of corrected broker replica lifecycle milestone. Use software-design skill rules.\nContract: journal owns durable order. Coordinator serializes duplicates per operation, validates signer authority before effects, validates typed and semantic stage results, records stage-specific unresolved results for malformed effects, preserves journal I/O failures, and never accepts current requests for another broker incarnation. Historical recovery uses retained matching signing keys.\nPrior findings: duplicate execution fixed with bounded operation gates. Wrong receipt classes fixed with typed effect bundle and runtime checks. Semantic result failures fixed through journal-owned no-database validators. Signer mismatch fixed with constructor-time journal key verification and broker-incarnation keyring.\nCurrent results: 66 focused tests passed. Ruff and strict mypy passed before final formatting changes. Ruff format discrepancies were corrected manually.\nInspect actual current files and diff. Confirm each prior finding disposition. Check malformed rejection and unknown fallback, semantic receipt binding, current versus historical signer selection, cancellation, timeout, per-operation gate cleanup, restart handling, and journal persistence failures.\nReturn each finding with severity, location, impact, correction, and validation. If none remain, state no remediation needed. Read only.","status":"completed","createdAt":"2026-09-13T01:53:01.435Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-13T02:00:22.757Z","runs":[{"runId":"call_MUgEYgexwDsfnkiaxr9lp2Ud|fc_0212e7de83dbbd32016aa601f399dc87d0a054a2b8b1fc132d","mode":"workflow","agent":"final-review","status":"completed","startedAt":"2026-09-13T02:00:22.756Z","completedAt":"2026-09-13T02:00:22.756Z","usage":{"tokens":125306}}],"decisions":[],"artifacts":[{"kind":"output","path":"/Users/user/projects/yinshi/.pi-subagents/artifacts/541cd5ae_final-review_0_output.md"},{"kind":"other","path":"/Users/user/projects/yinshi/.pi-subagents/artifacts/541cd5ae_final-review_0_transcript.jsonl","description":"Child transcript"}],"receipts":[],"cwd":"/Users/user/projects/yinshi","ownerSessionId":"/Users/user/.pi/agent/sessions/--Users-user-projects-yinshi--/2026-09-04T04-44-52-550Z_01a06abb-dfc5-7c65-82bb-7c5f2081ee64.jsonl","summary":"Workflow completed.\n\nReturn:\n{\n  \"key\": \"coordinator-final-clearance\",\n  \"ok\": true,\n  \"runId\": \"541cd5ae\",\n  \"output\": \"## Findings\\n\\n### Blocker: retries can reapply a durably started effect\\n\\nLocation:\\n\\n- `backend/src/yinshi/services/broker_replica_lifecycle.py`\\n- `BrokerReplicaLifecycleCoordinator.run()`, branch after `_claim_within_deadline()`\\n- `BrokerReplicaLifecycleCoordinator._drive_from()`\\n\\n`run()` ignores `ReplicaJournalDecision.state == \\\"in_flight\\\"`. It sends that stage to `_drive_from()`, which calls `apply()` instead of `reconcile()`.\\n\\nImpact:\\n\\nA stage effect may complete while its completion append fails. A retry then executes that effect again. Publish, export, or reclaim can produce conflicting irreversible outcomes.\\n\\nCorrection:\\n\\nRoute every durable `in_flight` stage through reconciliation while holding its operation gate. Apply only after reconciliation returns `not_applied`. Share this logic with startup recovery.\\n\\nRemediation: `worker-advanced`.\\n\\nRequired validation:\\n\\n- Inject `ReplicaJournalCommitAbsent` after an effect completes.\\n- Retry through `run()`.\\n- Assert reconciliation occurs before any second apply.\\n- Cover completed, not-applied, and unknown reconciliation outcomes.\\n\\n### High: durable journal configuration prevents broker key rotation\\n\\nLocation:\\n\\n- `backend/src/yinshi/services/broker_replica_journal.py:1004-1059`\\n- `BrokerReplicaJournal.__init__()`, `_configuration_sha256`\\n- `backend/src/yinshi/services/broker_replica_journal.py:1138-1172`\\n- `BrokerReplicaJournal._validate()`, journal ID configuration check\\n\\nConfiguration digest includes full `response_public_keys` mapping. Adding a new broker incarnation changes that digest. Existing journal then refuses to open.\\n\\nImpact:\\n\\nA restarted broker cannot add its new key while retaining the historical key. Historical recovery only works when future broker incarnations were preconfigured before journal creation.\\n\\nCorrection:\\n\\nPersist respons...","acceptance":{"status":"attested","evidenceStatus":"attested","explicit":false,"effectiveAcceptance":{"level":"attested","explicit":false,"inferredReason":["read-only task wording"],"criteria":[{"id":"criterion-1","must":"Return concrete findings with file paths and severity when applicable","evidence":["review-findings","residual-risks"],"severity":"required"}],"evidence":["review-findings","residual-risks"],"verify":[],"stopRules":[]},"inferredReason":["read-only task wording"],"criteria":[{"id":"criterion-1","must":"Return concrete findings with file paths and severity when applicable","evidence":["review-findings","residual-risks"],"severity":"required"}],"runtimeChecks":[],"verifyRuns":[],"childReport":{"criteriaSatisfied":[{"id":"criterion-1","status":"satisfied","evidence":"Three concrete findings include severity, exact file and method locations, impact, correction, remediation tier, and required validation."}],"changedFiles":["backend/src/yinshi/services/broker_replica_lifecycle.py","backend/src/yinshi/services/broker_replica_journal.py","backend/src/yinshi/services/execution_broker.py","backend/tests/test_broker_replica_lifecycle.py","backend/tests/test_broker_replica_journal.py"],"testsAddedOrUpdated":["backend/tests/test_broker_replica_lifecycle.py","backend/tests/test_broker_replica_journal.py"],"commandsRun":[{"command":"git status --short && git diff --stat && git diff --cached --stat && git diff --name-only && git diff --cached --name-only","result":"passed","summary":"Inspected current worktree candidate and confirmed no staged changes."},{"command":"cd backend && .venv/bin/pytest -q tests/test_broker_replica_lifecycle.py tests/test_broker_replica_journal.py","result":"not-run","summary":"User reported 66 focused tests passed. Review did not repeat them."},{"command":"cd backend && .venv/bin/ruff check src/yinshi/services/broker_replica_lifecycle.py src/yinshi/services/broker_replica_journal.py tests/test_broker_replica_lifecycle.py tests/test_broker_replica_journal.py","result":"not-run","summary":"Reported earlier result predates final formatting changes."},{"command":"cd backend && .venv/bin/ruff format --check src/yinshi/services/broker_replica_lifecycle.py src/yinshi/services/broker_replica_journal.py tests/test_broker_replica_lifecycle.py tests/test_broker_replica_journal.py","result":"not-run","summary":"Manual formatting correction was inspected but not independently checked."},{"command":"cd backend && .venv/bin/mypy --strict src/yinshi/services/broker_replica_lifecycle.py src/yinshi/services/broker_replica_journal.py","result":"not-run","summary":"Reported earlier result predates final formatting changes."}],"validationOutput":["Concurrent duplicate test covers overlapping run calls.","Receipt type and semantic binding tests cover current typed stage outcomes.","Missing coverage: durable in-flight retry after journal failure.","Missing coverage: journal reopen with an added broker incarnation key.","Missing coverage: synchronous or non-awaitable effect invocation failures."],"residualRisks":["Durably started effects can be applied twice after persistence failures.","Broker key rotation cannot reopen an existing journal.","Malformed effect adapters can leave nonterminal durable state.","Final focused tests, Ruff, format, and strict mypy were not independently rerun."],"noStagedFiles":true,"diffSummary":"Reviewed lifecycle coordinator, journal authority changes, focused tests, and execution broker boundary. Three interacting failure and restart defects remain.","reviewFindings":["blocker: backend/src/yinshi/services/broker_replica_lifecycle.py BrokerReplicaLifecycleCoordinator.run() - durable in-flight retries call apply instead of reconcile","high: backend/src/yinshi/services/broker_replica_journal.py:1004-1059,1138-1172 - immutable configuration digest prevents adding a new broker incarnation key","high: backend/src/yinshi/services/broker_replica_lifecycle.py BrokerReplicaLifecycleCoordinator._attempt() - synchronous or non-coroutine effect invocation bypasses unresolved recording"],"manualNotes":"Completion blocked. Route all three interacting state, persistence, and cancellation fixes to worker-advanced."}}}},"isError":false,"timestamp":1789264823080}}
