 retries, commit failure behavior, malformed invocation, cancellation, terminal signing, and immutable key invariant. Return each finding with severity, location, impact, correction, and validation. If no applicable findings remain, state no remediation needed. Read only.","routingContract":{"version":1,"agent":"final-review","model":"openai-codex/gpt-5.6-sol","thinking":"max","policyDigest":"8590d2fc0420152aad3f867aba1c18a56b3632f2d90e01d30d3f04676cd46ac5"},"launchContractDigest":"7b96dab3f28fc5123b090112468fec77ca9d44ff3b359d4aa564485565fdd2c4","launchResolvedExtensions":{"version":1,"source":"launch-resolved","disableAmbientExtensions":false,"runtime":["sha256:cb00ccf63b7cf9f4"],"configured":[],"effective":["sha256:cb00ccf63b7cf9f4"],"omitted":{"runtime":0,"configured":0,"effective":0}},"exitCode":0,"outputState":"present","usage":{"input":149551,"output":11878,"cacheRead":105344,"cacheWrite":0,"cost":1.156767,"turns":5},"model":"openai-codex/gpt-5.6-sol:max","thinking":"max","artifactPaths":{"inputPath":"/Users/user/projects/yinshi/.pi-subagents/artifacts/01ed727d_final-review_0_input.md","outputPath":"/Users/user/projects/yinshi/.pi-subagents/artifacts/01ed727d_final-review_0_output.md","jsonlPath":"/Users/user/projects/yinshi/.pi-subagents/artifacts/01ed727d_final-review_0.jsonl","transcriptPath":"/Users/user/projects/yinshi/.pi-subagents/artifacts/01ed727d_final-review_0_transcript.jsonl","metadataPath":"/Users/user/projects/yinshi/.pi-subagents/artifacts/01ed727d_final-review_0_meta.json"},"transcriptPath":"/Users/user/projects/yinshi/.pi-subagents/artifacts/01ed727d_final-review_0_transcript.jsonl","skills":["software-design"],"turnBudget":{"maxTurns":8,"graceTurns":2,"outcome":"within-budget","turnCount":5},"toolBudget":{"hard":40,"soft":24,"block":["read","grep","find","ls"],"toolCount":26,"outcome":"soft-reached","softReachedAt":24},"context":"fresh","progressSummary":{"toolCount":26,"tokens":161429,"durationMs":379195},"effects":{"fileMutation":{"status":"not-applicable","expected":false,"attempted":true}},"outputMode":"inline","finalOutput":"## Confirmed finding\n\n### Blocker: failed unresolved commit releases operation gate while effect remains active\n\nLocation:\n\n- `backend/src/yinshi/services/broker_replica_lifecycle.py:285`, `run()` gate release\n- `backend/src/yinshi/services/broker_replica_lifecycle.py`, `_attempt()` timeout and cancellation branches\n- `backend/src/yinshi/services/broker_replica_lifecycle.py`, `_abandon()` and `_record_unresolved()`\n\nImpact:\n\nTimeout or cancellation leaves effect task running. If unresolved journal append fails before commit, `run()` releases operation gate. Immediate retry can reconcile or apply while original effect remains active. This can duplicate irreversible external effects.\n\nJournal still prevents conflicting durable terminal rows. It does not prevent conflicting external execution during this race.\n\nCorrection:\n\nTrack abandoned tasks by operation identity. Keep retries blocked while same-process effect remains active unless unresolved terminal state committed successfully. Release local uncertainty barrier only after task settles. Preserve restart reconciliation when no local task exists.\n\nRemediation tier: `worker-advanced`. Fix coordinates task ownership, cancellation, durable state, retry routing, and gate cleanup.\n\nRequired checks:\n\n- Timeout plus pre-commit unresolved-write failure. Retry must not reconcile or apply while original task remains active.\n- Cancellation plus pre-commit unresolved-write failure. Same guarantee.\n- After abandoned task settles, retry must reconcile first.\n- Assert one external `apply` call across each race.\n- Repeat focused tests, Ruff lint, Ruff format check, and strict mypy.\n\n## Prior findings\n\n- Durable retry routing: resolved. `in_flight` enters reconcile-first logic. `claimed` enters apply logic.\n- Malformed invocation: resolved for synchronous exceptions, non-awaitable returns, and custom awaitables.\n- Immutable key invariant: satisfied. Journal identity binds request key, full response keyring, and limit profile.\n- Prior mutable key-rotation concern: not applicable under approved generation contract.\n- Typed effects, receipt validation, signer validation, incarnation checks, and historical signing selection remain present.\n\n## Residual risks\n\nUnresolved blocker prevents clearance. Reported 72 tests, Ruff lint, and strict mypy were not independently repeated during this review. `git diff --check` passed on working candidate.","controlEvents":[{"type":"active_long_running","to":"active_long_running","ts":1789265253194,"runId":"01ed727d","agent":"final-review","index":0,"message":"final-review is still active but long-running","reason":"time_threshold","turns":4,"tokens":82627,"toolCount":26,"elapsedMs":240772}],"attemptedModels":["openai-codex/gpt-5.6-sol:max"],"modelAttempts":[{"model":"openai-codex/gpt-5.6-sol:max","success":true,"exitCode":0,"usage":{"input":149551,"output":11878,"cacheRead":105344,"cacheWrite":0,"cost":1.156767,"turns":5}}],"sessionFile":"/Users/user/.pi/agent/sessions/--Users-user-projects-yinshi--/2026-09-04T04-44-52-550Z_01a06abb-dfc5-7c65-82bb-7c5f2081ee64/01ed727d/run-0/session.jsonl","acceptance":{"status":"attested","evidenceStatus":"attested","explicit":false,"effectiveAcceptance":{"level":"attested","explicit":false,"inferredReason":["read-only task wording"],"criteria":[{"id":"criterion-1","must":"Return concrete findings with file paths and severity when applicable","evidence":["review-findings","residual-risks"],"severity":"required"}],"evidence":["review-findings","residual-risks"],"verify":[],"stopRules":[]},"inferredReason":["read-only task wording"],"criteria":[{"id":"criterion-1","must":"Return concrete findings with file paths and severity when applicable","evidence":["review-findings","residual-risks"],"severity":"required"}],"runtimeChecks":[],"verifyRuns":[],"childReport":{"criteriaSatisfied":[{"id":"criterion-