n timeout/cancel/transport failure; disabled workers return rejected responses without retry.\",\n              \"ManagedRuntimeManager provisioning is gated by managed_backup_operation_is_running() check; concurrent backup operations block provisioning.\"\n            ],\n            \"noStagedFiles\": true,\n            \"diffSummary\": \"No files modified. Pure inspection of /Users/user/projects/yinshi backend source.\",\n            \"reviewFindings\": [\n              \"info: root_launcher.py:33 - LAUNCH_EXECUTION_ENABLED_DEFAULT=False gates all executor launch\",\n              \"info: root_launcher.py:34-35 - REPLICA_PREPARE_ENABLED_DEFAULT=False gates prepare; REPLICA_RECLAIM_ENABLED_DEFAULT=False gates reclaim\",\n              \"info: execution_daemons.py:214-216 - resolve_*_gate() requires explicit=True AND env var == 'true', both conditions mandatory\",\n              \"info: execution_broker.py:36 - _SUPPORTED_REQUEST_TYPE = 'executor.launch', single fixed request type\",\n              \"info: broker_replica_lifecycle.py:39 - REPLICA_LIFECYCLE_STAGES = (ingest, verify, publish, admission, drain, export, reclaim)\",\n              \"info: broker_replica_journal.py:370 - SQLite schema has IMMUTABLE triggers preventing UPDATE/DELETE on events table\",\n              \"info: workspace_admission.py:502 - acquire_workspace_admission requires authority_hash (64 hex), operation_id (32 hex), kind in {integration,prompt,legacy}\"\n            ],\n            \"manualNotes\": \"Three independent gate layers: 1) Python defaults (False) in root_launcher.py, 2) CLI flags in execution_daemons.py launcher_main(), 3) env vars. All three must align for any root action to succeed. The broker executor pipeline (execution_broker.py) and replica pipeline (broker_replica_lifecycle.py) are separate; the broker service only talks to the root launcher for prepare/launch/reclaim via LauncherSocketClient.\"\n          }\n        },\n        \"toolCalls\": [\n          {\n        