roker Service (`backend/src/yinshi/services/execution_broker.py`)\n\n`BrokerService` — single supported request type: `\"executor.launch\"`. Rejects all other request types.\n\nForbidden payload keys: `capabilities, cgroup, command, commands, environment, executable, gid, home, mount, mounts, path, paths, properties, replica, socket, systemd_properties, uid, unit`.\n\nLifecycle stages: `prepare` → `runtime_setup` (via `BrokerRuntimeManager.setup()`) → `launch`.\n\nJournalled with `BrokerJournal`. Ownership claim mechanism via `_owner_token`. Handles concurrent owners with `_wait_for_owner()`.\n\n### 4. Broker Replica Lifecycle (`backend/src/yinshi/services/broker_replica_lifecycle.py`)\n\nFull replica lifecycle: `ingest` → `verify` → `publish` → `admission` → `drain` → `export` → `reclaim`.\n\n`BrokerReplicaLifecycleCoordinator` — drives stages through journal. `ReplicaLifecycleEffects` protocol binds each stage to `apply()`/`reconcile()` effects.\n\n`ReplicaAuthority` dataclass: `physical_target_id`, `replica_generation`, `execution_owner_id`.\n\n### 5. Broker Journal (`backend/src/yinshi/services/broker_replica_journal.py`)\n\nImmutable append-only SQLite schema. Events: `accepted`, `authority_claimed`, `stage_started`, `stage_outcome`, `stage_rejected`, `stage_unresolved`.\n\nReceipts: `IngestReceipt`, `VerifyReceipt`, `PublishReceipt`, `AdmissionReceipt`, `DrainReceipt`, `ExportReceipt`, `ReclaimReceipt`.\n\nAdmission receipt requires: `execution_owner_id`, `runtime_unit_id`, `session_socket_sha256`.\n\n### 6. Workspace Admission (`backend/src/yinshi/services/workspace_admission.py`)\n\n`acquire_workspace_admission()` — durable file-based lease with fcntl locks. Keys: authority_hash (64 hex), operation_id (32 hex), kind (`integration|prompt|legacy`).\n\nMarkers in `.yinshi-workspace-admission-v1/` subdirectory. Each marker: `{version, authority, operation, kind}`.\n\n### 7. Managed Runners / Runtime (`backend/src/yinshi/services/managed_runners.py`, `managed_runtime_manager.py`)\n\nLifecycle: `provisioning` → `ready` / `failed` / `deleting`.\n\n`ManagedRuntimeManager.provision()` — claims provisioning, registers sprite, sets network policy, installs guest, polls for runner online.\n\n`ensure_online()` — wakes ready runtime, checks heartbeat + relay.\n\nRestore candidate: `provision_restore_candidate()` — installs fresh candidate, verifies identity.\n\nActivation: `activate_managed_restore_candidate()` — atomic swap: revoke old, promote candidate.\n\n### 8. Execution Daemon Entrypoint (`backend/src/yinshi/execution_daemons.py`)\n\n`launcher_main()` — parses CLI flags `--launch-execution-enabled`, `--replica-prepare-enabled`, `--replica-reclaim-enabled`. Each passed as `explicit=True` to `resolve_*_gate()`.\n\n`broker_main()` — standard broker entrypoint, builds `BrokerService` with `LauncherSocketClient`.\n\n`ManagedRootWorker` used as `RootActionExecutor` in the launcher daemon.\n\n---\n\n### Concrete Lifecycle Effects That Can Safely Call\n\n**Nothing is callable from Python code without operator-enabling gates.**\n\nThe three concrete root effects are:\n\n| Effect | Gate Env Var | CLI Flag | Default |\n|--------|-------------|----------|---------|\n| `prepare` (replica staging → prepared) | `YINSHI_REPLICA_PREPARE_ENABLED=true` | `--replica-prepare-enabled` | OFF |\n| `launch` (execute executor) | `YINSHI_LAUNCH_EXECUTION_ENABLED=true` | `--launch-execution-enabled` | OFF |\n| `reclaim` (quarantine reclaim) | `YINSHI_REPLICA_RECLAIM_ENABLED=true` | `--replica-reclaim-enabled` | OFF |\n\nGate resolution requires **both** CLI flag present **AND** env var set to `\"true\"`.\n\nThe broker's `_finalize_lifecycle()` internally calls `launcher.prepare()` → `runtime.setup()` → `launcher.launch()`, all gated.\n\n---\n\n### Acceptance Report","controlEvents":[{"type":"active_long_running","to":"active_long_running","ts":1789266498900,"runId":"8ba826c1","agent":"scout","index":0,"message":"scout is still active but long-running","reason":"time_threshold","turns":11,"tokens":77823,"toolCount":20,"elapsedMs":240692},{"type":"needs_attention","from":"active_long_running","to":"needs_attention","ts":1789266549027,"runId":"8ba826c1","agent":"scout","index":0,"message":"scout needs attention (no observed activity for 60s)","reason":"idle","turns":11,"tokens":77823,"toolCount":20,"elapsedMs":60090}],"attemptedModels":["local-pilocal/qwen36-35b-a3b-iq4xs-mtp3-turbo3:high"],"modelAttempts":[{"model":"local-pilocal/qwen36-35b-a3b-iq4xs-mtp3-turbo3:high","success":true,"exitCode":0,"usage":{"input":166565,"output":4947,"cacheRead":340024,"cacheWrite":0,"cost":0,"turns":14}}],"sessionFile":"/Users/user/.pi/agent/sessions/--Users-user-projects-yinshi--/2026-09-04T04-44-52-550Z_01a06abb-dfc5-7c65-82bb-7c5f2081ee64/8ba826c1/run-0/session.jsonl","acceptance":{"status":"attested","evidenceStatus":"attested","explicit":false,"effectiveAcceptance":{"level":"attested","explicit":false,"inferredReason":["read-only/reviewer-style agent"],"criteria":[{"id":"criterion-1","must":"Return concrete findings with file paths and severity when applicable","evidence":["review-findings","residual-risks"],"severity":"required"}],"evidence":["review-findings","residual-risks"],"verify":[],"stopRules":[]},"inferredReason":["read-only/reviewer-style agent"],"criteria":[{"id":"criterion-1","must":"Return concrete findings with file paths and severity when applicable","evidence":["review-findings","residual-risks"],"severity":"required"}],"runtimeChecks":[],"verifyRuns":[],"childReport":{"criteriaSatisfied":[{"id":"criterion-1","status":"satisfied","evidence":"Exact paths confirmed: root_launcher.py (Launcher/RootLauncher/parse_launcher_request/derive_launch_locations/derive_reclaim_locations), execution_daemons.py (ManagedRootWorker/launcher_main/broker_main/resolve_*_gate), execution_broker.py (BrokerService/_finalize_lifecycle/_root_effect), broker_replica_lifecycle.py (BrokerReplicaLifecycleCoordinator/REPLICA_LIFECYCLE_STAGES), broker_replica_journal.py (ReplicaAuthority/AdmissionReceipt/IngestReceipt/...), broker_protocol.py (BrokerRequest/BrokerResponse/parse_signed_request/create_signed_response), workspace_admission.py (acquire_workspace_admission/WorkspaceAdmissionLease), managed_runners.py (claim_managed_runtime_provisioning/ManagedRuntimeStatus/lifecycle_status), managed_runtime_manager.py (ManagedRuntimeManager.provision/ensure_online/provision_restore_candidate), workspace_execution.py (ExecutionAdmission/PromptWorkspace), runner_worker.py (RunnerWorkerManager/dispatcher/quiesce). All three root gates default to False in root_launcher.py."}],"changedFiles":[],"testsAddedOrUpdated":[],"commandsRun":[{"command":"find /Users/user/projects/yinshi/backend/src/yinshi -type f -name '*.py'","result":"passed","summary":"Listed all backend Python source files"},{"command":"grep -rn 'LAUNCH_EXECUTION_ENABLED\\|REPLICA_PREPARE_ENABLED\\|REPLICA_RECLAIM_ENABLED' backend/src/","result":"passed","summary":"Confirmed gate definitions and defaults"},{"command":"grep -rn 'executor.launch' backend/src/","result":"passed","summary":"Confirmed single broker request type"},{"command":"grep -rn 'REPLICA_LIFECYCLE_STAGES' backend/src/","result":"passed","summary":"Confirmed seven-stage replica lifecycle order"}],"validationOutput":["root_launcher.py: LAUNCH_EXECUTION_ENABLED_DEFAULT=False, REPLICA_PREPARE_ENABLED_DEFAULT=False, REPLICA_RECLAIM_ENABLED_DEFAULT=False. execution_daemons.py: resolve_execution_gate/explicit=True AND env var 'true'. Broker only accepts 'executor.launch'. Replica journal immutable append-only SQLite with triggers preventing updates/deletes. Workspace admission uses fcntl locks + durable JSON markers."],"residualRisks":["All three root effects (launch/prepare/reclaim) are hard-disabled by default; operator must set both CLI flag and env var for each gate. No Python-side bypass exists.","BrokerService only supports 'executor.launch' request type; other request types raise BrokerProtocolError immediately.","Broker replica lifecycle (broker_replica_lifecycle.py) and broker executor lifecycle (execution_broker.py) are two separate pipelines with different journals, stages, and effect protocols.","RootWorker auto-disables on timeout/cancel/transport failure; disabled workers return rejected responses without retry.","ManagedRuntimeManager provisioning is gated by managed_backup_operation_is_running() check; concurrent backup operations block provisioning."],"noStagedFiles":true,"diffSummary":"No files modified. Pure inspection of /Users/user/projects/yinshi backend source.","reviewFindings":["info: root_launcher.py:33 - LAUNCH_EXECUTION_ENABLED_DEFAULT=False gates all executor launch","info: root_launcher.py:34-35 - REPLICA_PREPARE_ENABLED_DEFAULT=False gates prepare; REPLICA_RECLAIM_ENABLED_DEFAULT=False gates reclaim","info: execution_daemons.py:214-216 - resolve_*_gate() requires explicit=True AND env var == 'true', both conditions mandatory","info: execution_broker.py:36 - _SUPPORTED_REQUEST_TYPE = 'executor.launch', single fixed request type","info: broker_replica_lifecycle.py:39 - REPLICA_LIFECYCLE_STAGES = (ingest, verify, publish, admission, drain, export, reclaim)","info: broker_replica_journal.py:370 - SQLite schema has IMMUTABLE triggers preventing UPDATE/DELETE on events table","info: workspace_admission.py:502 - acquire_workspace_admission requires authority_hash (64 hex), operation_id (32 hex), kind in {integration,prompt,legacy}"],"manualNotes":"Three independent gate layers: 1) Python defaults (False) in root_launcher.py, 2) CLI flags in execution_daemons.py launcher_main(), 3) env vars. All three must align for any root action to succeed. The broker executor pipeline (execution_broker.py) and replica pipeline (broker_replica_lifecycle.py) are separate; the broker service only talks to the root launcher for prepare/launch/reclaim via LauncherSocketClient."}},"toolCalls":[{"text":"$ find /Users/projects/yinshi -maxdepth 3 -typ