&& grep -rn \"extern_ref\\|EXAC...","expandedText":"$ cd /Users/user/projects/yinshi && grep -rn \"extern_ref\\|EXACTLY_THREE\\|three_external\" --include=\"*.py\" backend/src/ | head -10"},{"text":"$ cd /Users/user/projects/yinshi && grep -rn \"RetainedInputs\\|...","expandedText":"$ cd /Users/user/projects/yinshi && grep -rn \"RetainedInputs\\|ExternalFacts\\|external_facts\" --include=\"*.py\" backend/src/yinshi/ | head -20"},{"text":"$ cd /Users/user/projects/yinshi && grep -rn \"import httpx\\|im...","expandedText":"$ cd /Users/user/projects/yinshi && grep -rn \"import httpx\\|import aiohttp\\|import requests\\|import urllib\\|requests\\.\\|httpx\\.\\|aiohttp\\.\\|urllib\\.\" --include=\"*.py\" backend/src/yinshi/ | grep -v \"__pycache__\\|\\.pyc\" | head -20"},{"text":"$ cd /Users/user/projects/yinshi && grep -rn \"RECLAIM\\|reclaim...","expandedText":"$ cd /Users/user/projects/yinshi && grep -rn \"RECLAIM\\|reclaim\" --include=\"*.py\" backend/src/yinshi/ | grep -v \"__pycache__\\|\\.pyc\" | head -20"},{"text":"read ~/projects/yinshi/backend/src/yinshi/services/workspace_replica.py","expandedText":"read ~/projects/yinshi/backend/src/yinshi/services/workspace_replica.py"},{"text":"$ cd /Users/user/projects/yinshi && grep -rn \"def verify_check...","expandedText":"$ cd /Users/user/projects/yinshi && grep -rn \"def verify_checkout\\|def validate_checkout\\|async def.*checkout\" --include=\"*.py\" backend/src/yinshi/ | grep -v \"__pycache__\" | head -20"},{"text":"$ cd /Users/user/projects/yinshi && grep -rn \"api.*checkout\\|/...","expandedText":"$ cd /Users/user/projects/yinshi && grep -rn \"api.*checkout\\|/checkout\" --include=\"*.py\" backend/src/yinshi/ | grep -v \"__pycache__\" | head -15"},{"text":"$ cd /Users/user/projects/yinshi && grep -rn \"external\" --incl...","expandedText":"$ cd /Users/user/projects/yinshi && grep -rn \"external\" --include=\"*.py\" backend/src/yinshi/ | grep -v \"__pycache__\" | wc -l"},{"text":"$ cd /Users/user/projects/yinshi && grep -rn \"class.*External\\...","expandedText":"$ cd /Users/user/projects/yinshi && grep -rn \"class.*External\\|EXTERNAL\\|_EXTERNAL\\|extern_ref\" --include=\"*.py\" backend/src/yinshi/ | grep -v \"__pycache__\" | head -10"},{"text":"$ cd /Users/user/projects/yinshi && grep -rn \"REPLICA_ARTIFACT...","expandedText":"$ cd /Users/user/projects/yinshi && grep -rn \"REPLICA_ARTIFACT_FILENAMES\\|REPLICA_OPERATION_PATTERN\" --include=\"*.py\" backend/src/yinshi/ | grep -v \"__pycache__\" | head -10"}]}]},{"key":"phase7","ok":true,"runId":"866834bc","output":"Turn budget wrap-up was requested after 10 assistant turns (soft limit 10, grace 2). Process-mode live steering is unavailable, so the child was warned at launch to wrap up by this budget. Output may be partial.\n\nPhase 7 gap analysis complete. Here are the findings.\n\n---\n\n## Phase 7 Requirements vs Current Checkout\n\nPhase 7 covers three features: **nested delegation** (depth up to 3), **cost/usage budgets**, and **child steering** (`thread_inbox_messages`).\n\n### 1. Nested Delegation\n\n**What Phase 5 supplies:**\n- Tree queries resolve nested descendants to depth 32 (hard limit in `_ANCESTRY_HOP_LIMIT`). Tested in `test_thread_queries.py:127-172` with grandchild rows.\n- `ThreadOrchestrationService.spawn_child()` enforces depth via `allows_spawn(depth, ...)` at `thread_orchestration.py:2935-2942`.\n- Cascade cancellation exists at `thread_orchestration.py:1632-1652` with its own `depth >= 32` guard.\n- Authorization uses `check_session_owner()` which only validates tenant ownership, not descendant scope.\n\n**Gaps:**\n- **Default `thread_max_depth = 1` blocks nested spawns.** `config.py:216`. Changing to 3 enables the math but no tests validate depth > 1 spawn paths.\n- **Recursive deletion NOT implemented.** The spec requires `DELETE /api/threads/{id}?recursive=true`. The `threads.py` API has zero DELETE endpoints. `backend/src/yinshi/api/threads.py` has no `delete` route.\n- **No tests at depth > 1.** All `test_thread_queries.py` limit tests use `max_depth=1` implicitly. `test_thread_orchestration.py` has no `depth_3` or `grandchild_spawn` tests.\n- **Descendant authorization untested.** Agent tools restrict to descendants but only at depth 1. No test verifies that a depth-2 child cannot access depth-1 siblings' results.\n- **Recovery at depth > 1 untested.** `test_thread_recovery.py` covers single-level stalls only.\n\n### 2. Cost and Usage Budgets\n\n**What exists:**\n- `usage_log` table (`db.py:1121-1142`) tracks per-session `input_tokens`, `output_tokens`, `cache_read_tokens`, `cache_write_tokens`, `cost_cents`.\n- `get_thread_limits()` returns current usage counts.\n\n**Gaps — fully missing:**\n- **No cross-session aggregation.** `get_thread_limits()` returns only the current session's usage, not aggregated descendant totals. Spec requires summing across all descendant session IDs.\n- **No policy model.** No table for `max_cost_cents`, `max_input_tokens`, `max_output_tokens`, `max_wall_clock_duration`.\n- **No enforcement.** Spawn and wait do not check budget limits before proceeding.\n- **No wall-clock tracking.** No `started_at` aggregation or duration check.\n- **No deterministic fallback.** Spec says \"enforce deterministic thread and concurrency limits when provider usage data unavailable.\" Not implemented.\n\n### 3. Child Steering (thread_inbox_messages)\n\n**Status: Fully unimplemented.**\n- No `thread_inbox_messages` tool registered in `sidecar/src/orchestration_tools.js` (only 6 tools: spawn, list, get, wait, cancel, report).\n- No inbox database table.\n- No message queue service.\n- No attention indicators in tree nodes.\n- No reopening of completed children.\n- No result supersession/versioning.\n- No idempotent message submission.\n\n### What Blocks Phase 7 (Phase 6 dependencies)\n\nPhase 6 (managed integration) provides `thread_integration.py` which is already present. Phase 7 depends on Phase 6's clean integration path being stable. The integration table and cherry-pick workflow exist in `backend/src/yinshi/services/thread_integration.py`.\n\n---","artifactPaths":["/Users/user/.pi/agent/sessions/--Users-user-projects-yinshi--/2026-09-04T04-44-52-550Z_01a06abb-dfc5-7c65-82bb-7c5f2081ee64/866834bc/run-0/session.jsonl"],"results":[{"index":0,"agent":"scout","task":"Compare Phase 7 requirements in /Users/user/Downloads/yinshi-thread-orchestration-plan.md with the current checkout implementation and tests. Report a concise requirement-by-requirement gap list, noting what Phase 5 already supplies and what remains blocked by Phase 6. Do not modify files.","routingContract":{"version":1,"agent":"scout","model":"local-pilocal/qwen36-35b-a3b-iq4xs-mtp3-turbo3","thinking":"high","policyDigest":"8590d2fc0420152aad3f867aba1c18a56b3632f2d90e01d30d3f04676cd46ac5"},"launchContractDigest":"46ddaae0d3110b012112542aed1b0fa198ec5144593e6a5dbaa8956ed5ee1d11","launchResolvedExtensions":{"version":1,"source":"launch-resolved","disableAmbientExtensions":false,"runtime":["sha256:cb00ccf63b7cf9f4"],"configured":[],"effective":["sha256:cb00ccf63b7cf9f4"],"omitted":{"runtime":0,"configured":0,"effective":0}},"exitCode":0,"outputState":"present","usage":{"input":70989,"output":5682,"cacheRead":632503,"cacheWrite":0,"cost":0,"turns":16},"model":"local-pilocal/qwen36-35b-a3b-iq4xs-mtp3-turbo3:high","thinking":"high","artifactPaths":{"inputPath":"/Users/user/projects/yinshi/.pi-subagents/artifacts/866834bc_scout_0_input.md","outputPath":"/Users/user/projects/yinshi/.pi-subagents/artifacts/866834bc_scout_0_output.md","jsonlPath":"/Users/user/projects/yinshi/.pi-subagents/artifacts/866834bc_scout_0.jsonl","transcriptPath":"/Users/user/projects/yinshi/.pi-subagents/artifacts/866834bc_scout_0_transcript.jsonl","metadataPath":"/Users/user/projects/yinshi/.pi-subagents/artifacts/866834bc_scout_0_meta.json"},"transcriptPath":"/Users/user/projects/yinshi/.pi-subagents/artifacts/866834bc_scout_0_transcript.jsonl","turnBudget":{"maxTurns":10,"