_inbox_messages tool or inbox table for child steering","gap: no tests at depth > 1 for cascade cancel, recursive deletion, or descendant auth"],"manualNotes":"Phase 5 (agent delegation) is fully implemented with all 6 Pi tools. Phase 6 (integration) is implemented. Phase 7 has the most gaps: nested depth needs tests and DELETE routes, budgets need a policy model and enforcement, steering is a greenfield feature requiring new tables and tools. The existing tree query infrastructure handles depth 2-3 correctly for reads, and cascade cancellation traverses depth 32, so the read/cancel path at depth>1 is mostly there. The main blockers are: DELETE endpoints, budget enforcement, inbox steering, and comprehensive depth>1 tests."}},"toolCalls":[{"text":"read ~/Downloads/yinshi-thread-orchestration-plan.md","expandedText":"read ~/Downloads/yinshi-thread-orchestration-plan.md"},{"text":"$ find /Users/user/projects/yinshi -type f \\( -name \"*.go\" -o ...","expandedText":"$ find /Users/user/projects/yinshi -type f \\( -name \"*.go\" -o -name \"*.md\" -o -name \"*.yaml\" -o -name \"*.yml\" -o -name \"*.json\" \\) | head -100"},{"text":"read ~/Downloads/yinshi-thread-orchestration-plan.md","expandedText":"read ~/Downloads/yinshi-thread-orchestration-plan.md"},{"text":"$ ls /Users/user/projects/yinshi/backend/src/yinshi/services/ ...","expandedText":"$ ls /Users/user/projects/yinshi/backend/src/yinshi/services/ 2>/dev/null; echo \"---\"; ls /Users/user/projects/yinshi/backend/src/yinshi/api/ 2>/dev/null; echo \"---\"; ls /Users/user/projects/yinshi/backend/tests/ 2>/dev/null | head -40"},{"text":"$ ls /Users/user/projects/yinshi/backend/tests/ 2>/dev/null | ...","expandedText":"$ ls /Users/user/projects/yinshi/backend/tests/ 2>/dev/null | grep -i thread"},{"text":"read ~/projects/yinshi/backend/src/yinshi/services/thread_orchestration.py","expandedText":"read ~/projects/yinshi/backend/src/yinshi/services/thread_orchestration.py"},{"text":"read ~/projects/yinshi/backend/src/yins