{"type":"message","id":"12b4e86a","parentId":"045a845e","timestamp":"2026-09-13T02:33:51.989Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_rsyU5PGZGDmklXJVnVSzcm9L|fc_0212e7de83dbbd32016aa60b8ec71887d0a33d25d6bbd2661b","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"/Users/user/Downloads/yinshi-thread-orchestration-plan.md","offset":1990,"limit":150}}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.6-sol","usage":{"input":315,"output":38,"cacheRead":84736,"cacheWrite":0,"reasoning":0,"totalTokens":85089,"cost":{"input":0.0015750000000000002,"output":0.00114,"cacheRead":0.042367999999999996,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.045083}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1789266828787,"responseId":"resp_0212e7de83dbbd32016aa60b8d413487d093c0caf4d4359530","rawStopReason":"completed"}}
{"type":"message","id":"158cf2d6","parentId":"12b4e86a","timestamp":"2026-09-13T02:33:52.000Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_rsyU5PGZGDmklXJVnVSzcm9L|fc_0212e7de83dbbd32016aa60b8ec71887d0a33d25d6bbd2661b","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"11. Browser reconnection replays normal parent events.\n12. Duplicate `spawn_thread` delivery returns the same child.\n13. Restart produces explicit interrupted states and no orphaned worktrees.\n\n### Launch configuration\n\n```text\nmaximum depth = 1\nmaximum active descendants = 4\nmaximum total threads = 20\nmanaged integration = disabled\n```\n\n### Exit criteria\n\nA parent Pi agent can reliably delegate independent one-shot tasks and synthesize their results.\n\n## Phase 6: Managed integration\n\n### Work\n\nCreate:\n\n```text\nbackend/src/yinshi/services/thread_integration.py\nbackend/tests/test_thread_integration.py\nfrontend/src/components/ThreadIntegrationPanel.tsx\n```\n\nImplement:\n\n- Integration table\n- Idempotent integration API\n- Temporary integration worktree\n- Trial cherry-pick\n- Conflict reporting\n- Parent revalidation\n- Clean-parent application\n- Abort and restore behavior\n- Resulting commit recording\n- User confirmation\n- Optional parent-agent integration tool behind a separate flag\n\n### Test matrix\n\n- Exact-base integration\n- Parent advanced without conflict\n- Parent advanced with conflict\n- Dirty-parent rejection\n- Duplicate request\n- Missing child result ref\n- Parent changes between trial and application\n- Git failure during application\n- Application abort\n- No partial mutation after conflict\n- Same child integrated twice\n- Unauthorized sibling integration\n\n### Exit criteria\n\nA completed child can be integrated into a clean parent with deterministic conflict behavior and idempotent recovery.\n\n## Phase 7: Nested delegation, budgets, and steering\n\n### Nested delegation\n\nIncrease maximum depth to three only after validating:\n\n- Descendant authorization\n- Recursive limit calculations\n- Cascade cancellation\n- Recursive deletion\n- Tree rendering\n- Aggregate usage\n- Recovery\n\n### Cost and usage budgets\n\nAggregate usage across descendant session IDs.\n\nAdd optional policies:\n\n```text\nmaximum estimated cost cents\nmaximum input tokens\nmaximum output tokens\nmaximum wall-clock duration\n```\n\nWhen exact provider usage is unavailable, report incomplete usage and enforce deterministic thread and concurrency limits.\n\n### Child steering\n\nAdd later:\n\n```text\nthread_inbox_messages\n```\n\nSupport:\n\n- Parent-to-child queued messages\n- Delivery after the current run finishes\n- Idempotent message submission\n- Explicit reopening of completed children\n- Result supersession or versioning\n- Child attention indicators\n\nNever overlap prompt runs in one session.\n\n### Exit criteria\n\nNested delegation, cost controls, and queued steering work without uncontrolled recursion or overlapping child runs.\n\n# 24. Parallel agent assignment\n\nMerge Phase 0 contracts before parallel implementation.\n\n## Agent A: Schema, query model, and public API\n\n**Owns:**\n\n```text\nbackend/src/yinshi/tenant.py\nbackend/src/yinshi/db.py\nbackend/src/yinshi/models.py\nbackend/src/yinshi/api/threads.py\nbackend/src/yinshi/services/thread_queries.py\nbackend/tests/test_thread_schema.py\nbackend/tests/test_thread_queries.py\nbackend/tests/test_thread_api.py\n```\n\n**Deliverables:**\n\n- Migrations\n- Models\n- Recursive queries\n- Read APIs\n- Authorization\n- Deletion guards\n\n**Dependency:** Phase 0 contract\n\n## Agent B: Git snapshot and workspace isolation\n\n**Owns:**\n\n```text\nbackend/src/yinshi/services/thread_workspaces.py\n\n[352 more lines in file. Use offset=2140 to continue.]"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1789266832000}}
