{"type":"message","id":"8802ab71","parentId":"3dece088","timestamp":"2026-09-13T02:48:10.510Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"**Planning final software-design inclusion**\n\n**Designing parallel final-review groups**","thinkingSignature":"{\"id\":\"rs_0212e7de83dbbd32016aa60ed1861887d087a31b0a52643560\",\"type\":\"reasoning\",\"content\":[],\"encrypted_content\":\"REDACTED\",\"summary\":[{\"type\":\"summary_text\",\"text\":\"**Planning final software-design inclusion**\"},{\"type\":\"summary_text\",\"text\":\"**Designing parallel final-review groups**\"}]}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_Q328csUJ0s0EFrEeoeL4neSh|fc_0212e7de83dbbd32016aa60edcd63087d086ba5723d2912c49","name":"subagent","arguments":{"workflowScript":"const common='Original request: finish Phase 6 managed integration before Phase 7. Current checkout has a heavily dirty inherited Phase 6 candidate plus committed broker foundations. Review only; do not modify files. Read the actual current diff and relevant callers/tests. First read /Users/user/.pi/agent/skills/software-design/SKILL.md and its referenced red-flags file, and apply that guidance. Every finding must include location or affected requirement, impact, proposed correction, and validation. If no findings remain, state that no remediation is needed.'; return await runs.all([{key:'delete_review',agent:'final-review',task:common+' Scope: repository deletion and recovery only: backend/src/yinshi/api/repos.py, repository_lifecycle.py, services/repository_lifecycle.py, repository_deletion_recovery.py, workspace_deletion.py, related workspace deletion APIs and tests. Check imported versus managed ownership, quarantine ancestry, durable receipts, crash recovery, and fail-closed malformed state.'},{key:'integration_review',agent:'final-review',task:common+' Scope: managed integration feature and UI only: thread_integration.py, thread_workspaces.py integration paths, API/sidecar/frontend integration files and focused tests. Check exact source/result commit binding, deterministic cherry-pick and conflict handling, cancellation, recovery, database boundaries, and no hidden native execution requirement.'},{key:'isolation_review',agent:'final-review',task:common+' Scope: workspace isolation, admission, execution, runtime-path, prompt/terminal gating, desktop localRuntime/isolation profile, sidecar isolation gate, deployment files, docs, and focused tests. Check fail-closed native Darwin and unqualified Linux, independently disabled gates, ownership, persisted receipts, crash recovery, and absence of bypass paths.'},{key:'broker_review',agent:'final-review',task:common+' Scope: uncommitted broker/root files plus committed 7f91105f and 922f197b. Check root protocol remains prepare/launch/reclaim only, fixed identities, marker/sync/rename/reclaim behavior, authenticated frames, lifecycle journals, relay fixed path, startup recovery, timeout and cancellation classifications, and no false production-support claim.'},{key:'schema_review',agent:'final-review',task:common+' Scope: cross-cutting db.py, tenant.py, models.py, config.py, main.py, API settings/stream/terminal/thread changes, test fixtures, and docs. Check schema migrations, authorization and tenant binding, backward compatibility, information leakage, and whether all Phase 6 changes form one coherent fail-closed system. Identify only concrete defects.'}]);","chatProgress":"live-card","context":"fresh","cwd":"/Users/user/projects/yinshi","async":false,"timeoutMs":1800000,"turnBudget":{"maxTurns":18,"graceTurns":3},"toolBudget":{"soft":55,"hard":80,"block":["bash","read","grep","find","ls"]},"artifacts":true,"outputMode":"inline","usageBudget":{"tokens":{"hard":180000}}}}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.6-sol","usage":{"input":2166,"output":1024,"cacheRead":129664,"cacheWrite":0,"reasoning":384,"totalTokens":132854,"cost":{"input":0.010830000000000001,"output":0.03072,"cacheRead":0.064832