tion:**  \\n- `backend/src/yinshi/services/broker_runtime.py:91-164`\\n- `backend/src/yinshi/root_launcher.py:1600-1650`\\n- Affected requirement: drain, shutdown, and guarded reclaim\\n\\n**Impact:** `BrokerRuntime.close()` only closes retained listener. It never unlinks `session.sock` or removes operation directory. Root reclaim requires runtime directory absence. Successful launches and crash leftovers therefore cannot reach reclaim through current APIs.\\n\\n**Correction:** Make broker runtime module own descriptor-safe shutdown and recovery. It must validate inode identity, close listener, unlink socket, remove directory, and sync runtime root. Invoke this only after durable drain, export, and dead-runtime proof.\\n\\n**Remediation:** `worker-expert`. Cleanup authority, crash recovery, and irreversible reclaim interact.\\n\\n**Required validation:**\\n- Complete launch, drain, export, runtime shutdown, then reclaim.\\n- Kill broker before and after each unlink or sync point.\\n- Recover stale socket paths without adopting foreign state.\\n- Confirm live runtime and missing drain acknowledgment block cleanup.\\n- Confirm root receives only `reclaim(operation_id)`.\\n\\n### 3. Blocker: Startup recovery ignores Phase 6 state\\n\\n**Location:**  \\n- `backend/src/yinshi/execution_daemons.py:909-925`\\n- `backend/src/yinshi/services/broker_artifact_store.py:840`\\n- `backend/src/yinshi/services/broker_replica_journal.py:1977`\\n- `backend/src/yinshi/services/broker_replica_lifecycle.py:288`\\n- Affected requirement: startup recovery before readiness\\n\\n**Impact:** Startup checks legacy launch journal and runs only `BrokerService.recover_startup()`. It does not open or validate replica journal, reconcile artifact attempts, inspect publication state, reconcile root/runtime state, or recover replica lifecycles. Malformed or future Phase 6 state therefore does not block readiness.\\n\\n**Correction:** Add one fail-closed startup recovery coordinator. Run journal validation, artifact reconciliation, publication reconciliation, root/runtime observation, then lifecycle recovery before accepting connections.\\n\\n**Remediation:** `worker-expert`. Recovery ordering determines durable authority across several modules.\\n\\n**Required validation:**\\n- Reject malformed and future-version replica journals.\\n- Test orphan incoming, published, staging, prepared, and runtime entries.\\n- Inject crashes after every effect and before journal completion.\\n- Prove no connection is accepted before recovery finishes.\\n- Cover live runtime restart and lost final response.\\n\\n## Confirmed scoped behavior\\n\\n- Root protocol remains `prepare`, `launch`, and `reclaim`.\\n- Root paths, commands, units, and executor names are derived internally.\\n- Marker publication uses file sync, rename, then directory sync.\\n- Relay uses fixed `/run/yinshi/broker.sock` and accepts no options.\\n- Existing protocol and journal primitives authenticate frames.\\n- Deployment gates remain disabled by default.\\n- Scoped documentation does not claim production support.\\n\\nThese primitives do not resolve missing managed integration.\\n\\n## Validation\\n\\nFocused current-working-tree tests passed:\\n\\n```text\\n295 passed, 2 warnings in 22.36s\\n```\\n\\nTests cover broker foundations, lifecycle primitives, relay, daemon helpers, root launcher, artifact store, replica journal, and lifecycle coordinator.\\n\\nLinux systemd, cgroup, mount, UID, and socket-pin behavior was not exercised on this macOS host. Broader dirty files outside stated scope were not reviewed.\\n\\nUnresolved blockers prevent completion. Remediation is required.\",\n        \"controlEvents\": [\n          {\n            \"type\": \"active_long_running\",\n            \"to\": \"active_long_running\",\n            \"ts\": 1789267931662,\n            \"runId\": \"d04076ad\",\n            \"agent\": \"final-review\",\n            \"index\": 0,\n            \"message\": \"final-review is still active but long-running\",\n            \"reason\": \"time_threshold\",\n            \"turns\": 14,\n            \"tokens\": 186532,\n            \"toolCount\": 58,\n            \"elapsedMs\": 240564\n          }\n        ],\n        \"attemptedModels\": [\n          \"openai-codex/gpt-5.6-sol:max\"\n        ],\n        \"modelAttempts\": [\n          {\n            \"model\": \"openai-codex/gpt-5.6-sol:max\",\n            \"success\": true,\n            \"exitCode\": 0,\n            \"usage\": {\n              \"input\": 189616,\n              \"output\": 11305,\n              \"cacheRead\": 436864,\n              \"cacheWrite\": 0,\n              \"cost\": 1.5056619999999998,\n              \"turns\": 15\n            }\n          }\n        ],\n        \"sessionFile\": \"/Users/user/.pi/agent/sessions/--Users-user-projects-yinshi--/2026-09-04T04-44-52-550Z_01a06abb-dfc5-7c65-82bb-7c5f2081ee64/d04076ad/run-0/session.jsonl\",\n        \"acceptance\": {\n          \"status\": \"attested\",\n          \"evidenceStatus\": \"attested\",\n          \"explicit\": false,\n          \"effectiveAcceptance\": {\n            \"level\": \"attested\",\n            \"explicit\": false,\n            \"inferredReason\": [\n              \"read-only task wording\"\n            ],\n            \"criteria\": [\n              {\n                \"id\": \"criterion-1\",\n                \"must\": \"Return concrete findings with file paths and severity when applicable\",\n                \"evidence\": [\n                  \"review-findings\",\n                  \"residual-risks\"\n                ],\n                \"severity\": \"required\"\n              }\n            ],\n            \"evidence\": [\n              \"review-findings\",\n              \"residual-risks\"\n            ],\n            \"verify\": [],\n            \"stopRules\": []\n          },\n          \"inferredReason\": [\n            \"read-only task wording\"\n          ],\n          \"criteria\": [\n            {\