e.close closes only the listener while root reclaim requires runtime directory absence.\",\n              \"Broker startup performs only legacy journal inspection and executor.launch recovery.\"\n            ],\n            \"residualRisks\": [\n              \"Linux systemd, cgroup, mount, ownership, and socket-pin behavior was not exercised on this macOS host.\",\n              \"Dirty files outside the stated broker/root and two-commit scope were not reviewed.\"\n            ],\n            \"noStagedFiles\": true,\n            \"diffSummary\": \"Scoped candidate adds disabled broker/root foundations plus artifact, publication, journal, and lifecycle primitives. It lacks managed Phase 6 composition, runtime teardown, and Phase 6 startup recovery.\",\n            \"reviewFindings\": [\n              \"blocker: backend/src/yinshi/execution_daemons.py:886-925 - replica.lifecycle coordinator and committed foundations are not wired into broker service.\",\n              \"blocker: backend/src/yinshi/services/broker_runtime.py:159-164 - runtime close cannot produce the absent runtime state required by root reclaim.\",\n              \"blocker: backend/src/yinshi/execution_daemons.py:909-925 - startup recovery ignores replica journal, artifacts, publication, root state, and runtime state.\"\n            ],\n            \"manualNotes\": \"Results apply to the current working tree at review time, including scoped untracked files. All findings remain unresolved and block completion.\"\n          }\n        },\n        \"toolCalls\": [\n          {\n            \"text\": \"read ~/.pi/agent/skills/software-design/SKILL.md\",\n            \"expandedText\": \"read ~/.pi/agent/skills/software-design/SKILL.md\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"text\": \"read ~/.pi/agent/skills/software-design/references/red-flags.md\",\n            \"expandedText\": \"read ~/.pi/agent/skills/software-design/references/red-flags.md\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"text\": \"ls