ation stores the original `expected_parent_head`. Successful application advances parent `HEAD`. Later requests recompute current `parent_head`, then `_same_operation()` requires it to equal the stored original head.\\n\\n**Impact:** Same-key replay and status lookup can reject a successfully integrated operation as an identity mismatch. This breaks idempotency and durable result discovery.\\n\\n**Correction:** Compare stored expected head with the replay request value, not current checkout head. Validate current head separately using stage-specific durable facts such as `resulting_parent_head`.\\n\\n**Remediation:** `worker-advanced`. The fix interacts with Git state, durable replay, authorization, and recovery classification.\\n\\n**Validation:**\\n- Replay the original request after integration. Confirm the same operation returns without another commit.\\n- Fetch operation status after integration. Confirm HTTP 200.\\n- Reuse the key with changed request facts. Confirm HTTP 409.\\n- Change parent `HEAD` unexpectedly. Confirm a blocked recovery result rather than false success.\\n- Run `test_thread_integration.py` and `test_thread_integration_discovery.py`.\\n\\n### Low: migration documentation reports obsolete schema versions\\n\\n**Locations:**  \\n- `docs/thread-orchestration.md`, migration section\\n- `backend/src/yinshi/db.py:24`\\n- `backend/src/yinshi/tenant.py:52`\\n- `backend/tests/test_tenant.py:1682`\\n\\nDocumentation reports shared schema version 10 and tenant version 7. Current constants are 11 and 9. One test comment also calls version 8 current while setting version 9.\\n\\n**Impact:** Operators and maintainers receive incorrect upgrade and rollback guidance.\\n\\n**Correction:** Update documented versions and stale comments. Prefer referencing named migrations where fixed numbers add no value.\\n\\n**Remediation:** `worker-simple`.\\n\\n**Validation:** Compare documentation with `_SCHEMA_VERSION` and `_USER_SCHEMA_VERSION`. Run schema migration and ownership contract tests.\\n\\n## Review limits and residual risks\\n\\nNo test suite was repeated after tool-budget exhaustion. Earlier reported focused results apply to earlier review points, not attested final-candidate validation.\\n\\nCommitted broker lifecycle internals were not fully re-reviewed in this pass. Production Linux deployment and external lifecycle effects remain unvalidated.\\n\\nNo files were edited, staged, committed, or pushed. Findings remain unresolved, so completion is blocked.\",\n        \"controlEvents\": [\n          {\n            \"type\": \"active_long_running\",\n            \"to\": \"active_long_running\",\n            \"ts\": 1789267931143,\n            \"runId\": \"861fc52a\",\n            \"agent\": \"final-review\",\n            \"index\": 0,\n            \"message\": \"final-review is still active but long-running\",\n            \"reason\": \"time_threshold\",\n            \"turns\": 14,\n            \"tokens\": 179561,\n            \"toolCount\": 58,\n            \"elapsedMs\": 240007\n          }\n        ],\n        \"attemptedModels\": [\n          \"openai-codex/gpt-5.6-sol:max\"\n        ],\n        \"modelAttempts\": [\n          {\n            \"model\": \"openai-codex/gpt-5.6-sol:max\",\n            \"success\": true,\n            \"exitCode\": 0,\n            \"usage\": {\n              \"input\": 247610,\n              \"output\": 13560,\n              \"cacheRead\": 570112,\n              \"cacheWrite\": 0,\n              \"cost\": 1.929906,\n              \"turns\": 15\n            }\n          }\n        ],\n        \"sessionFile\": \"/Users/user/.pi/agent/sessions/--Users-user-projects-yinshi--/2026-09-04T04-44-52-550Z_01a06abb-dfc5-7c65-82bb-7c5f2081ee64/861fc52a/run-0/session.jsonl\",\n        \"acceptance\": {\n          \"status\": \"attested\",\n          \"evidenceStatus\": \"attested\",\n          \"explicit\": false,\n          \"effectiveAcceptance\": {\n            \"level\": \"attested\",\n         