sed on this macOS host.","Dirty files outside the stated broker/root and two-commit scope were not reviewed."],"noStagedFiles":true,"diffSummary":"Scoped candidate adds disabled broker/root foundations plus artifact, publication, journal, and lifecycle primitives. It lacks managed Phase 6 composition, runtime teardown, and Phase 6 startup recovery.","reviewFindings":["blocker: backend/src/yinshi/execution_daemons.py:886-925 - replica.lifecycle coordinator and committed foundations are not wired into broker service.","blocker: backend/src/yinshi/services/broker_runtime.py:159-164 - runtime close cannot produce the absent runtime state required by root reclaim.","blocker: backend/src/yinshi/execution_daemons.py:909-925 - startup recovery ignores replica journal, artifacts, publication, root state, and runtime state."],"manualNotes":"Results apply to the current working tree at review time, including scoped untracked files. All findings remain unresolved and block completion."}},"toolCalls":[{"text":"read ~/.pi/agent/skills/software-design/SKILL.md","expandedText":"read ~/.pi/agent/skills/software-design/SKILL.md"},{"text":"read ~/.pi/agent/skills/software-design/references/red-flags.md","expandedText":"read ~/.pi/agent/skills/software-design/references/red-flags.md"},{"text":"ls {\"path\":\".\",\"limit\":200}","expandedText":"ls {\"path\":\".\",\"limit\":200}"},{"text":"find {\"path\":\".\",\"pattern\":\"**/{AGENTS.md,CLA...","expandedText":"find {\"path\":\".\",\"pattern\":\"**/{AGENTS.md,CLAUDE.md,CONTRIBUTING.md,README.md}\",\"limit\":200}"},{"text":"$ git status --short && printf '\\n--- HEAD ---\\n' && git log -...","expandedText":"$ git status --short && printf '\\n--- HEAD ---\\n' && git log --oneline --decorate -12 && printf '\\n--- DIFF STAT ---\\n' && git diff --stat && printf '\\n--- STAGED STAT ---\\n' && git diff --cached --stat"},{"text":"find {\"path\":\".\",\"pattern\":\"**/*{plan,PLAN,ph...","expandedText":"find {\"path\":\".\",\"pattern\":\"**/*{plan