":"$ git diff --numstat; printf '\\n--- untracked relevant sizes -...","expandedText":"$ git diff --numstat; printf '\\n--- untracked relevant sizes ---\\n'; for f in $(git ls-files --others --exclude-standard | grep -E '^(backend|desktop|sidecar|deploy|docs)/' | sort); do wc -l \"$f\"; done"},{"text":"$ rg -n 'integration.*enabled|managed_integration|thread_integ...","expandedText":"$ rg -n 'integration.*enabled|managed_integration|thread_integration|integrate' backend/src/yinshi/config.py backend/src/yinshi/api/threads.py backend/src/yinshi/services/thread_orchestration.py backend/src/yinshi/main.py frontend/src | head ..."},{"text":"$ nl -ba backend/src/yinshi/services/thread_integration.py | s...","expandedText":"$ nl -ba backend/src/yinshi/services/thread_integration.py | sed -n '1,260p;260,560p;560,900p'"},{"text":"$ rg -n 'require_isolated_execution|acquire_workspace_admissio...","expandedText":"$ rg -n 'require_isolated_execution|acquire_workspace_admission|admission|receipt|recover|blocked|applying|checking|cherry' backend/src/yinshi/services/thread_integration.py backend/tests/test_thread_integration*.py | head -500"},{"text":"$ nl -ba docs/workspace-isolation.md; printf '\\n--- broker doc...","expandedText":"$ nl -ba docs/workspace-isolation.md; printf '\\n--- broker docs ---\\n'; nl -ba docs/broker-root-launcher.md"},{"text":"$ rg -n 'YINSHI_.*ENABLED|_DEFAULT|parse.*enabled|execution_en...","expandedText":"$ rg -n 'YINSHI_.*ENABLED|_DEFAULT|parse.*enabled|execution_enabled|prepare_enabled|reclaim_enabled' backend/src/yinshi/execution_daemons.py backend/src/yinshi/root_launcher.py backend/src/yinshi/services/execution_broker.py backend/src/yinsh..."},{"text":"grep {\"path\":\"sidecar/tests/isolation-gate.te...","expandedText":"grep {\"path\":\"sidecar/tests/isolation-gate.test.js\",\"pattern\":\"without\",\"ignoreCase\":true,\"context\":4,\"limit\":80}"},{"text":"grep {\"path\":\"sidecar/tests/execution-admissi...","expandedText":"grep {\"path\":\"sidecar/tests/execution-admission.test.js\",\"pattern\":\"query\",\"ignoreCase\":true,\"context\":5,\"limit\":80}"},{"text":"read sidecar/package.json","expandedText":"read sidecar/package.json"},{"text":"read desktop/package.json","expandedText":"read desktop/package.json"},{"text":"read backend/pyproject.toml","expandedText":"read backend/pyproject.toml"},{"text":"$ nl -ba sidecar/tests/isolation-gate.test.js | sed -n '120,23...","expandedText":"$ nl -ba sidecar/tests/isolation-gate.test.js | sed -n '120,235p;430,585p'; nl -ba sidecar/tests/execution-admission.test.js | sed -n '1,190p'"},{"text":"$ cd backend && ../.venv/bin/pytest -q tests/test_workspace_is...","expandedText":"$ cd backend && ../.venv/bin/pytest -q tests/test_workspace_isolation_gate.py tests/test_workspace_isolation_sidecar_prepare.py tests/test_workspace_isolation_status.py tests/test_workspace_isolation_untrusted.py tests/test_workspace_executio..."},{"text":"$ cd sidecar && node --test tests/isolation-gate.test.js tests...","expandedText":"$ cd sidecar && node --test tests/isolation-gate.test.js tests/execution-admission.test.js tests/terminal.test.js"},{"text":"$ cd desktop && npm test -- --run src/localRuntime.test.ts src...","expandedText":"$ cd desktop && npm test -- --run src/localRuntime.test.ts src/appController.test.ts && npm run typecheck"},{"text":"$ cd backend && ../.venv/bin/python -m compileall -q src/yinsh...","expandedText":"$ cd backend && ../.venv/bin/python -m compileall -q src/yinshi && ../.venv/bin/ruff check src/yinshi/services/workspace_isolation.py src/yinshi/services/workspace_admission.py src/yinshi/services/workspace_execution.py src/yinshi/services/wo..."}]}]},{"key":"broker_review","ok":true,"runId":"d04076ad","output":"## Confirmed findings\n\n### 1. Blocker: Phase 6 lifecycle remains unreachable\n\n**Location:**  \n- `backend/src/yinshi/services/execution_broker.py:44`\n- `backend/src/yinshi/execution_daemons.py:886-925`\n- `backend/src/yinshi/services/broker_replica_lifecycle.py:172`\n- Affected requirement: managed seven-stage lifecycle integration\n\n**Impact:** Broker accepts only `executor.launch`. No caller constructs `BrokerReplicaLifecycleCoordinator`, `BrokerReplicaJournal`, or `BrokerArtifactStore`. `replica.lifecycle` cannot reach ingest, verification, publication, admission, drain, export, or reclaim.\n\n**Correction:** Add one broker replica service that owns authenticated routing, protected authority derivation, concrete stage effects, lifecycle journaling, and terminal response creation. Wire it into daemon startup.\n\n**Remediation:** `worker-expert`. This fix spans authentication, persistence, external effects, recovery, and process ownership.\n\n**Required validation:**\n- Send one signed `replica.lifecycle` frame through relay and broker.\n- Exercise all seven stages.\n- Verify exact retry replay without duplicate effects.\n- Reject caller-supplied executor identity or privileged path data.\n- Verify signed terminal response end to end.\n\n### 2. Blocker: Runtime state has no reclaimable teardown path\n\n**Location:**  \n- `backend/src/yinshi/services/broker_runtime.py:91-164`\n- `backend/src/yinshi/root_launcher.py:1600-1650`\n- Affected requirement: drain, shutdown, and guarded reclaim\n\n**Impact:** `BrokerRuntime.close()` only closes retained listener. It never unlinks `session.sock` or removes operation directory. Root reclaim requires runtime directory absence. Successful launches and crash leftovers therefore cannot reach reclaim through current APIs.\n\n**Correction:** Make broker runtime module own descriptor-safe shutdown and recovery. It must validate inode identity, close listener, unlink socket, remove directory, and sync runtime root. Invoke this only after durable drain, export, and dead-runtime proof.\n\n**Remediation:** `worker-expert`. Cleanup authority, crash recovery, and irreversible reclaim interact.\n\n**Required validation:**\n- Complete launch, drain, export, runtime shutdown, then reclaim.\n- Kill broker before and after each unlink or sync point.\n- Recover stale socket paths without adopting foreign state.\n- Confirm live runtime and missing drain acknowledgment block cleanup.\n- Confirm root receives only `reclaim(operation_id)`.\n\n### 3. Blocker: Startup recovery ignores Phase 6 state\n\n**Location:**  \n- `backend/src/yinshi/execution_daemons.py:909-925`\n- `backend/src/yinshi/services/broker_artifact_store.py:840`\n- `backend/src/yinshi/services/broker_replica_journal.py:1977`\n- `backend/src/yinshi/services/broker_replica_lifecycle.py:288`\n- Affected requirement: startup recovery before readiness\n\n**Impact:** Startup checks legacy launch journal and runs only `BrokerService.recover_startup()`. It does not open or validate replica journal, reconcile artifact attempts, inspect publication state, reconcile root/runtime state, or recover replica lifecycles. Malformed or future Phase 6 state therefore does not block readiness.\n\n**Correction:** Add one fail-closed startup recovery coordinator. Run journal validation, artifact reconciliation, publication reconciliation, root/runtime observation, then lifecycle recovery before accepting connections.\n\n**Remediation:** `worker-expert`. Recovery ordering determines durable authority across several modules.\n\n**Required validation:**\n- Reject malformed and future-version replica journals.\n- Test orphan incoming, published, staging, prepared, and runtime entries.\n- Inject crashes after every effect and before journal completion.\n- Prove no connection is accepted before recovery finishes.\n- Cover live runtime restart and lost final response.\n\n## Confirmed scoped behavior\n\n- Root protocol remains `prepare`, `launch`, and `reclaim`.\n- Root paths, commands, units, and executor names are derived internally.\n- Marker publication uses file sync, rename, then directory sync.\n- Relay uses fixed `/run/yinshi/broker.sock` and accepts no options.\n- Existing protocol and journal primitives authenticate frames.\n- Deployment gates remain disabled by default.\n- Scoped documentation does not claim production support.\n\nThese primitives do not resolve missing managed integration.\n\n## Validation\n\nFocused current-working-tree tests passed:\n\n```text\n295 passed, 2 warnings in 22.36s\n```\n\nTests cover broker foundations, lifecycle primitives, relay, daemon helpers, root launcher, artifact store, replica journal, and lifecycle coordinator.\n\nLinux systemd, cgroup, mount, UID, and socket-pin behavior was not exercised on this macOS host. Broader dirty files outside stated scope were not reviewed.\n\nUnresolved blockers prevent completion. Remediation is required.","artifactPaths":["/Users/user/.pi/agent/sessions/--Users-user-projects-yinshi--/2026-09-04T04-44-52-550Z_01a06abb-dfc5-7c65-82bb-7c5f2081ee64/d04076ad/run-0/session.jsonl"],"results":[{"index":0,"agent":"final-review","task":"Original request: finish Phase 6 managed integration before Phase 7. Current checkout has a heavily dirty inherited Phase 6 candidate plus committed broker foundations. Review only; do not modify files. Read the actual current diff and relevant callers/tests. First read /Users/user/.pi/agent/skills/software-design/SKILL.md and its referenced red-flags file, and apply that guidance. Every finding must include location or affected requirement, impact, proposed correction, and validation. If no findings remain, state that no remediation is needed. Scope: uncommitted broker/root files plus committed 7f91105f and 922f197b. Check root protocol remains prepare/launch/reclaim only, fixed identities, marker/sync/rename/reclaim behavior, authenticated frames, lifecycle journals, relay fixed path, startup recovery, timeout and cancellation classifications, and no false production-support claim.","routingContract":{"version":1,"agent":"final-review","model":"openai-codex/gpt-5.6-sol","thinking":"max","policyDigest":"8590d2fc0420152aad3f867aba1c18a56b3632f2d90e01d30d3f04676cd46ac5"},"