{"type":"message","id":"7f03a243","parentId":"3a8ff786","timestamp":"2026-09-13T04:30:31.915Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_7Y5iOa2lNnGXpeYchs0e07Xz|fc_0212e7de83dbbd32016aa626e744e887d09f865116dfb2e998","toolName":"subagent","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Status target: run c24c21c1\nSpawn budget: unlimited\nRun: c24c21c1\nState: remembered foreground\nMode: single\nUpdated: 2026-09-13T04:30:27.332Z\nCwd: /Users/user/projects/yinshi\n1. worker-advanced failed, exit 1, detached: intercom coordination, acceptance: rejected, error: Acceptance rejected: Required criterion 'criterion-1' was reported as not-satisfied., output: Turn budget wrap-up was requested after 18 assistant turns (soft limit 18, grace 3). Process-mode live steering is unavailable, so the child was warned at launc\n  Session: /Users/user/.pi/agent/sessions/--Users-user-projects-yinshi--/2026-09-04T04-44-52-550Z_01a06abb-dfc5-7c65-82bb-7c5f2081ee64/c24c21c1/run-0/session.jsonl\n  Transcript: /Users/user/projects/yinshi/.pi-subagents/artifacts/c24c21c1_worker-advanced_0_transcript.jsonl\n  Output: /Users/user/projects/yinshi/.pi-subagents/artifacts/c24c21c1_worker-advanced_0_output.md\n\nStatus: subagent({ action: \"status\", id: \"c24c21c1\" })\nTranscript: subagent({ action: \"status\", id: \"c24c21c1\", view: \"transcript\" })\nRevive: subagent({ action: \"resume\", id: \"c24c21c1\", message: \"...\" })"}],"details":{"mode":"single","results":[],"spawnBudget":{"used":0,"configuredLimit":null,"granted":0,"limit":null,"remaining":null,"grantRemaining":null,"grantHistory":[]}},"isError":false,"timestamp":1789273831915}}
