appears on replacement checkout.\n\n## Prior finding status\n\n- Checking retry trial reuse: resolved for complete root, worktree, successful cherry-pick, and ref-publication interruptions.\n- Cancellation after integrated terminal commit: resolved for nominal integrated replay.\n- Same-key success replay: resolved for unchanged or exactly applied parent state.\n- Pre-mutation parent rejection: nominal cases pass, but durable phase ambiguity remains under finding 1.\n- Conflict cleanup: unresolved under findings 2 and 3.\n- Production UI test: now mounts `ThreadPanel.tsx`.\n\n## Review limits\n\nNo test command was independently repeated after final expert edits. Parent-reported `test_thread_integration.py` result covers 10 tests but not new recovery behavior.\n\nReview covered current integration service, integration Git paths, admission service, ownership checks, schema, routes, recovery tests, and production UI test. Broad unrelated dirty changes were outside this review.","controlEvents":[{"type":"active_long_running","to":"active_long_running","ts":1789275424370,"runId":"cd2f0613","agent":"final-review","index":0,"message":"final-review is still active but long-running","reason":"time_threshold","turns":24,"tokens":174496,"toolCount":65,"elapsedMs":240153}],"attemptedModels":["openai-codex/gpt-5.6-sol:max"],"modelAttempts":[{"model":"openai-codex/gpt-5.6-sol:max","success":true,"exitCode":0,"usage":{"input":181949,"output":21640,"cacheRead":1205120,"cacheWrite":0,"cost":2.161505,"turns":25}}],"sessionFile":"/Users/user/.pi/agent/sessions/--Users-user-projects-yinshi--/2026-09-04T04-44-52-550Z_01a06abb-dfc5-7c65-82bb-7c5f2081ee64/cd2f0613/run-0/session.jsonl","acceptance":{"status":"attested","evidenceStatus":"attested","explicit":false,"effectiveAcceptance":{"level":"attested","explicit":false,"inferredReason":["read-only task wording"],"criteria":[{"id":"criterion-1","must":"Return concrete findings with file paths and severity when applicable","evidence":["re