{"type":"message","id":"58c79229","parentId":"719847a2","timestamp":"2026-09-13T06:54:04.397Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_moUqzX0dPIoKxdnenJW6lkFF|fc_0212e7de83dbbd32016aa6451e118087d0b5bec1dc21a571fb","toolName":"subagent","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Workflow completed.\n\nReturn:\n{\n  \"key\": \"integration_cleanup_final_review\",\n  \"ok\": true,\n  \"runId\": \"89b5bde7\",\n  \"output\": \"Turn budget wrap-up was requested after 22 assistant turns (soft limit 22, grace 4). Process-mode live steering is unavailable, so the child was warned at launch to wrap up by this budget. Output may be partial.\\n\\n## Verdict\\n\\nSource remediation resolves all four prior defects. One medium validation gap remains. Completion stays blocked.\\n\\n## Prior finding dispositions\\n\\n1. **Resumable quarantine states: Resolved**\\n   - `backend/src/yinshi/services/thread_workspaces.py:763-812,973-1029,1408-1498`\\n   - Exact manifest, active, quarantine, and metadata-quarantine phases are validated and resumed.\\n\\n2. **Cancellation ownership: Resolved in source**\\n   - `backend/src/yinshi/services/thread_workspaces.py:815-832`\\n   - Shielding drains mutation before repository scopes unwind.\\n   - Admission release occurs later at `backend/src/yinshi/services/thread_integration.py:610-611,761-762,1157-1158`.\\n\\n3. **Late ignored bytes: Resolved**\\n   - `backend/src/yinshi/services/thread_workspaces.py:973-1029,1500-1622`\\n   - Entire worktree moves through no-replace quarantine. Git no longer removes mutable worktree bytes.\\n\\n4. **Successful cleanup: Resolved**\\n   - `backend/src/yinshi/services/thread_integration.py:790-867`\\n   - Applied result persists before cleanup.\\n   - Terminal success follows removal of active registration, ref, and trial root.\\n   - Quarantine and metadata move into retained storage.\\n\\n## Finding\\n\\n**Medium: Required cancellation and crash checks remain partial**\\n\\n**Locations:** `backend/tests/test