antine and metadata move into retained storage.\n\n## Finding\n\n**Medium: Required cancellation and crash checks remain partial**\n\n**Locations:** `backend/tests/test_thread_integration_recovery.py:456-521,600-635`\n\nCancellation test invokes `_run_threaded_mutation` directly. It never holds repository or admission ownership. It cannot prove a competing retry remains excluded.\n\nCrash tests omit worktree-rename-before-sync. Successful cleanup lacks faults after metadata retirement, ref deletion, and retained-root movement.\n\n**Impact:** Requested concurrency and restart guarantees lack regression coverage. Parent's passing suite does not cover these exact guarantees.\n\n**Correction:** Add endpoint-level staged fault tests. Cancel during each quarantine stage and attempt a competing retry. Verify repository and admission ownership remain held.\n\nAdd successful-cleanup replay tests after metadata movement, ref deletion, and retained-root movement.\n\n**Remediation tier:** `worker-advanced`\n\n**Required checks:** Run new staged tests, existing 36 focused tests, Ruff check, Ruff format check, and strict mypy.\n\n## Validation\n\nParent attests 36 focused tests, Ruff, format, and strict mypy passed. I did not repeat those fresh results.\n\nScoped `git diff --check` passed. Global staged-file check passed.\n\nReview limit: `627849c2` is a subagent run ID, not a Git revision. Relevant current files, callers, tests, and remediation task artifact were inspected.","artifactPaths":["/Users/user/.pi/agent/sessions/--Users-user-projects-yinshi--/2026-09-04T04-44-52-550Z_01a06abb-dfc5-7c65-82bb-7c5f2081ee64/89b5bde7/run-0/session.jsonl"],"results":[{"index":0,"agent":"final-review","task":"Review the current managed-integration cleanup remediation after 627849c2. Read actual current files and diff. Read software-design skill and red-flags. Verify four prior findings: resumable quarantine crash states; cancellation drains threaded mutation before releasing repository/admis