reflight before preview and identity capture. Retain the final transactional check before insertion.\n\nRemediation: `worker-advanced`.\n\nRequired checks:\n\n- Spy on preview and identity methods.\n- Assert neither runs while a receipt exists.\n- Race repository deletion against new integration admission.\n- Preserve exact-owner continuation behavior.\n\n### 5. Medium: Publication conflicts do not consistently map to HTTP 409\n\nLocations:\n\n- `backend/src/yinshi/services/workspace_publication.py:1034-1038`\n- `backend/src/yinshi/api/workspace_files.py:188-202`\n- `backend/src/yinshi/api/terminal_channels.py:129-139`\n\nDeletion ownership becomes a broad `WorkspacePublicationError`. File endpoints map that error to 500. Terminal channel setup maps it to 503.\n\nImpact: Identical admission conflict produces different public status codes. This violates stable conflict mapping.\n\nCorrection: Introduce a distinct publication admission-conflict subtype. Map that subtype to generic HTTP 409 at every HTTP boundary. Keep infrastructure publication failures mapped separately.\n\nRemediation: `worker`.\n\nRequired checks:\n\n- Exercise file mutation preparation with a deletion receipt.\n- Exercise terminal channel preparation with a deletion receipt.\n- Assert HTTP 409 with stable generic details.\n- Retain existing mappings for infrastructure failures.\n\n## Verified behavior\n\n- Helper query blocks any row without parsing phase or receipt content.\n- Workspace deletion checks inside `BEGIN IMMEDIATE` before claim writes.\n- Final execution, repair, and integration receipt writes retain transactional checks.\n- Repository deletion recovery does not call the helper.\n- No staged files existed during review.\n\n## Validation status\n\nParent reported `9 tests passed` for focused backend tests. Exact command was unavailable. Existing tests do not cover public pre-effect ordering, connection lifetime, races, or all HTTP mappings.\n\nRequired after fixes:\n\n- Focused repository-deletion admission tests\n- New effect-spy and concurrency tests listed above\n- Ruff for changed source and tests\n- Strict mypy for changed source\n\nInspection limit: Repository contains a much larger unstaged and untracked change set. Review excluded unrelated changes as requested.","controlEvents":[{"type":"active_long_running","to":"active_long_running","ts":1789284931400,"runId":"62c2fe5c","agent":"final-review","index":0,"message":"final-review is still active but long-running","reason":"time_threshold","turns":23,"tokens":153745,"toolCount":75,"elapsedMs":240289}],"attemptedModels":["openai-codex/gpt-5.6-sol:max"],"modelAttempts":[{"model":"openai-codex/gpt-5.6-sol:max","success":true,"exitCode":0,"usage":{"input":155760,"output":18454,"cacheRead":1359872,"cacheWrite":0,"cost":2.012356,"turns":25}}],"sessionFile":"/Users/user/.pi/agent/sessions/--Users-user-projects-yinshi--/2026-09-04T04-44-52-550Z_01a06abb-dfc5-7c65-82bb-7c5f2081ee64/62c2fe5c/run-0/session.jsonl","acceptance":{"status":"attested","evidenceStatus":"attested","explicit":false,"effectiveAcceptance":{"level":"attested","explicit":false,"inferredReason":["read-only task wording"],"criteria":[{"id":"criterion-1","must":"Return concrete findings with file paths and severity when applicable","evidence":["review-findings","residual-risks"],"severity":"required"}],"evidence":["review-findings","residual-risks"],"verify":[],"stopRules":[]},"inferredReason":["read-only task wording"],"criteria":[{"id":"criterion-1","must":"Return concrete findings with file paths and severity when applicable","evidence":["review-findings","residual-risks"],"severity":"required"}],"runtimeChecks":[],"verifyRuns":[],"childReport":{"criteriaSatisfied":[{"id":"criterion-1","status":"satisfied","evidence":"Five concrete findings include severity, exact paths, impact, corrections, worker tiers, and required checks."}],"changedFiles":["backend/src/yinshi/api/workspaces.py","backend/src/yinshi/services/repository_lifecyc