sting focused tests omit public effect ordering, races, connection lifetime, and boundary mapping."],"noStagedFiles":true,"diffSummary":"Candidate adds a phase-agnostic deletion helper, wires five admission sites, adds workspace creation mapping, and adds focused tests. Several public workflows still gate too late.","reviewFindings":["high: backend/src/yinshi/services/workspace.py:563-597 - workspace creation check is outside the admission transaction and an SQLite handle crosses awaits and effects","high: backend/src/yinshi/services/workspace_execution.py:1755-1766 - checkout recovery and Git identity work occur before execution reservation checks deletion ownership","high: backend/src/yinshi/services/workspace_publication.py:2218-2265 - Git work precedes the gate and trusted checkout preparation bypasses it","high: backend/src/yinshi/services/thread_integration.py:401-446 - preview and Git identity capture occur before integration checks deletion ownership","medium: backend/src/yinshi/api/workspace_files.py:188-202 and backend/src/yinshi/api/terminal_channels.py:129-139 - publication admission conflict maps to HTTP 500 or 503 instead of 409"],"manualNotes":"All findings remain unresolved and block completion. Use worker-advanced for ordering and transaction fixes. Use worker for settled HTTP mapping changes."}},"toolCalls":[{"text":"read ~/.pi/agent/skills/software-design/SKILL.md","expandedText":"read ~/.pi/agent/skills/software-design/SKILL.md"},{"text":"read ~/.pi/agent/skills/software-design/references/red-flags.md","expandedText":"read ~/.pi/agent/skills/software-design/references/red-flags.md"},{"text":"$ git status --short && printf '\\n--- DIFF STAT ---\\n' && git ...","expandedText":"$ git status --short && printf '\\n--- DIFF STAT ---\\n' && git diff --stat && printf '\\n--- STAGED DIFF STAT ---\\n' && git diff --cached --stat"},{"text":"ls {\"path\":\".\"}","expandedText":"ls {\"path\":\".\"}"},{"text":"grep {\"pattern\":\"repository_deletion\",\"path\"