e boundaries. It proves repository lock, admission ownership, competing-request exclusion, settlement, and replay.\n\nSuccessful cleanup tests inject faults after metadata retirement, ref deletion, and retained-root movement. They do not verify pending directory synchronization.\n\n## Confirmed finding\n\n**Medium: Recovered rename phases can become terminal before directory entries are durable**\n\n**Locations:**\n- `backend/src/yinshi/services/thread_workspaces.py:1537-1547`\n- `backend/src/yinshi/services/thread_workspaces.py:1595-1622`\n- Missing assertion at `backend/tests/test_thread_integration_recovery.py:713-785`\n\nRecovered `metadata-quarantine` skips synchronization of `root` and `common/worktrees`. Recovered retained storage returns success without synchronizing both rename parents.\n\nA later host crash can restore stale trial metadata or lose retained quarantine after terminal success releases admission.\n\n**Correction:** Complete each pending synchronization through `_run_threaded_mutation`. Revalidate exact layout before ref deletion or terminal database transition.\n\n**Remediation tier:** `worker-advanced`\n\n**Required checks:**\n- Assert exact recovery synchronization before terminal success.\n- Assert synchronization failure keeps status `applying` and retains admission.\n- Rerun six staged parameter cases.\n- Rerun 45 focused managed-integration tests.\n- Run Ruff check and format check.\n- Run strict mypy after source correction.\n\n## Prior finding status\n\n- Resumable quarantine validation remains resolved.\n- Cancellation ownership source and endpoint coverage are resolved.\n- Late ignored-byte retention remains resolved.\n- Successful cleanup retirement remains incomplete due missing recovery synchronization.\n\nNo unanswered questions.","artifactPaths":["/Users/user/.pi/agent/sessions/--Users-user-projects-yinshi--/2026-09-04T04-44-52-550Z_01a06abb-dfc5-7c65-82bb-7c5f2081ee64/ceaee916/run-0/session.jsonl"],"results":[{"index":0,"agent"