520e1-4299-46d8-9808-33a463d13a2b","title":"Review only the current repository-deletion admission backstop. Read software-design skill and re...","objective":"Review only the current repository-deletion admission backstop. Read software-design skill and red-flags, actual current files/diff, helper and every caller/test. Requirements: any durable repository_deletions row, regardless phase or malformed receipt, blocks workspace creation, workspace deletion claims, execution reservation, checkout repair/publication, and managed integration before filesystem/runtime/Git effects. Checks must occur inside the same transaction before admission writes. Error mapping remains stable conflict/409. No SQLite handle crosses await/effect. Parent focused backend result: 9 tests passed. Do not modify. Return findings with locations/impact/correction/checks, or explicit no remediation needed. Avoid semicolons.","status":"completed","createdAt":"2026-09-13T07:31:30.779Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-13T07:41:13.014Z","runs":[{"runId":"call_akJP4TNYBUOoM7SlFggup2v4|fc_0212e7de83dbbd32016aa6514a2b7087d08c9591def3a358ca","mode":"workflow","status":"completed","startedAt":"2026-09-13T07:41:13.014Z","completedAt":"2026-09-13T07:41:13.014Z","usage":{"tokens":366213}}],"decisions":[],"artifacts":[{"kind":"output","path":"/Users/user/projects/yinshi/.pi-subagents/artifacts/62c2fe5c_final-review_0_output.md"},{"kind":"other","path":"/Users/user/projects/yinshi/.pi-subagents/artifacts/62c2fe5c_final-review_0_transcript.jsonl","description":"Child transcript"},{"kind":"output","path":"/Users/user/projects/yinshi/.pi-subagents/artifacts/ceaee916_final-review_0_output.md"},{"kind":"other","path":"/Users/user/projects/yinshi/.pi-subagents/artifacts/ceaee916_final-review_0_transcript.jsonl","description":"Child transcript"}],"receipts":[],"cwd":"/Users/user/projects/yinshi","ownerSessionId":"/Users/user/.pi/agent/sessions/--Users-user-projects-yinshi--/2026-09-04T04-44-52-550Z_01a06abb-dfc5-7c65-82bb-7c5f2081ee64.jsonl","summary":"Workflow completed.\n\nReturn:\n[\n  {\n    \"key\": \"deletion_review\",\n    \"ok\": true,\n    \"runId\": \"62c2fe5c\",\n    \"output\": \"Turn budget wrap-up was requested after 22 assistant turns (soft limit 22, grace 4). Process-mode live steering is unavailable, so the child was warned at launch to wrap up by this budget. Output may be partial.\\n\\n## Review outcome\\n\\nBlocked. Five findings remain. Remediation needed.\\n\\n### 1. High: Workspace creation violates transaction and connection-lifetime guarantees\\n\\nLocation: `backend/src/yinshi/services/workspace.py:563-597`  \\nCaller: `backend/src/yinshi/api/workspaces.py:140-151`\\n\\n`require_no_repository_deletion()` runs without `BEGIN IMMEDIATE`. Later awaits perform checkout, remote, Git, and filesystem work using an open SQLite connection.\\n\\nThe workspace `INSERT` starts only after those effects. The deletion verdict and admission write therefore lack one transaction.\\n\\nImpact: A stale verdict can permit workspace admission after deletion ownership appears. Normal creation also crosses awaits with an open SQLite handle.\\n\\nCorrection:\\n\\n- Keep repository lifecycle lock across admission.\\n- Run a short pre-effect database callback that authorizes and checks deletion ownership.\\n- Close its connection before external work.\\n- Run final authorization, deletion check, and workspace `INSERT` inside one `BEGIN IMMEDIATE`.\\n- Quarantine or remove created worktree when final admission fails.\\n\\nRemediation: `worker-advanced`. This fix combines transaction ownership, lifecycle locking, and effect cleanup.\\n\\nRequired checks:\\n\\n- Assert helper sees `db.in_transaction` during final admission.\\n- Assert no connection remains open during mocked Git awaits.\\n- Race repository deletion against creation.\\n- Assert failed final admission leaves no published worktree.\\n\\n### 2. High: Execution performs checkout and Git work before deletion gate\\n\\nLocation: `ba