ase or receipt content.","Final creation, publication metadata, execution, and integration admission writes retain transactional deletion checks.","Existing tests do not cover cleanup failure or post-preflight lifecycle races."],"residualRisks":["Failed workspace-admission cleanup can leave an unmanaged worktree.","Legacy repair and relink can race repository deletion.","Execution recovery can race deletion after preflight.","Managed integration can race deletion before preview or identity capture."],"noStagedFiles":true,"diffSummary":"Correction adds pre-effect deletion gates, runner-based database access, final transactional checks, lifecycle preflights, cleanup, and distinct 409 mapping. Four ownership gaps remain.","reviewFindings":["high: backend/src/yinshi/services/workspace.py:646-660 - failed cleanup has no durable fallback","high: backend/src/yinshi/services/workspace.py:416-546 - legacy repair and relink lack lifecycle serialization","high: backend/src/yinshi/services/workspace_execution.py:1542-1775 - execution releases lifecycle ownership before effects and reservation","high: backend/src/yinshi/services/thread_integration.py:406-436 - integration releases lifecycle ownership before preview and identity effects"],"manualNotes":"Review covered requested current files and affected production callers. Larger unrelated working-tree changes remain outside scope."}},"toolCalls":[{"text":"read ~/.pi/agent/skills/software-design/SKILL.md","expandedText":"read ~/.pi/agent/skills/software-design/SKILL.md"},{"text":"read ~/.pi/agent/skills/software-design/references/red-flags.md","expandedText":"read ~/.pi/agent/skills/software-design/references/red-flags.md"},{"text":"ls {\"path\":\"/Users/user/projects/yinshi\"}","expandedText":"ls {\"path\":\"/Users/user/projects/yinshi\"}"},{"text":"$ git status --short && printf '\\n--- branch ---\\n' && git bra...","expandedText":"$ git status --short && printf '\\n--- branch ---\\n' && git branch --show-current && printf '\\