cts/a17a8296_final-review_0.jsonl","transcriptPath":"/Users/user/projects/yinshi/.pi-subagents/artifacts/a17a8296_final-review_0_transcript.jsonl","metadataPath":"/Users/user/projects/yinshi/.pi-subagents/artifacts/a17a8296_final-review_0_meta.json"},"transcriptPath":"/Users/user/projects/yinshi/.pi-subagents/artifacts/a17a8296_final-review_0_transcript.jsonl","skills":["software-design"],"turnBudget":{"maxTurns":20,"graceTurns":3,"outcome":"within-budget","turnCount":15},"toolBudget":{"hard":100,"soft":70,"block":["bash","read","grep","find","ls"],"toolCount":71,"outcome":"soft-reached","softReachedAt":70},"context":"fresh","progressSummary":{"toolCount":71,"tokens":332863,"durationMs":359274},"effects":{"fileMutation":{"status":"not-applicable","expected":false,"attempted":true}},"outputMode":"inline","finalOutput":"## Finding\n\n**Medium: Metadata recovery test does not prove fsync precedes ref deletion**\n\nLocation: `backend/tests/test_thread_integration_recovery.py:772-792`\n\nThe injected failure targets the first synchronization call without checking its directories. The prior defective flow could delete the ref, then fail during retained-parent creation. Existing assertions would still pass.\n\nImpact: Required durability ordering could regress unnoticed. A crash could restore stale metadata after ref deletion.\n\nCorrection:\n- Assert synchronization receives `trial_root` and `common / \"worktrees\"`.\n- After injected failure in `metadata_retired`, assert the trial ref still equals `trial_commit`.\n- Assert retained-only recovery synchronizes `trial_root.parent` and `retained.parent`.\n- Assert each expected synchronization was reached.\n\nRemediation tier: `worker-advanced`.\n\nRequired checks:\n- Rerun all six staged parameter cases.\n- Confirm the metadata test fails when pre-ref synchronization is removed.\n- Run Ruff and format checks on the updated test.\n\n## Verified source behavior\n\n- `backend/src/yinshi/services/thread_workspaces.py:1540-1549` validates retained-only layout and synchronizes both rename parents before success.\n- `backend/src/yinshi/services/thread_workspaces.py:1553-1611` validates metadata-quarantine layout and synchronizes both affected directories before ref deletion.\n- Synchronization errors propagate through `_run_threaded_mutation`.\n- `_complete_applied_cleanup` leaves status `applying`.\n- `_finish_admission` retains the durable marker for nonterminal operations.\n\nSource correction is clean. Test remediation remains required.","controlEvents":[{"type":"active_long_running","to":"active_long_running","ts":1789288943900,"runId":"a17a8296","agent":"final-review","index":0,"message":"final-review is still active but long-running","reason":"time_threshold","turns":11,"tokens":318316,"toolCount":62,"currentTool":"bash","currentToolDurationMs":9537,"elapsedMs":240687}],"attemptedModels":["openai-codex/gpt-5.6-sol:max"],"modelAttempts":[{"model":"openai-codex/gpt-5.6-sol:max","success":true,"exitCode":0,"usage":{"input":319959,"output":12904,"cacheRead":1099520,"cacheWrite":0,"cost":2.5366750000000002,"turns":15}}],"sessionFile":"/Users/user/.pi/agent/sessions/--Users-user-projects-yinshi--/2026-09-04T04-44-52-550Z_01a06abb-dfc5-7c65-82bb-7c5f2081ee64/a17a8296/run-0/session.jsonl","acceptance":{"status":"attested","evidenceStatus":"attested","explicit":false,"effectiveAcceptance":{"level":"attested","explicit":false,"inferredReason":["read-only task wording"],"criteria":[{"id":"criterion-1","must":"Return concrete findings with file paths and severity when applicable","evidence":["review-findings","residual-risks"],"severity":"required"}],"evidence":["review-findings","residual-risks"],"verify":[],"stopRules":[]},"inferredReason":["read-only task wording"],"criteria":[{"id":"criterion-1","must":"Return concrete findings with file paths and severity when applicable","evidence":["review-findings","residual-risks"],"severity":"required"}],"runtimeChecks":[],"verifyRuns":[],"childReport":