yinshi/servic...","expandedText":"grep {\"pattern\":\"ruff check src/yinshi/services/thread_workspaces.py\",\"path\":\".pi-subagents/artifacts\",\"glob\":\"*.jsonl\",\"literal\":true,\"context\":0,\"limit\":20}"},{"text":"grep {\"pattern\":\"mypy --strict|mypy src/yinsh...","expandedText":"grep {\"pattern\":\"mypy --strict|mypy src/yinshi/services/thread_workspaces.py|python -m mypy\",\"path\":\".pi-subagents/artifacts/ceaee916_final-review_0_transcript.jsonl..."}]}],"totalChildUsage":{"input":615403,"output":31718,"cacheRead":2311168,"cacheWrite":0,"cost":5.184139,"turns":36},"totalCost":{"inputTokens":615403,"outputTokens":31718,"costUsd":5.184139},"usageBudget":{"version":1,"source":"reported","tokens":{"hard":220000,"used":647121,"outcome":"hard-exceeded"},"exhausted":true,"reason":"tokens"},"workflow":{"value":[{"key":"deletion_corrected","ok":true,"runId":"1422a779","output":"Turn budget wrap-up was requested after 20 assistant turns (soft limit 20, grace 3). Process-mode live steering is unavailable, so the child was warned at launch to wrap up by this budget. Output may be partial.\n\n## Review outcome\n\nBlocked. Four findings remain. Remediation is needed.\n\n### High: Failed workspace admission can leave an unmanaged worktree\n\nLocation: `backend/src/yinshi/services/workspace.py:646-660`, `_remove_unadmitted_worktree()`\n\nCleanup failure is logged and suppressed. No durable cleanup receipt records the remaining worktree.\n\nImpact: Final admission can fail while Git registration and filesystem state remain without an owning workspace row.\n\nCorrection: Make cleanup cancellation-safe. Quarantine failures durably for restart recovery. Never discard unresolved cleanup authority.\n\nRemediation: `worker-advanced`\n\nRequired checks:\n\n- Inject cleanup failure after final deletion-gate rejection.\n- Assert path removal or durable quarantine ownership.\n- Test cancellation during cleanup.\n- Test restart recovery.\n\n### High: Legacy checkout repair lacks lifecycle serialization\n\nLocations:\n\n- `backend/src/yinshi/services/workspace.py:416-514`\n- `backend/src/yinshi/services/workspace.py:517-546`\n\n`ensure_repo_checkout_for_tenant()` checks deletion ownership before effects but holds no repository lifecycle lock. Relink calls it without an outer lock.\n\nImpact: Deletion can claim ownership after the check. Clone, move, or metadata effects can then race repository quarantine.\n\nCorrection: Add a lifecycle-owning public repair API. Keep a private unlocked variant for workspace creation, which already owns the lock.\n\nRemediation: `worker-advanced`\n\nRequired checks:\n\n- Pause repair after preflight.\n- Start repository deletion.\n- Assert deletion cannot claim until repair commits or aborts.\n- Cover relink and workspace repair callers.\n- Confirm no SQLite connection crosses an await.\n\n### High: Execution preflight releases ownership before checkout recovery\n\nLocations:\n\n- `backend/src/yinshi/services/workspace_execution.py:1749-1775`\n- `backend/src/yinshi/services/workspace_execution.py:1542-1723`\n\n`_repository_deletion_preflight()` releases the lifecycle lock before recovery, identity reads, stopped-receipt cleanup, and final reservation.\n\nImpact: Deletion can insert its receipt during this gap. Checkout publication or Git identity work can then run against deletion-owned storage.\n\nCorrection: Hold lifecycle ownership through recovery and `ExecutionAdmission.reserve()`. Refactor nested publication locking where required.\n\nRemediation: `worker-advanced`\n\nRequired checks:\n\n- Race deletion immediately after preflight.\n- Assert no deletion receipt commits before execution reservation.\n- Cover trusted publication and repair publication branches.\n- Test cancellation while recovery is active.\n\n### High: Managed-integration preflight has two unlocked race windows\n\nLocations:\n\n- `backend/src/yinshi/services/thread_integration.py:406-436`\n- `backend/src/yinshi/services/thread_workspaces.py:526-650`\n\nIntegration releases the preflight lock before `preview_integration()`. Preview reacquires lifecycle ownership without checking deletion. Identity collection runs after that lock releases.\n\nImpact: Deletion can claim before preview or identity Git commands. Final insertion rejection cannot undo those effects.\n\nCorrection: Use one lifecycle scope for deletion check, preview, identity capture, and final reservation. Preserve exact-owner continuation behavior.\n\nRemediation: `worker-advanced`\n\nRequired checks:\n\n- Race deletion between preflight and preview.\n- Race deletion between preview and identity capture.\n- Assert preview and identity never run under deletion ownership.\n- Retain exact-owner continuation tests.\n\n## Five-finding disposition\n\n1. Workspace creation runner, final `BEGIN IMMEDIATE`, and connection lifetime: resolved. Cleanup failure handling remains open.\n2. Execution preflight ordering: improved but not race-safe.\n3. Publication pre-effect and trusted-path gates: resolved for locked runtime-path and stream callers. Execution remains unsafe.\n4. Managed-integration preflight ordering: improved but not race-safe.\n5. Distinct publication conflict mapping: resolved. File and terminal boundaries return generic 409 responses.\n\nWorkspace deletion still checks inside its admission transaction. Arbitrary receipt phase or content still blocks helper admission.\n\nParent-attested tests and static checks were not repeated. They do not cover the four failure windows above.","artifactPaths":["/Users/user/.pi/agent/sessions/--Users-user-projects-yinshi--/2026-09-04T04-44-52-550Z_01a06abb-dfc5-7c65-82bb-7c5f2081ee64/1422a779/run-0/session.jsonl"],"results":[{"index":0,"agent":"final-review","task":"Review corrected repository-deletion admission changes after review 62c2fe5c. Read actual current files/diff and software-design skill. Recheck all five findings. Pay special attention to workspace creation database runner API, lifecycle locking, final BEGIN IMMEDIATE, failed-admission cleanup, legacy checkout repair/relink callers, production publication pre-effect gate including trusted paths, execution preflight, managed-integration preflight, and distinct 409 mapping. Parent results: 26 focused deletion/caller/privacy tests pass plus 7 workspace creation/repair/relink tests, strict mypy passes 8 source files, scoped Ruff and format pass. Do not modify. Return concise dispositions and any remaining finding with location, impact, correction, checks. Avoid semicolons. Explicitly state no remediation needed if clean.","routingContract":{"version":1,"agent":"final-review","model":"openai-codex/gpt-5.6-sol","thinking":"max","policyDigest":"8590d2fc0420152aad3f867aba1c18a56b3632f2d90e01d30d3f04676cd46ac5"},"launchContractDigest":"fa6b8e69b6595f8a1288b2766028a2c8b950bd838e177eb4b6e3416803619e2e","launchResolvedExtensions":{"version":1,"source":"launch-resolved","disableAmbientExtensions":false,"runtime":["sha256:cb00ccf63b7cf9f4"],"configured":[],"effective":["sha256:cb00ccf63b7cf9f4"],"omitted":{"runtime":0,"configured":0,"effective":0}},"exitCode":0,"outputState":"present","usage":{"input":295444,"output":18814,"cacheRead":1211648,"cacheWrite":0,"cost":2.6474640000000003,"turns":21},"model":"openai-codex/gpt-5.6-sol:max","thinking":"max","artifactPaths":{"inputPath":"/Users/user/projects/yinshi/.pi-subagents/artifacts/1422a779_final-review_0_input.md","outputPath":"/Users/user/projects/yinshi/.pi-subagents/artifacts/1422a779_final-review_0_output.md","jsonlPath":"/Users/user/projects/yinshi/.pi-subagents/artifacts/1422a779_final-review_0.jsonl","transcriptPath":"/Users/user/projects/yinshi/.pi-subagents/artifacts/1422a779_final-review_0_transcript.jsonl","metadataPath":"/Users/user/projects/yinshi/.pi-subagents/artifacts/1422a779_final-review_0_meta.json"},"transcriptPath":"/Users/user/projects/yinshi/.pi-subagents/artifacts/1422a779_final-review_0_transcript.jsonl","skills":["software-design"],"turnBudget":{"maxTurns":20,"graceTurns":3,"turnCount":21,"outcome":"wrap-up-requested","wrapUpRequestedAtTurn":20},"toolBudget":{"hard":100,"soft":70,"block":["bash","read","grep","find","ls"],"toolCount":72,"outcome":"soft-reached","softReachedAt":70},"context":"fresh","wrapUpRequested":true,"progressSummary":{"toolCount":72,"tokens":314258,"durationMs":572321},"effects":{"fileMutation":{"status":"not-applicable","expected":false,"attempted":true}},"outputMode":"inline","finalOutput":"Turn budget wrap-up was requested after 20 assistant turns (soft limit 20, grace 3). Process-mode live steering is unavailable, so the child was warned at launch to wrap up by this budget. Output may be partial.\n\n## Review outcome\n\nBlocked. Four findings remain. Remediation is needed.\n\n### High: Failed workspace admission can leave an unmanaged worktree\n\nLocation: `backend/src/yinshi/services/workspace.py:646-660`, `_remove_unadmitted_worktree()`\n\nCleanup failure is logged and suppressed. No durable cleanup receipt records the remaining worktree.\n\nImpact: Final admission can fail while Git registration and filesystem state remain without an owning workspace row.\n\nCorrection: Make cleanup cancellation-safe. Quarantine failures durably for restart recovery. Never discard unresolved cleanup authority.\n\nRemediation: `worker-advanced`\n\nRequired checks:\n\n- Inject cleanup failure after final deletion-gate rejection.\n- Assert path removal or durable quarantine ownership.\n- Test cancellation during cleanup.\n- Test restart recovery.\n\n### High: Legacy checkout repair lacks lifecycle serialization\n\nLocations:\n\n- `backend/src/yinshi/services/workspace.py:416-514`\n- `backend/src/yinshi/services/workspace.py:517-546`\n\n`ensure_repo_checkout_for_tenant()` checks deletion ownership before effects but holds no repository lifecycle lock. Relink calls it without an outer lock.\n\nImpact: Deletion can claim ownership after the check. Clone, move, or metadata effects can then race repository quarantine.\n\nCorrection: Add a lifecycle-owning public repair API. Keep a private unlocked variant for workspace creation, which already owns the lock.\n\nRemediation: `worker-advanced`\n\nRequired checks:\n\n- Pause repair after preflight.\n- Start repository deletion.\n- Assert deletion cannot claim until repair commits or aborts.\n- Cover relink and workspace repair callers.\n- Confirm no SQLite connection crosses an await.\n\n### High: Execution preflight releases ownership before checkout recovery\n\nLocations:\n\n- `backend/src/yinshi/services/workspace_execution.py:1749-1775`\n- `backend/src/yinshi/services/workspace_execution.py:1542-1723`\n\n`_repository_deletion_preflight()` releases the lifecycle lock before recovery, identity reads, stopped-receipt cleanup, and final reservation.\n\nImpact: Deletion can insert its receipt during this gap. Checkout publication or Git identity work can then run against deletion-owned storage.\n\nCorrection: Hold lifecycle ownership through recovery and `ExecutionAdmission.reserve()`. Refactor nested publication locking where required.\n\nRemediation: `worker-advanced`\n\nRequired checks:\n\n- Race deletion immediately after preflight.\n- Assert no deletion receipt commits before execution reservation.\n- Cover trusted publication and repair publication branches.\n- Test cancellation while recovery is active.\n\n### High: Managed-integration preflight has two unlocked race windows\n\nLocations:\n\n- `backend/src/yinshi/services/thread_integration.py:406-436`\n- `backend/src/yinshi/services/thread_workspaces.py:526-650`\n\nIntegration releases the preflight lock before `preview_integration()`. Preview reacquires lifecycle ownership without checking deletion. Identity collection runs after that lock releases.\n\nImpact: Deletion can claim before preview or identity Git commands. Final insertion rejection cannot undo those effects.\n\nCorrection: Use one lifecycle scope for deletion check, preview, identity capture, and final reservation. Preserve exact-owner continuation behavior.\n\nRemediation: `worker-advanced`\n\nRequired checks:\n\n- Race deletion between preflight and preview.\n- Race deletion between preview and identity capture.\n- Assert preview and identity never run under deletion ownership.\n- Retain exact-owner continuation tests.\n\n## Five-finding disposition\n\n1. Workspace creation runner, final `BEGIN IMMEDIATE`, and connection lifetime: resolved. Cleanup failure handling remains open.\n2. Execution preflight ordering: improved but not race-safe.\n3. Publication pre-effect and trusted-path gates: resolved for locked runtime-path and stream callers. Execution remains unsafe.\n4. Managed-integration preflight ordering: improved but not race-safe.\n5. Distinct publication conflict mapping: resolved. File and terminal boundaries return generic 409 responses.\n\nWorkspace deletion still checks inside its admission transaction. Arbitrary receipt phase or content still blocks helper admission.\n\nParent-attested tests and static checks were not repeated. They do not cover the four failure windows above.","controlEvents":[{"type":"active_long_running","to":"active_long_running","ts":1789288943258,"runId":"1422a779","agent":"final-review","index":0,"message":"final-review is still active but long-running","reason":"time_threshold","turns":19,"tokens":303702,"toolCount":72,"elapsedMs":240068}],"attemptedModels":["openai-codex/gpt-5.6-sol:max"],"modelAttempts":[{"model":"openai-codex/gpt-5.6-sol:max","success":true,"exitCode":0,"usage":{"input":295444,"output":18814,"cacheRead":1211648,"cacheWrite":0,"cost":2.6474640000000003,"turns":21}}],"sessionFile":"/Users/user/.pi/agent/sessions/--Users-user-projects-yinshi--/2026-09-04T04-44-52-550Z_01a06abb-dfc5-7c65-82bb-7c5f2081ee64/1422a779/run-0/session.jsonl","acceptance":{"status":"attested","evidenceStatus":"attested","explicit":false,"effectiveAcceptance":{"level":"attested","explicit":false,"inferredReason":["read-on