 both rename parents before success.\n- `backend/src/yinshi/services/thread_workspaces.py:1553-1611` validates metadata-quarantine layout and synchronizes both affected directories before ref deletion.\n- Synchronization errors propagate through `_run_threaded_mutation`.\n- `_complete_applied_cleanup` leaves status `applying`.\n- `_finish_admission` retains the durable marker for nonterminal operations.\n\nSource correction is clean. Test remediation remains required.","artifactPaths":["/Users/user/.pi/agent/sessions/--Users-user-projects-yinshi--/2026-09-04T04-44-52-550Z_01a06abb-dfc5-7c65-82bb-7c5f2081ee64/a17a8296/run-0/session.jsonl"],"results":[{"index":0,"agent":"final-review","task":"Review only the final managed-integration synchronization correction after review ceaee916. Read actual current source/tests and software-design skill. Verify recovered metadata-quarantine and retained-only phases now complete required parent directory fsync before ref deletion or terminal success, revalidate exact layout, preserve admission on sync failure, and endpoint staged tests cover it. Parent result: all six staged parameter cases pass and strict mypy/Ruff pass source, Ruff/format pass tests. Do not modify. Return any finding or explicit no remediation needed. Avoid semicolons.","routingContract":{"version":1,"agent":"final-review","model":"openai-codex/gpt-5.6-sol","thinking":"max","policyDigest":"8590d2fc0420152aad3f867aba1c18a56b3632f2d90e01d30d3f04676cd46ac5"},"launchContractDigest":"bc26e969bb4bf72a057c54bd234be37eebaa67c6ba931a8e20e5d7d0267d6103","launchResolvedExtensions":{"version":1,"source":"launch-resolved","disableAmbientExtensions":false,"runtime":["sha256:cb00ccf63b7cf9f4"],"configured":[],"effective":["sha256:cb00ccf63b7cf9f4"],"omitted":{"runtime":0,"configured":0,"effective":0}},"exitCode":0,"outputState":"present","usage":{"input":319959,"output":12904,"cacheRead":1099520,"cacheWrite":0,"cost":2.5366750000000002,"turns":15},"model":"openai-codex/gpt-5.6-