light, managed-integration preflight, and distinct 409 mapping. Parent results: 26 focused deletion/caller/privacy tests pass plus 7 workspace creation/repair/relink tests, strict mypy passes 8 source files, scoped Ruff and format pass. Do not modify. Return concise dispositions and any remaining finding with location, impact, correction, checks. Avoid semicolons. Explicitly state no remediation needed if clean.","status":"completed","createdAt":"2026-09-13T08:38:22.806Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-13T08:47:55.522Z","runs":[{"runId":"call_lI6Au6jlM4BxhuUnJOeR6HEn|fc_0212e7de83dbbd32016aa660f502d487d0b87e9f601845773a","mode":"workflow","status":"completed","startedAt":"2026-09-13T08:47:55.522Z","completedAt":"2026-09-13T08:47:55.522Z","usage":{"tokens":647121}}],"decisions":[],"artifacts":[{"kind":"output","path":"/Users/user/projects/yinshi/.pi-subagents/artifacts/1422a779_final-review_0_output.md"},{"kind":"other","path":"/Users/user/projects/yinshi/.pi-subagents/artifacts/1422a779_final-review_0_transcript.jsonl","description":"Child transcript"},{"kind":"output","path":"/Users/user/projects/yinshi/.pi-subagents/artifacts/a17a8296_final-review_0_output.md"},{"kind":"other","path":"/Users/user/projects/yinshi/.pi-subagents/artifacts/a17a8296_final-review_0_transcript.jsonl","description":"Child transcript"}],"receipts":[],"cwd":"/Users/user/projects/yinshi","ownerSessionId":"/Users/user/.pi/agent/sessions/--Users-user-projects-yinshi--/2026-09-04T04-44-52-550Z_01a06abb-dfc5-7c65-82bb-7c5f2081ee64.jsonl","summary":"Workflow completed.\n\nReturn:\n[\n  {\n    \"key\": \"deletion_corrected\",\n    \"ok\": true,\n    \"runId\": \"1422a779\",\n    \"output\": \"Turn budget wrap-up was requested after 20 assistant turns (soft limit 20, grace 3). Process-mode live steering is unavailable, so the child was warned at launch to wrap up by this budget. Output may be partial.\\n\\n## Review outcome\\n\\nBlocked. Four findings remain. Remediation is needed.\\n\\n### High: Failed workspace admission can leave an unmanaged worktree\\n\\nLocation: `backend/src/yinshi/services/workspace.py:646-660`, `_remove_unadmitted_worktree()`\\n\\nCleanup failure is logged and suppressed. No durable cleanup receipt records the remaining worktree.\\n\\nImpact: Final admission can fail while Git registration and filesystem state remain without an owning workspace row.\\n\\nCorrection: Make cleanup cancellation-safe. Quarantine failures durably for restart recovery. Never discard unresolved cleanup authority.\\n\\nRemediation: `worker-advanced`\\n\\nRequired checks:\\n\\n- Inject cleanup failure after final deletion-gate rejection.\\n- Assert path removal or durable quarantine ownership.\\n- Test cancellation during cleanup.\\n- Test restart recovery.\\n\\n### High: Legacy checkout repair lacks lifecycle serialization\\n\\nLocations:\\n\\n- `backend/src/yinshi/services/workspace.py:416-514`\\n- `backend/src/yinshi/services/workspace.py:517-546`\\n\\n`ensure_repo_checkout_for_tenant()` checks deletion ownership before effects but holds no repository lifecycle lock. Relink calls it without an outer lock.\\n\\nImpact: Deletion can claim ownership after the check. Clone, move, or metadata effects can then race repository quarantine.\\n\\nCorrection: Add a lifecycle-owning public repair API. Keep a private unlocked variant for workspace creation, which already owns the lock.\\n\\nRemediation: `worker-advanced`\\n\\nRequired checks:\\n\\n- Pause repair after preflight.\\n- Start repository deletion.\\n- Assert deletion cannot claim until repair commits or aborts.\\n- Cover r..."}},"isError":false,"timestamp":1789289276129}}
{"type":"message","id":"e1d6ce14","parentId":"36fd45dd","timestamp":"2026-09-13T08:48:30.542Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"**Planning durable workspace creation receipt**\n\n**Designing atomic workspace creation flow**\n\n**Evaluating cleanup-safe workspace deletion approach**","thinkingSignature":"{\"id\":\"rs_0212e7de83dbbd32016aa6634066e887d0a66c38856ecc94f8\",\"type\":\"reasoning\",\"content\":[],\"encrypted_content\":\"REDACTED\",\"summary\":[{\"type\":\"summary_text\",\"text\":\"**Planning durable workspace creation receipt**\"},{\"type\":\"summary_text\",\"text\":\"**Designing atomic workspace creation flow**\"},{\"type\":\"summary_text\",\"text\":\"**Evaluating cleanup-safe workspace deletion approach**\"}]}"},{"type":"thinking","thinking":"**Planning robust repository deletion handling**\n\n**Refining workspace lifecycle locking and cleanup**","thinkingSignature":"{\"id\":\"rs_0212e7de83dbbd32016aa663534f9887d09a6a6f097c2fb51c\",\"type\":\"reasoning\",\"content\":[],\"encrypted_content\":\"REDACTED\",\"summary\":[{\"type\":\"summary_text\",\"text\":\"**Planning robust repository deletion handling**\"},{\"type\":\"summary_text\",\"text\":\"**Refining workspace lifecycle locking and cleanup**\"}]}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_Bqx3MeQaN8l3DMRE2D8hgXv7|fc_0212e7de83dbbd32016aa6635de48887d08c6e63e53add6e22","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"backend/src/yinshi/services/workspace_runtime_paths.py","offset":150,"limit":90}}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.6-sol","usage":{"input":17225,"output":901,"cacheRead":200448,"cacheWrite":0,"reasoning":865,"totalTokens":218574,"cost":{"input":0.08612500000000001,"output":0.027030000000000002,"cacheRead":0.100224,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.21337899999999999}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1789289276326,"responseId":"resp_0212e7de83dbbd32016aa6633d590087d0b1b15eb98bbaa6c2","rawStopReason":"completed"}}
{"type":"message","id":"8a6ad895","parentId":"e1d6ce14","timestamp":"2026-09-13T08:48:30.559Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_Bqx3MeQaN8l3DMRE2D8hgXv7|fc_0212e7de83dbbd32016aa6635de48887d08c6e63e53add6e22","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"        raise TypeError(\"agents_md must be a string or None\")\n    return WorkspaceRuntimePaths(\n        workspace_path=workspace_path,\n        repo_root_path=real_repo_root_path,\n        agents_md=agents_md,\n    )\n\n\nasync def read_tenant_workspace_runtime_paths(\n    tenant: TenantContext,\n    workspace_id: str,\n    run_database_operation: DatabaseOperationRunner,\n) -> WorkspaceRuntimePaths:\n    \"\"\"Load trusted workspace paths read-only, without repair or Git effects.\n\n    Containment uses the same tenant ownership rules as execution\n    preparation, but this loader never takes the repository lifecycle lock,\n    repairs storage, publishes checkouts, or installs Git guardrails.\n    \"\"\"\n    if tenant is None:\n        raise TypeError(\"tenant must not be None\")\n    if not callable(run_database_operation):\n        raise TypeError(\"run_database_operation must be callable\")\n\n    row = await run_database_operation(\n        lambda db: _workspace_runtime_row(db, workspace_id)\n    )\n    return await _run_local_operation(lambda: _validate_readonly_runtime_paths(row, tenant))\n\n\nasync def prepare_tenant_workspace_runtime_paths(\n    tenant: TenantContext,\n    workspace_id: str,\n    run_database_operation: DatabaseOperationRunner,\n    *,\n    authority_hash: str,\n    database_identity: str,\n) -> WorkspaceRuntimePaths:\n    \"\"\"Repair and validate one tenant workspace without blocking the event loop.\"\"\"\n    if tenant is None:\n        raise TypeError(\"tenant must not be None\")\n    if not callable(run_database_operation):\n        raise TypeError(\"run_database_operation must be callable\")\n\n    checkout_state, lock_root = await run_database_operation(\n        lambda db: _load_checkout_and_lock_root(db, tenant, workspace_id)\n    )\n    async with repository_lifecycle(checkout_state.repo_id, lock_root):\n        locked_state = await run_database_operation(\n            lambda db: load_workspace_checkout_state(db, workspace_id)\n        )\n        if locked_state.repo_id != checkout_state.repo_id:\n            raise WorkspaceNotFoundError(\"Workspace repository changed during preparation\")\n        selected_path = dict(locked_state.workspace_paths).get(workspace_id)\n        repo_path = os.path.realpath(locked_state.repo_path)\n        if selected_path is not None and os.path.isdir(repo_path):\n            if not is_path_inside(os.path.realpath(selected_path), repo_path):\n                raise PermissionError(\"workspace path is outside its repository\")\n        _, row = await publish_apply_workspace_checkout_for_tenant(\n            tenant,\n            locked_state,\n            run_database_operation=run_database_operation,\n            authorize=lambda database: load_workspace_checkout_state(database, workspace_id),\n            authority_hash=authority_hash,\n            database_identity=database_identity,\n            marker_kind=\"legacy\",\n            apply=lambda database, preparation: _apply_checkout_and_load_paths(\n                database, preparation, workspace_id\n            ),\n        )\n        return await _run_local_operation(lambda: _validate_runtime_paths(row, tenant))\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1789289310559}}
