y when applicable\",\n              \"evidence\": [\n                \"review-findings\",\n                \"residual-risks\"\n              ],\n              \"severity\": \"required\"\n            }\n          ],\n          \"runtimeChecks\": [],\n          \"verifyRuns\": [],\n          \"childReport\": {\n            \"criteriaSatisfied\": [\n              {\n                \"id\": \"criterion-1\",\n                \"status\": \"satisfied\",\n                \"evidence\": \"Seven concrete findings with file:line and severity (F1 high: ~3x memory amplification in workspace_replica_publication.py:487-570/634-673/1046-1109; F2 medium: descriptor->publication bridge gap between broker_artifact_store.py:950-1070 and the bytes-only APIs; F3 medium: 2-3 redundant full git verifications per publish; F4-F6 low; F7 info attesting current descriptor handling is safe), plus a bounded implementation proposal and residual risks. Read-only honored: no files modified, nothing staged.\"\n              }\n            ],\n            \"changedFiles\": [],\n            \"testsAddedOrUpdated\": [],\n            \"commandsRun\": [\n              {\n                \"command\": \"cd backend && ./.venv/bin/python -m pytest tests/test_broker_artifact_store.py tests/test_workspace_replica_publication.py -q\",\n                \"result\": \"passed\",\n                \"summary\": \"Green baseline: 50 passed in 37.02s (system python lacks deps; backend/.venv required)\"\n              }\n            ],\n            \"validationOutput\": [\n              \"50 passed, 2 warnings in 37.02s (tests/test_broker_artifact_store.py + tests/test_workspace_replica_publication.py)\",\n              \"git status shows pre-existing modified files only; no changes made by this review\"\n            ],\n            \"residualRisks\": [\n              \"F1/F3 stand today: any consumer wiring broker artifacts into publish_artifact_set will hit ~3 GiB transient RSS and 2-3 full git verification cycles per 1 GiB set, with a fixed 300s per-git-command timeout (git.py:83) as an additional timeout risk\",\n              \"Proposal item 1 adds a public API to WorkspaceReplicaPublicationStore (contract change) and requires parent approval before implementation\",\n              \"Full streaming decode_worktree_artifact is deferred; interim residual peak ~0.6 GiB for the worktree role under default limits\",\n              \"tracemalloc-based memory test in the proposed test plan measures the Python process only, not git child RSS; it is a regression guard, not a hard proof\",\n              \"Bytes-path APIs remain as-is in the proposal; existing callers keep current behavior until migrated\"\n            ],\n            \"noStagedFiles\": true,\n            \"diffSummary\": \"No diff; read-only review with proposal only\",\n            \"reviewFindings\": [\n              \"high: backend/src/yinshi/services/workspace_replica_publication.py:487-570,634-673,1046-1109 - full-content pins and re-materialization cause ~3x memory amplification for 1 GiB exact-three sets (F1)\",\n              \"medium: backend/src/yinshi/services/workspace_replica_publication.py:618-627,817-830 - bytes-only publication APIs force either 1 GiB materialization or unsafe path reopen when bridging from BrokerArtifactStore pinned descriptors (F2)\",\n              \"medium: backend/src/yinshi/services/workspace_replica_publication.py:825,1055,1140 - verification runs 2-3 full git bundle/index-pack cycles per publication (F3)\",\n              \"low: backend/src/yinshi/services/workspace_replica_publication.py:487-502 - _read_descriptor chunks+join transiently doubles per-artifact memory on every pin/recheck (F4)\",\n              \"low: backend/src/yinshi/services/workspace_replica_artifact.py:875,886 - decode copies index payload and manifest content slices (~artifact size again) on every verify (F5)\",\n              \"low: backend/src/yinshi/services/workspace_replica_publication.py:369-388 with workspace_replica_object_pack.py:24 - inventory digests build up to 1M asdict dicts plus one JSON blob in memory (F6)\",\n              \"info: backend/src/yinshi/services/broker_artifact_store.py:650-697,728-744,1009-1058 - descriptor handling verified safe: chunked pread from pinned fds, dirfd-anchored O_NOFOLLOW opens, fail-closed root identity cross-check; no path reopen exists today and none should be introduced (F7)\"\n            ],\n            \"manualNotes\": \"Task packet asked for findings plus a bounded proposal without modifying; the descriptor-sourced publish method is a public-contract addition, so per constraints it is proposed, not implemented, pending parent approval. Baseline tests are green (50 passed) via backend/.venv. Existing concurrent/cancellation/quarantine semantics in both stores (attempt quarantine, no-replace rename with identity-checked parents, post-rename unresolved states) were traced and should be preserved unchanged by the proposal.\"\n          }\n        },\n        \"toolCalls\": [\n          {\n            \"text\": \"$ find /Users/user/projects/yinshi -type f -name \\\"*.md\\\" -maxde...\",\n            \"expandedText\": \"$ find /Users/user/projects/yinshi -type f -name \\\"*.md\\\" -maxdepth 2 | head -20; echo \\\"---\\\"; ls /Users/user/projects/yinshi\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"text\": \"grep {\\\"pattern\\\":\\\"class BrokerArtifactStore\\\",\\\"...\",\n            \"expandedText\": \"grep {\\\"pattern\\\":\\\"class BrokerArtifactStore\\\",\\\"path\\\":\\\"/Users/user/projects/yinshi\\\"}\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"text\": \"grep {\\\"pattern\\\":\\\"class WorkspaceReplicaPublic...\",\n            \"expandedText\": \"grep {\\\"pattern\\\":\\\"class WorkspaceReplicaPublicationStore\\\",\\\"path\\\":\\\"/Users/user/projects/yinshi\\\"}\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"text\": \"read ~/projects/yinshi/CLAUDE.md\",\n            \"expandedText\": \"read ~/projects/yinshi/CLAUDE.md