 payload schema, configured limits digest, authority, and recomputed artifact_set_sha256 before BrokerArtifactStore.receive. Payload is the existing lifecycle metadata plus an authority object of exact physical_target_id, replica_generation, execution_owner_id. Response is signed and exact {stored:true, receipt_id, artifact_set_sha256}. Invalid auth is fail-closed. Valid rejection/unknown returns signed stable result without secrets. Exact retries consume and validate the whole body. Add default-false upload gate and config only to the new upload daemon, not existing broker daemon. Separate connection timeout must strictly exceed store transfer timeout. Add systemd socket/service, tmpfiles, pyproject entry point, and focused tests. Preserve fixed paths, 0600/0700 ownership, bounded buffers, cancellation cleanup, no bytes in SQLite. Before edits read coding-practices, python-practices, and current code/tests. If TDD Guard blocks edits, return an exact parent-applicable edit packet instead of bypassing it. Run focused pytest, Ruff, strict mypy, py_compile, and systemd verify where possible. Escalate any contract conflict rather than improvising.\",\n      \"routingContract\": {\n        \"version\": 1,\n        \"agent\": \"worker-expert\",\n        \"model\": \"openai-codex/gpt-5.6-sol\",\n        \"thinking\": \"xhigh\",\n        \"policyDigest\": \"8590d2fc0420152aad3f867aba1c18a56b3632f2d90e01d30d3f04676cd46ac5\"\n      },\n      \"launchContractDigest\": \"4d8f7f3912903e1a4d52da099f62d6dac671343d33ce9ea9786fe42e13e89cdd\",\n      \"launchResolvedExtensions\": {\n        \"version\": 1,\n        \"source\": \"launch-resolved\",\n        \"disableAmbientExtensions\": false,\n        \"runtime\": [\n          \"sha256:cb00ccf63b7cf9f4\"\n        ],\n        \"configured\": [],\n        \"effective\": [\n          \"sha256:cb00ccf63b7cf9f4\"\n        ],\n        \"omitted\": {\n          \"runtime\": 0,\n          \"configured\": 0,\n          \"effective\": 0\n     