es EOF, then returns one bounded signed response. Upload service authenticates kernel peer UID before bytes, Ed25519 request key, protocol/database/broker incarnations, request_type replica.artifacts.upload, exact payload schema, configured limits digest, authority, and recomputed artifact_set_sha256 before BrokerArtifactStore.receive. Payload is the existing lifecycle metadata plus an authority object of exact physical_target_id, replica_generation, execution_owner_id. Response is signed and exact {stored:true, receipt_id, artifact_set_sha256}. Invalid auth is fail-closed. Valid rejection/unknown returns signed stable result without secrets. Exact retries consume and validate the whole body. Add default-false upload gate and config only to the new upload daemon, not existing broker daemon. Separate connection timeout must strictly exceed store transfer timeout. Add systemd socket/service, tmpfiles, pyproject entry point, and focused tests. Preserve fixed paths, 0600/0700 ownership, bounded buffers, cancellation cleanup, no bytes in SQLite. Before edits read coding-practices, python-practices, and current code/tests. If TDD Guard blocks edits, return an exact parent-applicable edit packet instead of bypassing it. Run focused pytest, Ruff, strict mypy, py_compile, and systemd verify where possible. Escalate any contract conflict rather than improvising.","status":"completed","createdAt":"2026-09-13T10:31:34.898Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-13T10:46:09.050Z","runs":[{"runId":"call_HSkZZ78EbD4sI1v34EKyfEaU|fc_0212e7de83dbbd32016aa67b7acc0c87d08ba0717661dab0ad","mode":"workflow","agent":"worker-expert","status":"completed","startedAt":"2026-09-13T10:46:09.050Z","completedAt":"2026-09-13T10:46:09.050Z","usage":{"tokens":181369}}],"decisions":[],"artifacts":[{"kind":"output","path":"/Users/user/projects/yinshi/.pi-subagents/artifacts/61e68de3_worker-expert_0_output.md"},{"kind":"other","path":"/Users/user/projects/yinshi/.pi-subagents/artifacts/61e68de3_worker-expert_0_transcript.jsonl","description":"Child transcript"}],"receipts":[],"cwd":"/Users/user/projects/yinshi","ownerSessionId":"/Users/user/.pi/agent/sessions/--Users-user-projects-yinshi--/2026-09-04T04-44-52-550Z_01a06abb-dfc5-7c65-82bb-7c5f2081ee64.jsonl","summary":"Workflow completed.\n\nReturn:\n{\n  \"key\": \"transport_impl\",\n  \"ok\": true,\n  \"runId\": \"61e68de3\",\n  \"output\": \"Turn budget wrap-up was requested after 30 assistant turns (soft limit 30, grace 5). Process-mode live steering is unavailable, so the child was warned at launch to wrap up by this budget. Output may be partial.\\n\\nImplemented separate authenticated artifact upload data plane.\\n\\nCause:\\n- Existing 65,536-byte broker frame cannot carry bounded artifacts.\\n- Existing broker reader requires EOF after one frame.\\n- Reusing it would weaken control framing. Separate socket preserves behavior.\\n\\nState ownership:\\n- Upload service authenticates metadata and peer identity.\\n- `BrokerArtifactStore` owns pending, published, and quarantined upload state.\\n- Exact retries consume full input before reusing receipt.\\n- Cancellation before visibility quarantines attempts.\\n- Unknown publication outcomes remain unresolved.\\n\\nChanged files:\\n- `backend/src/yinshi/services/broker_artifact_transport.py`\\n- `backend/src/yinshi/broker_artifact_store.py`\\n- `backend/src/yinshi/broker_artifact_stdio_relay.py`\\n- `backend/src/yinshi/artifact_upload_daemon.py`\\n- `backend/tests/test_broker_artifact_transport.py`\\n- `backend/tests/test_broker_artifact_stdio_relay.py`\\n- `backend/pyproject.toml`\\n- `deploy/systemd/yinshi-artifact-upload.socket`\\n- `deploy/systemd/yinshi-artifact-upload.service`\\n- `deploy/systemd/yinshi-artifact-upload.service.d/zzzz-yinshi-hardening.conf`\\n- `deploy/tmpfiles.d/yinshi.conf`\\n- `docs/broker-root-launcher.md`\\n\\nValidation:\\n- 112 focused and regression tests passed.\\n- Ruff lint and format passed.\\n- Strict mypy passed four changed source modules.\\n- `py_compile` passed.\\n- `git diff --check` passed.\\n- No staged files.\\n- `systemd-analyze` unavailable.\\n- `check_slop_file` unavailable.\\n\\nRejected alternatives:\\n- Enlarging `BROKER_FRAME_BYTES_MAX` violates existing bounded control contract.\\n- Reusing `broker_stdio_relay` conflicts with its requir...","acceptance":{"status":"checked","evidenceStatus":"checked","explicit":true,"effectiveAcceptance":{"level":"checked","explicit":true,"inferredReason":["write-capable worker/task"],"criteria":[{"id":"criterion-1","must":"Implement the requested change without widening scope","evidence":["changed-files","tests-added","commands-run","residual-risks","no-staged-files","validation-output"],"severity":"required"}],"evidence":["changed-files","tests-added","commands-run","residual-risks","no-staged-files","validation-output"],"verify":[],"stopRules":[]},"inferredReason":["write-capable worker/task"],"criteria":[{"id":"criterion-1","must":"Implement the requested change without widening scope","evidence":["changed-files","tests-added","commands-run","residual-risks","no-staged-files","validation-output"],"severity":"required"}],"runtimeChecks":[{"id":"criterion:criterion-1","status":"passed","message":"Required criterion 'criterion-1' satisfied."},{"id":"evidence:changed-files","status":"passed","message":"changed-files evidence present."},{"id":"evidence:tests-added","status":"passed","message":"tests-added evidence present."},{"id":"evidence:commands-run","status":"passed","message":"commands-run evidence present."},{"id":"evidence:residual-risks","status":"passed","message":"residual-risks evidence present."},{"id":"evidence:no-staged-files","status":"passed","message":"no-staged-files evidence present."},{"id":"evidence:validation-output","status":"passed","message":"validation-output evidence present."},{"id":"no-staged-files","status":"passed","message":"No staged files detected."}],"verifyRuns":[],"childReport":{"criteriaSatisfied":[{"id":"criterion-1","