{"type":"message","id":"d97d7bb0","parentId":"b6714309","timestamp":"2026-09-13T10:56:24.577Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","thinkingSignature":"{\"id\":\"rs_0212e7de83dbbd32016aa68152fc6487d0a9702fc863515421\",\"type\":\"reasoning\",\"content\":[],\"encrypted_content\":\"REDACTED\",\"summary\":[]}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_wlkIR1b7dI4bsWG8KCLeIjTX|fc_0212e7de83dbbd32016aa68153d28887d09b356ad93f968fde","name":"subagent","arguments":{"workflowScript":"return await runs.run('focused', {agent:'final-review', task:'Focused review only. Inspect current new files broker_artifact_transport.py, artifact_upload_daemon.py, broker_artifact_stdio_relay.py, BrokerArtifactStore.consume, their two tests and three systemd files. Read software-design skill. Find correctness/security issues in auth-before-body, exact-three body, signed response, retry, early rejection with a relay that writes all body before reading, timeout/cancellation, config and socket activation. Existing 112 tests and static checks pass. Do not inspect unrelated repository areas and do not modify. Return concise findings and remediation, or no remediation needed.'});","chatProgress":"live-card","context":"fresh","cwd":"/Users/user/projects/yinshi","async":false,"timeoutMs":1200000,"turnBudget":{"maxTurns":15,"graceTurns":4},"toolBudget":{"soft":45,"hard":65,"block":["bash","read","grep","find","ls"]},"artifacts":true,"outputMode":"inline"}}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.6-sol","usage":{"input":2729,"output":258,"cacheRead":165760,"cacheWrite":0,"reasoning":27,"totalTokens":168747,"cost":{"input":0.013645000000000001,"output":0.00774,"cacheRead":0.08288,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.104265}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1789296975502,"responseId":"resp_0212e7de83dbbd32016aa68150736887d0bc21ab73be07485d","rawStopReason":"completed"}}
{"type":"message","id":"6089051b","parentId":"d97d7bb0","timestamp":"2026-09-13T11:03:13.900Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_wlkIR1b7dI4bsWG8KCLeIjTX|fc_0212e7de83dbbd32016aa68153d28887d09b356ad93f968fde","toolName":"subagent","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Workflow completed.\n\nReturn:\n{\n  \"key\": \"focused\",\n  \"ok\": true,\n  \"runId\": \"5dcf482a\",\n  \"output\": \"## Findings\\n\\n1. **High — signed early rejections are lost**  \\n   `backend/src/yinshi/broker_artifact_stdio_relay.py:89-105` uploads the complete body before reading any response.  \\n   `backend/src/yinshi/services/broker_artifact_transport.py:237-291` can reject immediately after authenticated metadata validation.  \\n   Large remaining bodies make `writer.drain()` fail before the relay reads the signed rejection. The caller receives `transport_unknown` instead of `upload_rejected`.  \\n   Reproduction with 16 MiB remaining body returned `relay_error transport_unknown`.\\n\\n   **Correction:** Read the response concurrently with body upload. A complete framed response should win over later upload-side connection errors. Cancel upload safely after receiving it.  \\n   **Remediation:** `worker-advanced`, because duplex cancellation and terminal-outcome ownership interact.  \\n   **Required checks:** Add integrated large-body tests for metadata, digest, limit, and trailing-byte rejection.\\n\\n2. **High — concurrent exact retries publish conflicting outcomes**  \\n   `backend/src/yinshi/services/broker_artifact_store.py:500-668` allows identical attempts to create separate pending directories.  \\n   One rename succeeds. The other treats the no-replace collision as `upload_rejected`, without checking the winning final directory.  \\n   Reproduction using one signed frame and identical bodies produced `[(\\\"ok\\\", None), (\\\"error\\\", \\\"upload_rejected\\\")]`.\\n\\n   **Correction:** After a publication collision, quarantine the losing pending directory. Then inspect the final directory against the exact manifest. Return its deterministic receipt when equal.  \\n   **Remediation:** `worker-advanced`, because publication races and one-terminal-result guarantees interact.  \\n   **Required checks:** Add synchronized concurrent retry tests. Cover identical manifests and conflicting manifests.\\n\\n3. **Medium — CLI timeout excludes control-frame input**  \\n   `backend/src/yinshi/broker_artifact_stdio_relay.py:185-194` performs blocking control-frame reads before starting `relay_artifact_upload()` and its timeout.  \\n   A partial prefix or frame can hold the relay process indefinitely.\\n\\n   **Correction:** Create one asynchronous stdin reader first. Read control metadata and body under one absolute deadline. Preserve buffered body bytes in that reader.  \\n   **Remediation:** `worker-advanced`, because pipe ownership and cancellation must remain safe.  \\n   **Required checks:** Add a partial-control-frame stall test and confirm bounded process exit.\\n\\nAuth-before-body ordering is correct. Systemd socket permissions, exact peer UID checks, fixed paths, and default-disabled gating appear fail-closed.\\n\\nNo unanswered questions. Findings block completion.\",\n  \"artifactPaths\": [\n    \"/Users/user/.pi/agent/sessions/--Users-user-projects-yinshi--/2026-09-04T04-44-52-550Z_01a06abb-dfc5-7c65-82bb-7c5f2081ee64/5dcf482a/run-0/session.jsonl\"\n  ],\n  \"results\": [\n    {\n      \"index\": 0,\n      \"agent\": \"final-review\",\n      \"task\": \"Focused review only. Inspect current new files broker_artifact_transport.py, artifact_upload_daemon.py, broker_artifact_stdio_relay.py, BrokerArtifactStore.consume, their two tests and three systemd files. Read software-design skill. Find correctness/security issues in auth-before-body, exact-three body, signed response, retry, early rejection with a relay that writes all body before reading, timeout/cancellation, config and socket activation. Existing 112 tests and static checks pass. Do not inspect unrelated repository areas and do not modify. Return concise findings and remediation, or no remediation needed.\",\n      \"routingContract\": {\n        \"version\": 1,\n        \"agent\": \"final-review\",\n        \"model\": \"openai-codex/gpt-5.6-sol\",\n        \"thinking\": \"max\",\n        \"policyDigest\": \"8590d2fc0420152aad3f867aba1c18a56b3632f2d90e01d30d3f04676cd46ac5\"\n      },\n      \"launchContractDigest\": \"b5867dd4b4443d480504603c00fce76d447b1a065bf3643b22a03e8a66ab6ca3\",\n      \"launchResolvedExtensions\": {\n        \"version\": 1,\n        \"source\": \"launch-resolved\",\n        \"disableAmbientExtensions\": false,\n        \"runtime\": [\n          \"sha256:cb00ccf63b7cf9f4\"\n        ],\n        \"configured\": [],\n        \"effective\": [\n          \"sha256:cb00ccf63b7cf9f4\"\n        ],\n        \"omitted\": {\n          \"runtime\": 0,\n          \"configured\": 0,\n          \"effective\": 0\n        }\n      },\n      \"exitCode\": 0,\n      \"outputState\": \"present\",\n      \"usage\": {\n        \"input\": 208298,\n        \"output\": 16219,\n        \"cacheRead\": 585856,\n        \"cacheWrite\": 0,\n        \"cost\": 1.8209880000000003,\n        \"turns\": 13\n      },\n      \"model\": \"openai-codex/gpt-5.6-sol:max\",\n      \"thinking\": \"max\",\n      \"artifactPaths\": {\n        \"inputPath\": \"/Users/user/projects/yinshi/.pi-subagents/artifacts/5dcf482a_final-review_0_input.md\",\n        \"outputPath\": \"/Users/user/projects/yinshi/.pi-subagents/artifacts/5dcf482a_final-review_0_output.md\",\n        \"jsonlPath\": \"/Users/user/projects/yinshi/.pi-subagents/artifacts/5dcf482a_final-review_0.jsonl\",\n        \"transcriptPath\": \"/Users/user/projects/yinshi/.pi-subagents/artifacts/5dcf482a_final-review_0_transcript.jsonl\",\n        \"metadataPath\": \"/Users/user/projects/yinshi/.pi-subagents/artifacts/5dcf482a_final-review_0_meta.json\"\n      },\n      \"transcriptPath\": \"/Users/user