r_artifact_transport.py backend/src/yinshi/artifact_upload_daemon.py backend/src/yinshi/broker_art...\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"$ cd backend && ../.venv/bin/python - <<'PY'\\nimport asyncio, r...\",\n          \"expandedText\": \"$ cd backend && ../.venv/bin/python - <<'PY'\\nimport asyncio, runpy, tempfile\\nfrom pathlib import Path\\nfrom cryptography.hazmat.primitives.asymmetric.ed25519 import Ed25519PrivateKey\\nfrom yinshi.services.broker_protocol import parse_signed_req...\"\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  ]\n}\n\nCall trace:\n- run focused: started\n- run focused: completed (5dcf482a) in 408719ms\nMission: aad972ad-082e-4655-9487-b7fe9175efa4 (completed)"}],"details":{"mode":"workflow","runId":"call_wlkIR1b7dI4bsWG8KCLeIjTX|fc_0212e7de83dbbd32016aa68153d28887d09b356ad93f968fde","results":[{"index":0,"agent":"final-review","task":"Focused review only. Inspect current new files broker_artifact_transport.py, artifact_upload_daemon.py, broker_artifact_stdio_relay.py, BrokerArtifactStore.consume, their two tests and three systemd files. Read software-design skill. Find correctness/security issues in auth-before-body, exact-three body, signed response, retry, early rejection with a relay that writes all body before reading, timeout/cancellation, config and socket activation. Existing 112 tests and static checks pass. Do not inspect unrelated repository areas and do not modify. Return concise findings and remediation, or no remediation needed.","routingContract":{"version":1,"agent":"final-review","model":"openai-codex/gpt-5.6-sol","thinking":"max","policyDigest":"8590d2fc0420152aad3f867aba1c18a56b3632f2d90e01d30d3f04676cd46ac5"},"launchContractDigest":"b5867dd4b4443d480504603c00fce76d447b1a065bf3643b22a03e8a66ab6ca3","launchResolvedExtensions":{"version":1,"source":"launch-resolved","disableAmbientExtensions":false,"runtime":["sha256:cb00ccf63b7cf9f4"],"configured":[],"effective":["sha256:cb00ccf63b7cf9f4"],"omitted":{"runtime":0,"configured":0,"effective":0}},"exitCode":0,"outputState":"present","usage":{"input":208298,"output":16219,"cacheRead":585856,"cacheWrite":0,"cost":1.8209880000000003,"turns":13},"model":"openai-codex/gpt-5.6-sol:max","thinking":"max","artifactPaths":{"inputPath":"/Users/user/projects/yinshi/.pi-subagents/artifacts/5dcf482a_final-review_0_input.md","outputPath":"/Users/user/projects/yinshi/.pi-subagents/artifacts/5dcf482a_final-review_0_output.md","jsonlPath":"/Users/user/projects/yinshi/.pi-subagents/artifacts/5dcf482a_final-review_0.jsonl","transcriptPath":"/Users/user/projects/yinshi/.pi-subagents/artifacts/5dcf482a_final-review_0_transcript.jsonl","metadataPath":"/Users/user/projects/yinshi/.pi-subagents/artifacts/5dcf482a_final-review_0_meta.json"},"transcriptPath":"/Users/user/projects/yinshi/.pi-subagents/artifacts/5dcf482a_final-review_0_transcript.jsonl","skills":["software-design"],"turnBudget":{"maxTurns":15,"graceTurns":4,"outcome":"within-budget","turnCount":13},"toolBudget":{"hard":65,"soft":45,"block":["bash","read","grep","find","ls"],"toolCount":45,"outcome":"soft-reached","softReachedAt":45},"context":"fresh","progressSummary":{"toolCount":45,"tokens":224517,"durationMs":408564},"effects":{"fileMutation":{"status":"not-applicable","expected":false,"attempted":true}},"outputMode":"inline","finalOutput":"## Findings\n\n1. **High — signed early rejections are lost**  \n   `backend/src/yinshi/broker_artifact_stdio_relay.py:89-105` uploads the complete body before reading any response.  \n   `backend/src/yinshi/services/broker_artifact_transport.py:237-291` can reject immediately after authenticated metadata validation.  \n   Large remaining bodies make `writer.drain()` fail before the relay reads the signed rejection. The caller receives `transport_unknown` instead of `upload_rejected`.  \n   Reproduction with 16 MiB remaining body returned `relay_error transport_unknown`.\n\n   **Correction:** Read the response concurrently with body upload. A complete framed response should win over later upload-side connection errors. Cancel upload safely after receiving it.  \n   **Remediation:** `worker-advanced`, because duplex cancellation and terminal-outcome ownership interact.  \n   **Required checks:** Add integrated large-body tests for metadata, digest, limit, and trailing-byte rejection.\n\n2. **High — concurrent exact retries publish conflicting outcomes**  \n   `backend/src/yinshi/services/broker_artifact_store.py:500-668` allows identical attempts to create separate pending directories.  \n   One rename succeeds. The other treats the no-replace collision as `upload_rejected`, without checking the winning final directory.  \n   Reproduction using one signed frame and identical bodies produced `[(\"ok\", None), (\"error\", \"upload_rejected\")]`.\n\n   **Correction:** After a publication collision, quarantine the losing pending directory. Then inspect the final directory against the exact manifest. Return its deterministic receipt when equal.  \n   **Remediation:** `worker-advanced`, because publication races and one-terminal-result guarantees interact.  \n   **Required checks:** Add synchronized concurrent retry tests. Cover identical manifests and conflicting manifests.\n\n3. **Medium — CLI timeout excludes control-frame input**  \n   `backend/src/yinshi/broker_artifact_stdio_relay.py:185-194` performs blocking control-frame reads before starting `relay_artifact_upload()` and its timeout.  \n   A partial prefix or frame can hold the relay process indefinitely.\n\n   **Correction:** Create one asynchronous stdin reader first. Read control metadata and body under one absolute deadline. Preserve buffered body bytes in that reader.  \n   **Remediation:** `worker-advanced`, because pipe ownership and cancellation must remain safe.  \n   **Required checks:** Add a partial-control-frame stall test and confirm bounded process exit.\n\nAuth-before-body ordering is correct. Systemd socket permissions, exact peer UID checks, fixed paths, and default-disabled gating appear fail-closed.\n\nNo unanswered questions. Findings block completion.","controlEvents":[{"type":"active_long_running","to":"active_long_running","ts":1789297225619,"runId":"5dcf482a","agent":"final-review","index":0,"message":"final-review is still active but long-running","reason":"time_threshold","turns":8,"tokens":86926,"toolCount":36,"elapsedMs":240689}],"attemptedModels":["openai-codex/gpt-5.6-sol:max"],"modelAttempts":[{"model":"openai-codex/gpt-5.6-sol:max","success":true,"exitCode":0,"usage":{"input":208298,"output":16219,"cacheRead":585856,"cacheWrite":0,"cost":1.8209880000000003,"turns":13}}],"sessionFile":"/Users/user/.pi/agent/sessions/--Users-user-projects-yinshi--/2026-09-04T04-44-52-550Z_01a06abb-dfc5-7c65-82bb-7c5f2081ee64/5dcf482a/run-0/session.jsonl","acceptance":{"status":"attested","evidenceStatus":"attested","explicit":false,"effectiveAcceptance":{"level":"attested","explicit":false,"inferredReason":["read-only task wording"],"criteria":[{"id":"criterion-1","must":"Return concrete findings with file paths and severity when applicable","evidence":["review-findings","residual-risks"],"severity":"required"}],"evidence":["review-findings","residual-risks"],"verify":[],"stopRules":[]},"inferredReason":["read-only task wording"],"criteria":[{"id":"criterion-1","must":"Return concrete findings with file paths and severity when applicable","evidence":["review-findings","residual-risks"],"severity":"required"}],"runtimeChecks":[],"verifyRuns":[],"childReport":{"criteriaSatisfied":[{"id":"criterion-1","status":"satisfied","evidence":"Three concrete findings include severity, exact file locations, impact, correction, worker tier, and required checks."}],"changedFiles":["backend/src/yinshi/services/broker_artifact_transport.py","backend/src/yinshi/artifact_upload_daemon.py","backend/src/yinshi/broker_artifact_stdio_relay.py","backend/src/yinshi/services/broker_artifact_store.py","backend/tests/test_broker_artifact_transport.