 upload. A complete framed response should win over later upload-side connection errors. Cancel upload safely after receiving it.  \n   **Remediation:** `worker-advanced`, because duplex cancellation and terminal-outcome ownership interact.  \n   **Required checks:** Add integrated large-body tests for metadata, digest, limit, and trailing-byte rejection.\n\n2. **High — concurrent exact retries publish conflicting outcomes**  \n   `backend/src/yinshi/services/broker_artifact_store.py:500-668` allows identical attempts to create separate pending directories.  \n   One rename succeeds. The other treats the no-replace collision as `upload_rejected`, without checking the winning final directory.  \n   Reproduction using one signed frame and identical bodies produced `[(\"ok\", None), (\"error\", \"upload_rejected\")]`.\n\n   **Correction:** After a publication collision, quarantine the losing pending directory. Then inspect the final directory against the exact manifest. Return its deterministic receipt when equal.  \n   **Remediation:** `worker-advanced`, because publication races and one-terminal-result guarantees interact.  \n   **Required checks:** Add synchronized concurrent retry tests. Cover identical manifests and conflicting manifests.\n\n3. **Medium — CLI timeout excludes control-frame input**  \n   `backend/src/yinshi/broker_artifact_stdio_relay.py:185-194` performs blocking control-frame reads before starting `relay_artifact_upload()` and its timeout.  \n   A partial prefix or frame can hold the relay process indefinitely.\n\n   **Correction:** Create one asynchronous stdin reader first. Read control metadata and body under one absolute deadline. Preserve buffered body bytes in that reader.  \n   **Remediation:** `worker-advanced`, because pipe ownership and cancellation must remain safe.  \n   **Required checks:** Add a partial-control-frame stall test and confirm bounded process exit.\n\nAuth-before-body ordering is correct. Systemd socket permissions, exact peer UID checks, fixed paths, and default-disabled gating appear fail-closed.\n\nNo unanswered questions. Findings block completion.","controlEvents":[{"type":"active_long_running","to":"active_long_running","ts":1789297225619,"runId":"5dcf482a","agent":"final-review","index":0,"message":"final-review is still active but long-running","reason":"time_threshold","turns":8,"tokens":86926,"toolCount":36,"elapsedMs":240689}],"attemptedModels":["openai-codex/gpt-5.6-sol:max"],"modelAttempts":[{"model":"openai-codex/gpt-5.6-sol:max","success":true,"exitCode":0,"usage":{"input":208298,"output":16219,"cacheRead":585856,"cacheWrite":0,"cost":1.8209880000000003,"turns":13}}],"sessionFile":"/Users/user/.pi/agent/sessions/--Users-user-projects-yinshi--/2026-09-04T04-44-52-550Z_01a06abb-dfc5-7c65-82bb-7c5f2081ee64/5dcf482a/run-0/session.jsonl","acceptance":{"status":"attested","evidenceStatus":"attested","explicit":false,"effectiveAcceptance":{"level":"attested","explicit":false,"inferredReason":["read-only task wording"],"criteria":[{"id":"criterion-1","must":"Return concrete findings with file paths and severity when applicable","evidence":["review-findings","residual-risks"],"severity":"required"}],"evidence":["review-findings","residual-risks"],"verify":[],"stopRules":[]},"inferredReason":["read-only task wording"],"criteria":[{"id":"criterion-1","must":"Return concrete findings with file paths and severity when applicable","evidence":["review-findings","residual-risks"],"severity":"required"}],"runtimeChecks":[],"verifyRuns":[],"childReport":{"criteriaSatisfied":[{"id":"criterion-1","status":"satisfied","evidence":"Three concrete findings include severity, exact file locations, impact, correction, worker tier, and required checks."}],"changedFiles":["backend/src/yinshi/services/broker_artifact_transport.py","backend/src/yinshi/artifact_upload_daemon.py","backend/src/yinshi/broker_artifact_stdio_relay.py","backend/src/yinshi/services/broker_artifact_store.py","backend/test