g tests narrowly to target it, never delete race coverage. Complete additive descriptor-source verification/publication APIs with source descriptors held and rechecked. Bundle/index copy and hashing must use bounded chunks and pinned descriptors; only worktree may remain bounded in memory. Preserve all existing byte APIs and behaviors, publication modes/ownership/no-replace/quarantine/fsync/cancellation/unknown semantics. Add descriptor bridge tests with BrokerArtifactStore opened set, source mutation, digest mismatch, bounded chunk behavior, retry/collision and cancellation. Run focused suites in smaller bounded groups, Ruff, format, strict mypy, py_compile, diff check. Do not commit. If current partial design is unsound, repair it rather than reverting production behavior.","status":"completed","createdAt":"2026-09-13T13:15:48.193Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-13T13:28:50.041Z","runs":[{"runId":"call_Mm1y5AxBCo8xBa2sZvgvwvgL|fc_0212e7de83dbbd32016aa6a1fbc8e487d0814181ff3a131a16","mode":"workflow","agent":"worker-expert","status":"completed","startedAt":"2026-09-13T13:28:50.040Z","completedAt":"2026-09-13T13:28:50.040Z","usage":{"tokens":127138}}],"decisions":[],"artifacts":[{"kind":"output","path":"/Users/user/projects/yinshi/.pi-subagents/artifacts/d108435a_worker-expert_0_output.md"},{"kind":"other","path":"/Users/user/projects/yinshi/.pi-subagents/artifacts/d108435a_worker-expert_0_transcript.jsonl","description":"Child transcript"}],"receipts":[],"cwd":"/Users/user/projects/yinshi","ownerSessionId":"/Users/user/.pi/agent/sessions/--Users-user-projects-yinshi--/2026-09-04T04-44-52-550Z_01a06abb-dfc5-7c65-82bb-7c5f2081ee64.jsonl","summary":"Workflow completed.\n\nReturn:\n{\n  \"key\": \"finish2\",\n  \"ok\": true,\n  \"runId\": \"d108435a\",\n  \"output\": \"Turn budget wrap-up was requested after 35 assistant turns (soft limit 35, grace 6). Process-mode live steering is unavailable, so the child was warned at launch to wrap up by this budget. Output may be partial.\\