ancelledError` survives and one quarantine remains.\\n4. Mutate source during copy and expect `ReplicaPublicationRejectedError`.\\n5. Confirm no final target appears in either case.\\n6. Run 66 scoped tests, Ruff, format check, strict mypy, `py_compile`, and `git diff --check`.\\n\\n## Other reviewed areas\\n\\nNo additional defect found in scoped path handling, hashing, lengths, marker comparison, no-replace publication, or post-visibility unknown handling.\\n\\nScoped modules contain no `/proc/self/fd` or `/dev/fd` assumptions. Bundle Git commands use broker-owned private temporary copies.\\n\\nDuplicate semantic verification remains a performance risk. `publish_opened_artifact_set()` verifies before copying, then final inspection verifies again.\\n\\n## Review limits\\n\\nNo production caller currently uses the new opened APIs. Future coordinator integration remains outside this diff.\\n\\nWorker-reported 66-test results were fresh, so they were not repeated. Those tests do not cover the confirmed failure path.\",\n      \"controlEvents\": [\n        {\n          \"type\": \"active_long_running\",\n          \"to\": \"active_long_running\",\n          \"ts\": 1789306382968,\n          \"runId\": \"e4b57ee2\",\n          \"agent\": \"final-review\",\n          \"index\": 0,\n          \"message\": \"final-review is still active but long-running\",\n          \"reason\": \"time_threshold\",\n          \"turns\": 9,\n          \"tokens\": 161795,\n          \"toolCount\": 38,\n          \"elapsedMs\": 240571\n        }\n      ],\n      \"attemptedModels\": [\n        \"openai-codex/gpt-5.6-sol:max\"\n      ],\n      \"modelAttempts\": [\n        {\n          \"model\": \"openai-codex/gpt-5.6-sol:max\",\n          \"success\": true,\n          \"exitCode\": 0,\n          \"usage\": {\n            \"input\": 288137,\n            \"output\": 23589,\n            \"cacheRead\": 1878144,\n            \"cacheWrite\": 0,\n            \"cost\": 3.0874269999999995,\n         