get wrap-up was requested after 20 assistant turns (soft limit 20, grace 4). Process-mode live steering is unavailable, so the child was warned at launch to wrap up by this budget. Output may be partial.\n\n## Confirmed finding\n\n**High — Previsibility cancellation or copy rejection becomes falsely unresolved**\n\nLocations:\n\n- `backend/src/yinshi/services/workspace_replica_publication.py:518-564`\n- `backend/src/yinshi/services/workspace_replica_publication.py:1044-1052`\n- `backend/src/yinshi/services/workspace_replica_publication.py:1282-1322`\n- Missing coverage: `backend/tests/test_workspace_replica_publication.py:330-367`\n\n`_write_descriptor_regular()` creates its target before returning identity. The caller records identity only after `_run_blocking()` returns.\n\nDuring cancellation, `_run_blocking()` waits for the thread, then raises `CancelledError`. During source mutation, the writer raises before returning identity.\n\nBoth paths leave a created file absent from `file_identities`. Cleanup successfully quarantines the pending directory. It then rejects the untracked file as an extra entry and raises `ReplicaPublicationUnresolvedError`.\n\nThis masks a known previsibility cancellation or rejection. No final publication exists, so post-visibility uncertainty does not apply.\n\nExisting cancellation coverage pauses during the third source recheck. All copied file identities already exist then. It does not exercise cancellation inside `to_thread`.\n\n### Correction\n\nCreate and record each target identity before entering cancellable copy work. Pass the retained target descriptor into the worker.\n\nAlternative cleanup must safely recognize partially created fixed-role files. It must not weaken foreign-entry, ownership, no-follow, or link-count checks.\n\n### Remediation plan\n\nUse `worker-advanced`. Fix spans thread cancellation, descriptor ownership, quarantine verification, and error classification.\n\nRequired checks:\n\n1. Cancel during an active descriptor copy after target creation.\n2. Confirm worker completion precedes descriptor closure.\n3. Confirm `CancelledError` survives and one quarantine remains.\n4. Mutate source during copy and expect `ReplicaPublicationRejectedError`.\n5. Confirm no final target appears in either case.\n6. Run 66 scoped tests, Ruff, format check, strict mypy, `py_compile`, and `git diff --check`.\n\n## Other reviewed areas\n\nNo additional defect found in scoped path handling, hashing, lengths, marker comparison, no-replace publication, or post-visibility unknown handling.\n\nScoped modules contain no `/proc/self/fd` or `/dev/fd` assumptions. Bundle Git commands use broker-owned private temporary copies.\n\nDuplicate semantic verification remains a performance risk. `publish_opened_artifact_set()` verifies before copying, then final inspection verifies again.\n\n## Review limits\n\nNo production caller currently uses the new opened APIs. Future coordinator integration remains outside this diff.\n\nWorker-reported 66-test results were fresh, so they were not repeated. Those tests do not cover the confirmed failure path.","artifactPaths":["/Users/user/.pi/agent/sessions/--Users-user-projects-yinshi--/2026-09-04T04-44-52-550Z_01a06abb-dfc5-7c65-82bb-7c5f2081ee64/e4b57ee2/run-0/session.jsonl"],"results":[{"index":0,"agent":"final-review","task":"Review actual current descriptor-pinned verification/publication diff with software-design skill. Scope: workspace_replica_bundle.py, workspace_replica_object_pack.py, workspace_replica_publication.py, test_workspace_replica_publication.py, and BrokerArtifactStore opened API. Original requirement: additive descriptor bridge, no unsafe incoming path reopen, descriptors held and source owner rechecked across semantic verification and streaming publication, O(chunk) for bundle/index, only bounded worktree bytes in memory, exact receipt semantics, 0700/0600/no-follow/link count/no-replace/quarantine/fsync, safe cancellation and post-visibility unknown. Existing bytes behavior preserved. Worker reports 66 tests plus static checks pass. Inspect for /proc/self/fd/path assumptions, temporary file identity, descriptor mutation races, cancellation of to_thread, hashing and length, duplicate verification, marker consistency, and test adequacy. Do not modify. Return findings with remediation or explicit no remediation needed.","routingContract":{"version":1,"agent":"final-review","model":"openai-codex/gpt-5.6-sol","thinking":"max","policyDigest":"8590d2fc0420152aad3f867aba1c18a56b3632f2d90e01d30d3f04676cd46ac5"},"launchContractDigest":"0f47af62b6aaac724ee47058b8641cfa314dcd422a77b4832d782fbc35c74523","launchResolvedExtensions":{"version":1,"source":"launch-resolved","disableAmbientExtensions":false,"runtime":["sha256:cb00ccf63b7cf9f4"],"configured":[],"effective":["sha256:cb00ccf63b7cf9f4"],"omitted":{"runtime":0,"configured":0,"effective":0}},"exitCode":0,"outputState":"present","usage":{"input":288137,"output":23589,"cacheRead":1878144,"cacheWrite":0,"cost":3.0874269999999995,"turns":26},"model":"openai-codex/gpt-5.6-sol:max","thinking":"max","artifactPaths":{"inputPath":"/Users/user/projects/yinshi/.pi-subagents/artifacts/e4b57ee2_final-review_0_input.md","outputPath":"/Users/user/projects/yinshi/.pi-subagents/artifacts/e4b57ee2_final-review_0_output.md","jsonlPath":"/Users/user/projects/yinshi/.pi-subagents/artifacts/e4b57ee2_final-review_0.jsonl","transcriptPath":"/Users/user/projects/yinshi/.pi-subagents/artifacts/e4b57ee2_final-review_0_transcript.jsonl","metadataPath":"/Users/user/projects/yinshi/.pi-subagents/artifacts/e4b57ee2_final-review_0_meta.json"},"transcriptPath":"/Users/user/projects/yinshi/.pi-subagents/artifacts/e4b57ee2_final-review_0_transcript.jsonl","skills":["software-design"],"turnBudget":{"maxTurns":20,"graceTurns":4,"turnCount":26,"outcome":"wrap-up-requested","wrapUpRequestedAtTurn":20},"toolBudget":{"hard":110,"soft":75,"block":["bash","read","grep","find","ls"],"toolCount":71,"outcom