{"type":"custom_message","customType":"subagent_supervisor_request","content":"Subagent progress update.\nRun: e4b57ee2\nAgent: final-review\nChild index: 0\nChild intercom target: subagent-final-review-e4b57ee2-1\n\nUPDATE: Confirmed blocking cancellation/failure-classification defect. During awaited `_write_descriptor_regular` at workspace_replica_publication.py:1283-1290, target file exists before await returns, but `file_identities` is assigned only after return. Cancellation waits for thread then raises, or digest failure raises, leaving created file untracked. `_cleanup_pending` at lines 1050-1052 quarantines successfully, then rejects extra entry and replaces previsibility cancellation/rejection with `ReplicaPublicationUnresolvedError`. Existing cancellation test pauses only after all copies, so it misses this path. Continuing review for more findings.","display":true,"details":{"id":"e5c94aca-a1dc-4b57-bdc4-6653d16a6433","reason":"progress_update","expectsReply":false,"runId":"e4b57ee2","agent":"final-review","childIndex":0},"id":"d9a97350","parentId":"39ba5584","timestamp":"2026-09-13T13:41:42.253Z"}
