 /Users/user/projects/yinshi. Apply the actual /Users/user/.pi/agent/skills/software-design/SKILL.md content. Original requirement: descriptor-backed publication must pin incoming descriptors and named ownership across verification/publication, stream bundle and index-object bytes in bounded chunks, keep only bounded worktree bytes in memory, reject mutation/cancellation safely before visibility, and never misclassify a known-owned partial fixed-role copy as unresolved. Prior blocking finding: target file existed before file_identities assignment when cancellation or digest failure occurred during _write_descriptor_regular. Correction now creates and validates target synchronously, records its (dev,ino) before awaited copy, holds descriptor through drained thread completion, then closes it. New tests cancel inside the fifth descriptor copy (the pending publication copy) and mutate source during that copy. Review actual git diff and relevant callers for backend/src/yinshi/services/workspace_replica_bundle.py, workspace_replica_object_pack.py, workspace_replica_publication.py, and backend/tests/test_workspace_replica_publication.py. Current checks: 68 focused tests passed; Ruff lint/format passed; strict mypy passed; git diff --check passed. Require findings with location/requirement, impact, correction, and validation. If none, explicitly state no remediation is needed. Do not modify files.","routingContract":{"version":1,"agent":"final-review","model":"openai-codex/gpt-5.6-sol","thinking":"max","policyDigest":"8590d2fc0420152aad3f867aba1c18a56b3632f2d90e01d30d3f04676cd46ac5"},"launchContractDigest":"6652442d284d58677a2bedeb23ee649d4edd80b25dacc4105bd98ff4740ed8d3","launchResolvedExtensions":{"version":1,"source":"launch-resolved","disableAmbientExtensions":false,"runtime":["sha256:cb00ccf63b7cf9f4"],"configured":[],"effective":["sha256:cb00ccf63b7cf9f4"],"omitted":{"runtime":0,"configured":0,"effective":0}},"exitCode":0,"outputState":"present","usage":{"input":505677,"output":37657,"cacheRead":4884608,"cacheWrite":0,"cost":6.100399,"turns":46},"model":"openai-codex/gpt-5.6-sol:max","thinking":"max","artifactPaths":{"inputPath":"/Users/user/projects/yinshi/.pi-subagents/artifacts/812208c0_final-review_0_input.md","outputPath":"/Users/user/projects/yinshi/.pi-subagents/artifacts/812208c0_final-review_0_output.md","jsonlPath":"/Users/user/projects/yinshi/.pi-subagents/artifacts/812208c0_final-review_0.jsonl","transcriptPath":"/Users/user/projects/yinshi/.pi-subagents/artifacts/812208c0_final-review_0_transcript.jsonl","metadataPath":"/Users/user/projects/yinshi/.pi-subagents/artifacts/812208c0_final-review_0_meta.json"},"transcriptPath":"/Users/user/projects/yinshi/.pi-subagents/artifacts/812208c0_final-review_0_transcript.jsonl","skills":["software-design"],"context":"fresh","progressSummary":{"toolCount":117,"tokens":543334,"durationMs":1155198},"effects":{"fileMutation":{"status":"not-applicable","expected":false,"attempted":true}},"outputMode":"inline","finalOutput":"Review blocked. Three findings remain.\n\nTrusted `software-design` skill and red-flags checklist were applied. Reviewed scoped diff, broker descriptor ownership, Git descriptor input, cancellation, and cleanup paths.\n\n## Prior finding\n\nResolved at `backend/src/yinshi/services/workspace_replica_publication.py:1308-1320`.\n\nTarget creation and validation now complete before suspension. Identity records at line 1310 before awaited copying. Target closes only after drained worker completion.\n\nA direct digest-failure reproducer confirmed rejection, exact quarantine, and no final visibility.\n\n## Confirmed findings\n\n### 1. Medium: first temporary descriptor leaks when second open fails\n\nLocation: `backend/src/yinshi/services/workspace_replica_publication.py:860-893`\n\nRequirement: descriptor ownership must remain explicit across success and failure.\n\n`bundle_copy` opens before the cleanup block begins. If `index_copy` fails to open, control never reaches lines 868-893.\n\nImpact: each failure leaks one descriptor and its deleted temporary inode. Repeated failures can exhaust process descriptors and disrupt later publications.\n\nCorrection: register cleanup immediately after each successful open. Use nested `try/finally` blocks or `ExitStack`.\n\nValidation reproduced this state:\n\n```text\nbundle_descriptor_leaked=True; descriptor=9\n```\n\nRemediation tier: `worker-advanced`, due descriptor ownership across asynchronous verification.\n\n### 2. Medium: bounded descriptor scans block the event loop\n\nLocations:\n\n- `backend/src/yinshi/services/workspace_replica_bundle.py:288-332,444-465`\n- `backend/src/yinshi/services/workspace_replica_object_pack.py:191-235,275-333`\n- `backend/src/yinshi/services/workspace_replica_publication.py:617-698,981-1029,1488-1497`\n\nRequirement: repository rules require asynchronous handling for I/O-bound work. Cancellation must remain safe during descriptor work.\n\nFull descriptor hashes run synchronously inside async verification. Limits permit 512 MiB bundle and pack scans. Publication repeats these scans.\n\nImpact: accepted artifacts can block all event-loop work and delay cancellation for each scan.\n\nA delayed hash reproduced event-loop starvation:\n\n```text\nheartbeat_delay_seconds=0.254; event_loop_blocked=True\n```\n\nCorrection: move full descriptor scans behind a cancellation-draining worker boundary. Retain each descriptor until worker completion. Centralize this policy to avoid drift.\n\nRemediation tier: `worker-advanced`.\n\n### 3. Low: pending-copy mutation test misses digest-failure branch\n\nLocation: `backend/tests/test_workspace_replica_publication.py:440-454`\n\nRequirement: regression coverage must mutate the source currently copied into pending publication.\n\nThe fifth copy handles `index-objects.pack`. The test instead mutates `committed.bundle`, whose pending copy already completed.\n\nImpact: the test exercises final source recheck. It would not detect regression in partial-target cleanup after copy digest failure.\n\nCorrection: mutate `index-objects.pack` on the fifth call. Assert `ReplicaPublicationRejectedError`, exact quarantine contents, and absent final target.\n\nA direct current-source mutation check passed against current implementation:\n\n```text\nReplicaPublicationRejectedError; calls=5; final_absent=True; abandoned_exact=True\n```\n\nRemediation tier: `worker-simple` if handled separately.\n\n## Required checks after correction\n\n1. Add second-open failure injection and prove the first descriptor closes.\n2. Add event-loop heartbeat coverage around large descriptor scans.\n3. Confirm cancellation waits for scan completion before descriptor closure.\n4. Correct the fifth-copy mutation regression.\n5. Repeat 68 focused tests, Ruff, format check, strict mypy, `py_compile`, and diff check.\n\n## Unanswered questions\n\nNone.\n\n## Residual risks\n\nNo production caller currently uses the opened APIs. Coordinator context lifetime and broker recheck binding remain outside this diff.\n\nUnrelated uncommitted files were not reviewed.","controlEvents":[{"type":"active_long_running","to":"active_long_running","ts":1789307611174,"runId":"812208c0","agent":"final-review","index":0,"message":"final-review is still active but long-running","reason":"time_threshold","turns":18,"tokens":292946,"toolCount":63,"elapsedMs":240615}],"attemptedModels":["openai-codex/gpt-5.6-sol:max"],"modelAttempts":[{"model":"openai-codex/gpt-5.6-sol:max","success":true,"exitCode":0,"usage":{"input":505677,"output":37657,"cacheRead":4884608,"cacheWrite":0,"cost":6.100399,"turns":46}}],"sessionFile":"/Users/user/.pi/agent/sessions/--Users-user-projects-yinshi--/2026-09-04T04-44-52-550Z_01a06abb-dfc5-7c65-82bb-7c5f2081ee64/812208c0/run-0/session.jsonl","acceptance":{"status":"attested","evidenceStatus":"attested","explicit":false,"effectiveAcceptance":{"level":"attested","explicit":false,"inferredReason":["read-only task wording"],"cri