scriptor ownership must remain explicit across success and failure.\\n\\n`bundle_copy` opens before the cleanup block begins. If `index_copy` fails to open, control never reaches lines 868-893.\\n\\nImpact: each failure leaks one descriptor and its deleted temporary inode. Repeated failures can exhaust process descriptors and disrupt later publications.\\n\\nCorrection: register cleanup immediately after each successful open. Use nested `try/finally` blocks or `ExitStack`.\\n\\nValidation reproduced this state:\\n\\n```text\\nbundle_descriptor_leaked=True; descriptor=9\\n```\\n\\nRemediation tier: `worker-advanced`, due descriptor ownership across asynchronous verification.\\n\\n### 2. Medium: bounded descriptor scans block the event loop\\n\\nLocations:\\n\\n- `backend/src/yinshi/services/workspace_replica_bundle.py:288-332,444-465`\\n- `backend/src/yinshi/services/workspace_replica_object_pack.py:191-235,275-333`\\n- `backend/src/yinshi/services/workspace_replica_publication.py:617-698,981-1029,1488-1497`\\n\\nRequirement: repository rules require asynchronous handling for I/O-bound work. ...","acceptance":{"status":"attested","evidenceStatus":"attested","explicit":false,"effectiveAcceptance":{"level":"attested","explicit":false,"inferredReason":["read-only task wording"],"criteria":[{"id":"criterion-1","must":"Return concrete findings with file paths and severity when applicable","evidence":["review-findings","residual-risks"],"severity":"required"}],"evidence":["review-findings","residual-risks"],"verify":[],"stopRules":[]},"inferredReason":["read-only task wording"],"criteria":[{"id":"criterion-1","must":"Return concrete findings with file paths and severity when applicable","evidence":["review-findings","residual-risks"],"severity":"required"}],"runtimeChecks":[],"verifyRuns":[],"childReport":{"criteriaSatisfied":[{"id":"criterion-1","status":"satisfied","evidence":"Three concrete findings include severity, exact paths, impact, correction, worker tier, and val