eclaim effects have no existing data plane — these require external runtime unit APIs not yet present in the repository","Cross-incarnation recovery behavior (GAP-7) may leave incomplete lifecycles abandoned rather than resumed"],"noStagedFiles":true,"diffSummary":"No changes. All 71 modified and 76 untracked files are pre-existing repository state. Read-only inspection produced no file modifications.","reviewFindings":["blocker: backend/src/yinshi/services/broker_replica_lifecycle.py - No production route for replica.lifecycle requests; execution_broker.py only handles executor.launch (GAP-6)","gap: backend/src/yinshi/services/broker_replica_lifecycle.py BrokerReplicaLifecycleEffects.verify requires mapping from ReplicaVerificationReceipt fields to VerifyReceipt fields (GAP-1)","gap: backend/src/yinshi/services/broker_replica_lifecycle.py BrokerReplicaLifecycleEffects.publish requires mapping from ReplicaPublicationReceipt to PublishReceipt with authority-derived fields (GAP-1)","gap: broker_replica_journal.py complete_* methods take NO stage kwarg; _persist_completed maps by stage name dict (GAP-7 idempotency)","gap: backend/src/yinshi/services/broker_replica_lifecycle.py recover_incomplete abandons cross-incarnation lifecycles instead of resuming (GAP-7)","gap: workspace_replica_publication.py uses ReplicaStoreLimits; broker_artifact_store.py uses BrokerArtifactLimits — separate types (GAP-8)","info: admission, drain, reclaim effects have no data plane implementation in repository","info: 7 adapter mappings proposed using only existing APIs: ingest(BrokerArtifactStore), verify(BrokerArtifactStore+PublicationStore), publish(BrokerArtifactStore+PublicationStore), admission(ext), drain(ext), export(BrokerArtifactStore), reclaim(ext)"],"manualNotes":"All 7 lifecycle stages have proposed adapter mappings. Stages 1-3 (ingest/verify/publish) map entirely to existing BrokerArtifactStore and WorkspaceReplicaPublicationStore APIs. Stages 4-5 (admission/drain) and 7 (reclaim) require external runtime unit APIs not yet present. Stage 6 (export) reuses BrokerArtifactStore.open_incoming_async for re-hashing. The coordinator's stage loop, reconciliation, and error handling are complete; only the effect implementations are abstract. Sol decision needed on GAP-1, GAP-3 (field mappings), GAP-5 (reclaim semantics), and GAP-6 (production routing). GAP-2 and GAP-7 are implementation design decisions that do not block adapter writing."}},"toolCalls":[{"text":"$ find /Users/user/projects/yinshi -type f -name \"*.go\" | head...","expandedText":"$ find /Users/user/projects/yinshi -type f -name \"*.go\" | head -80"},{"text":"$ ls /Users/user/projects/yinshi/","expandedText":"$ ls /Users/user/projects/yinshi/"},{"text":"$ find /Users/user/projects/yinshi -type f \\( -name \"*.py\" -o ...","expandedText":"$ find /Users/user/projects/yinshi -type f \\( -name \"*.py\" -o -name \"*.ts\" -o -name \"*.js\" -o -name \"*.rs\" -o -name \"*.go\" -o -name \"*.java\" -o -name \"*.kt\" \\) | grep -v node_modules | grep -v \".pyc\" | sort | head -120"},{"text":"grep {\"pattern\":\"BrokerReplicaLifecycleCoordi...","expandedText":"grep {\"pattern\":\"BrokerReplicaLifecycleCoordinator\",\"path\":\"/Users/user/projects/yinshi\"}"},{"text":"read ~/projects/yinshi/backend/src/yinshi/services/broker_replica_lifecycle.py","expandedText":"read ~/projects/yinshi/backend/src/yinshi/services/broker_replica_lifecycle.py"},{"text":"grep {\"pattern\":\"class BrokerArtifactStore\",\"...","expandedText":"grep {\"pattern\":\"class BrokerArtifactStore\",\"path\":\"/Users/user/projects/yinshi\"}"},{"text":"grep {\"pattern\":\"class WorkspaceReplicaPublic...","expandedText":"grep {\"pattern\":\"class WorkspaceReplicaPublicationStore\",\"path\":\"/Users/user/projects/yinshi\"}"},{"text":"read ~/projects/yinshi/backend/src/yinshi/services/broker_artifact_store.py","expandedText":"read ~/projects/yinshi/backend/src/yinshi/services/broker_artifact_store.py"},{"text":"read ~/projects/yinshi/backend/src/yinshi/services/broker_replica_journal.py","expandedText":"read ~/projects/yinshi/backend/src/yinshi/services/broker_replica_journal.py"},{"text":"read ~/projects/yinshi/backend/src/yinshi/services/broker_replica_journal.py","expandedText":"read ~/projects/yinshi/backend/src/yinshi/services/broker_replica_journal.py"},{"text":"read ~/projects/yinshi/backend/src/yinshi/services/workspace_replica_publication.py","expandedText":"read ~/projects/yinshi/backend/src/yinshi/services/workspace_replica_publication.py"},{"text":"grep {\"pattern\":\"^class BrokerRequest\",\"path\"...","expandedText":"grep {\"pattern\":\"^class BrokerRequest\",\"path\":\"/Users/user/projects/yinshi/backend/src/yinshi/services\"}"},{"text":"grep {\"pattern\":\"^@dataclass.*\\\\nclass.*(Rece...","expandedText":"grep {\"pattern\":\"^@dataclass.*\\\\nclass.*(Receipt)\",\"path\":\"/Users/user/projects/yinshi/backend/src/yinshi/services\"}"},{"text":"$ cd /Users/user/projects/yinshi && git status --short","expandedText":"$ cd /Users/user/projects/yinshi && git status --short"},{"text":"$ cd /Users/user/projects/yinshi && git diff --stat","expandedText":"$ cd /Users/user/projects/yinshi && git diff --stat"},{"text":"contact_supervisor {\"reason\":\"progress_update\",\"message\":\"C...","expandedText":"contact_supervisor {\"reason\":\"progress_update\",\"message\":\"COMPLETED read-only inspection. Found 8 contract gaps requiring Sol decision. Key findings: (1) BrokerReplicaLifecycleCoo..."}]}],"totalChildUsage":{"input":292230,"output":15430,"cacheRead":1707412,"cacheWrite":0,"cost":0,"turns":40},"totalCost":{"inputTokens":292230,"outputTokens":15430,"costUsd":0},"workflow":{"value":[{"key":"dispatch-scout","output":"The response did not pass the STE check. Pi requested a new response."},{"key":"effects-scout","output":""}],"trace":[{"operation":"run","key":"dispatch-scout","state":"started"},{"operation":"run","key":"effects-scout","state":"started"},{"operation":"run","key":"effects-scout","state":"completed","durationMs":227857,"runId":"0f237ce2"},{"operation":"run","key":"dispatch-scout","state":"completed","durationMs":346096,"runId":"501e6a0d"}],"emits":[],"console":[]},"chatProgress":{"mode":"live-card","repoRelation":"same","repoLabel":"yinshi"},"missionId":"f2398b4f-527e-4c7b-97ac-b03e0b6ac1dd","missionPath":"/Users/user/projects/yinshi/.pi-subagents/missions/f2398b4f-527e-4c7b-97ac-b03e0b6ac1dd.json","mission":{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"f2398b4f-527e-4c7b-97ac-b03e0b6ac1dd","title":"Read-only inspect current host checkout /Users/user/projects/yinshi for exact broker daemon dispa...","objective":"Read-only inspect current host checkout /Users/user/projects/yinshi for exact broker daemon dispatch boundaries. Report current BrokerService.handle signature and authentication flow, daemon request framing, config gates, constructor ownership, and minimal files/tests needed to route replica lifecycle separately while preserving executor.launch and broker_stdio_relay. Do not modify.","status":"completed","createdAt":"2026-09-13T15:11:29.893Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-13T15:17:16.133Z","runs":[{"runId":"call_X6vScbNLbcvvT5JjeN0OVx18|fc_0212e7de83dbbd32016aa6bd1cdfc087d0a1f8c5a4e28f066f","mode":"workflow","status":"completed","startedAt":"2026-09-13T15:17:16.133Z","completedAt":"2026-09-13T15:17:16.133Z","usage":{"tokens":307660}}],"decisions":[],"artifacts":[{"kind":"output","path":"/Users/user/projects/yinshi/.pi-subagents/artifacts/501e6a0d_scout_0_output.md"},{"kind":"other","path":"/Users/user/projects/yinshi/.pi-subagents/artifacts/501e6a0d_scout_0_transcript.jsonl","description":"Child transcript"},{"kind":"output","path":"/Users/user/projects/yinshi/.pi-subagents/artifacts/0f237ce2_scout_0_output.md"},{"kind":"other","path":"/Users/user/projects/yinshi/.pi-subagents/artifacts/0f237ce2_scout_0_transcript.jsonl","description":"Child transcript"}],"receipts":[],"cwd":"/Users/user/projects/yinshi","ownerSessionId":"/Users/user/.pi/agent/sessions/--User