{"type":"custom_message","customType":"subagent_supervisor_request","content":"Subagent progress update.\nRun: 0f237ce2\nAgent: scout\nChild index: 0\nChild intercom target: subagent-scout-0f237ce2-1\n\nCOMPLETED read-only inspection. Found 8 contract gaps requiring Sol decision. Key findings: (1) BrokerReplicaLifecycleCoordinator runs 7 fixed stages via abstract ReplicaStageEffect protocol, (2) BrokerArtifactStore provides open_incoming/recheck_opened/consume API surface for ingest+verify+export stages, (3) WorkspaceReplicaPublicationStore provides verify_opened_artifact_set/publish_opened_artifact_set/inspect_published_artifact_set for verify+publish stages, (4) 7 typed receipt types map from journal to effect outputs, (5) GAP-6 (no replica.lifecycle route) is the only production blocker; GAP-1/5 require field-mapping decisions; GAP-2/8 require architecture decisions. Adapter mappings proposed for all 7 stages using only existing APIs. Working tree clean from our changes.","display":true,"details":{"id":"0ca3bbe0-6fd7-405e-81e3-1d5b036d12c5","reason":"progress_update","expectsReply":false,"runId":"0f237ce2","agent":"scout","childIndex":0},"id":"f1ae12bc","parentId":"43a1b321","timestamp":"2026-09-13T15:17:16.463Z"}
