ion, and transport documentation.\"\n            }\n          ],\n          \"changedFiles\": [],\n          \"testsAddedOrUpdated\": [],\n          \"commandsRun\": [\n            {\n              \"command\": \"Read and search broker lifecycle, journal, artifact transport, daemon, root launcher, and design files\",\n              \"result\": \"passed\",\n              \"summary\": \"Located authority gap and confirmed fixed root derivation.\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"command\": \"git diff --cached --quiet\",\n              \"result\": \"passed\",\n              \"summary\": \"No staged changes were created.\"\n            }\n          ],\n          \"validationOutput\": [\n            \"Signed upload schema already carries exact authority fields.\",\n            \"Lifecycle journal payload omits authority while coordinator requires it.\",\n            \"Root launcher accepts only action and operation ID.\",\n            \"Existing broker socket is designated for bounded control frames.\"\n          ],\n          \"residualRisks\": [\n            \"Publish recovery and four later lifecycle effects remain unfinished.\",\n            \"Production lifecycle gate must remain disabled.\"\n          ],\n          \"noStagedFiles\": true,\n          \"diffSummary\": \"Read-only architecture review. No files changed.\",\n          \"reviewFindings\": [\n            \"blocker: backend/src/yinshi/services/broker_replica_journal.py:650 - signed lifecycle payload omits required authority\",\n            \"high: backend/src/yinshi/services/execution_broker.py:165 - no authenticated replica lifecycle dispatch exists\",\n            \"high: backend/src/yinshi/services/broker_artifact_store.py:89 - artifact storage cannot act as a durable authority source\"\n          ],\n          \"manualNotes\": \"No user decision is required.\"\n        }\n      },\n      \"toolCalls\": [\n        {\n          \"text\": \"grep {\\\"pattern\\\":\\\"class BrokerReplicaJour