{"type":"custom_message","customType":"subagent_supervisor_request","content":"Subagent needs a supervisor decision.\nRun: 1e7e9618\nAgent: worker-advanced\nChild index: 0\nChild intercom target: subagent-worker-advanced-1e7e9618-1\n\nBlocked by TDD Guard on this subagent branch: every write/edit to the repo returns \"TDD Guard has no current request bound to this session branch.\" I cannot write the new focused test file (backend/tests/test_broker_replica_artifact_effects.py) or any production module.\n\nPlan of record (Phase 6 milestone per the packet, all in scope):\n1. New narrowly named effects module backend/src/yinshi/services/broker_replica_artifact_effects.py: BrokerReplicaArtifactEffects exposing .ingest/.verify/.publish stage effects built over BrokerArtifactStore + WorkspaceReplicaPublicationStore + configured ReplicaStoreLimits. Ingest apply/reconcile: inspect exact pre-uploaded incoming set -> IngestReceipt (store rejection -> StageRejected artifact_rejected/limit_rejected with deterministic receipt id; uncertainty -> StageOutcomeUnknown transfer_unknown). Verify apply/reconcile: open_incoming_async + verify_opened_artifact_set(recheck_source=incoming.recheck_opened_async) -> VerifyReceipt (deterministic receipt id; verification_rejected / verification_unknown). Publish apply: open_incoming_async + publish_opened_artifact_set -> authority-bound PublishReceipt (publication_rejected / publication_unknown). Publish reconcile: inspects exact final publication -> completed / confirmed not_applied / unknown.\n2. One new public authority-preserving store method WorkspaceReplicaPublicationStore.reconcile_published_artifact_set(declaration) -> ReplicaPublicationReceipt | None (None = conclusively absent; rejected/unresolved exceptions preserved). ReplicaInspectionReceipt alone still mints no authority.\n3. Focused tests first (TDD), then implementation; no daemon wiring, no admission/drain/export/reclaim, no commits.\n\nQuestion: can you bind the TDD Guard requ