no-remediation statement. Do not modify.","routingContract":{"version":1,"agent":"final-review","model":"openai-codex/gpt-5.6-sol","thinking":"max","policyDigest":"8590d2fc0420152aad3f867aba1c18a56b3632f2d90e01d30d3f04676cd46ac5"},"launchContractDigest":"cab02fd8281a324adbcecb74cb8e3b4445cb2b6255e8b158e06e49a95d482324","launchResolvedExtensions":{"version":1,"source":"launch-resolved","disableAmbientExtensions":false,"runtime":["sha256:cb00ccf63b7cf9f4"],"configured":[],"effective":["sha256:cb00ccf63b7cf9f4"],"omitted":{"runtime":0,"configured":0,"effective":0}},"exitCode":0,"outputState":"present","usage":{"input":518697,"output":40307,"cacheRead":10100608,"cacheWrite":0,"cost":8.852999,"turns":84},"model":"openai-codex/gpt-5.6-sol:max","thinking":"max","artifactPaths":{"inputPath":"/Users/user/projects/yinshi/.pi-subagents/artifacts/9796f5a0_final-review_0_input.md","outputPath":"/Users/user/projects/yinshi/.pi-subagents/artifacts/9796f5a0_final-review_0_output.md","jsonlPath":"/Users/user/projects/yinshi/.pi-subagents/artifacts/9796f5a0_final-review_0.jsonl","transcriptPath":"/Users/user/projects/yinshi/.pi-subagents/artifacts/9796f5a0_final-review_0_transcript.jsonl","metadataPath":"/Users/user/projects/yinshi/.pi-subagents/artifacts/9796f5a0_final-review_0_meta.json"},"transcriptPath":"/Users/user/projects/yinshi/.pi-subagents/artifacts/9796f5a0_final-review_0_transcript.jsonl","skills":["software-design"],"context":"fresh","progressSummary":{"toolCount":127,"tokens":559004,"durationMs":1059614},"effects":{"fileMutation":{"status":"not-applicable","expected":false,"attempted":true}},"outputMode":"inline","finalOutput":"## Review status\n\nBlocked. Three findings remain. Software-design skill loaded from required path and applied.\n\n### High: Reconciliation mints synchronization authority without synchronizing storage\n\nLocation:\n\n- `backend/src/yinshi/services/workspace_replica_publication.py:1672-1696`\n- `backend/src/yinshi/services/workspace_replica_publication.py:1191-1225`\n- `backend/src/yinshi/services/workspace_replica_publication.py:1492-1655`\n\n`reconcile_published_artifact_set` verifies storage, then creates a synchronization-bearing publication receipt. It never syncs final files, final directory, or publication root.\n\nA restart can observe a rename whose root sync never completed. Journal completion can then outlive artifacts after another crash.\n\nCorrection: synchronize pinned recovered state before minting authority. Recheck all identities after synchronization. Map synchronization failures to `ReplicaPublicationUnresolvedError`.\n\nRemediation tier: `worker-advanced`.\n\nValidation:\n\n- Reconcile a final left after rename-before-root-sync.\n- Assert file, final-directory, and root sync ordering.\n- Inject each sync failure. Require `publication_unknown`.\n- Confirm no authority-bearing receipt appears before successful synchronization.\n\n### High: Operational filesystem failures become terminal rejections\n\nLocation:\n\n- `backend/src/yinshi/services/broker_replica_artifact_effects.py:274-280,319-330,367-378,397-404`\n- `backend/src/yinshi/services/broker_artifact_store.py:234-245,679-695,772-790`\n- `backend/src/yinshi/services/workspace_replica_publication.py:627-644,1492-1525,1686-1695`\n\nLower stores wrap broad `OSError` failures as rejected errors. Effects then persist deterministic stage rejection instead of unknown outcome.\n\nInjected `errno.EIO` during incoming-root inspection produced:\n\n```text\nactual=StageRejected:artifact_rejected\n```\n\nTransient storage failure can permanently reject a valid authenticated lifecycle. Retry and recovery then become unavailable.\n\nCorrection: reserve rejected exceptions for proven invalid state. Map non-conclusive OS failures to owner-specific unresolved exceptions. Keep that policy inside storage owners.\n\nRemediation tier: `worker-advanced`.\n\nValidation:\n\n- Inject `EIO`, `ENOSPC`, `EMFILE`, read faults, and disappearance races.\n- Cover ingest, verify, publish apply, and publish reconcile.\n- Require stage-specific unknown outcomes.\n- Preserve deterministic rejection for confirmed missing or malformed artifacts.\n\n### Medium: Incoming artifact limits are not bound to configured lifecycle limits\n\nLocation:\n\n- `backend/src/yinshi/services/broker_replica_artifact_effects.py:443-458`\n- `backend/src/yinshi/services/broker_artifact_store.py:50-59,212-227`\n- `backend/tests/test_broker_replica_artifact_effects.py:164-190,329-336`\n\nConstructor checks only publication limits. It accepts any `BrokerArtifactStore` size profile.\n\nCurrent defaults already differ. Incoming worktree limit is 512 MiB. Replica publication worktree limit is 256 MiB.\n\nUploads can accept artifacts that lifecycle later rejects. A narrower incoming profile can reject requests valid under signed configured limits.\n\nCorrection: expose one immutable incoming size profile. Centralize conversion from `ReplicaStoreLimits`, then reject incompatible stores during effects construction.\n\nRemediation tier: `worker-advanced`.\n\nValidation:\n\n- Reject broader and narrower incoming role limits.\n- Reject aggregate-limit mismatch.\n- Ignore transport-only settings such as timeouts when checking semantic compatibility.\n- Use one shared profile conversion in upload construction and effects construction.\n\n## Confirmed behavior\n\n- Declaration validation binds request payload, context authority, artifact-set digest, and publication limits.\n- Verify and publish use pinned incoming descriptors with owner recheck callbacks.\n- Public `ReplicaInspectionReceipt` remains non-authoritative.\n- Effects contain no SQLite access.\n- Real descriptor-backed ingest, verify, publish, and reconcile path completed successfully.\n- Final candidate passed 98 focused and regression tests.\n- Final Ruff format and lint checks passed.\n- No staged files exist.\n\n## Review limits\n\nReview covered three milestone files plus artifact-store, lifecycle, journal, and publication boundaries. Other dirty checkout changes remained out of scope.\n\nStrict mypy was not repeated. Reported pass predates only a formatting correction, so its result remains applicable.\n\nRemediation required before completion.","controlEvents":[{"type":"active_long_running","to":"active_long_running","ts":1789318282913,"runId":"9796f5a0","agent":"final-review","index":0,"message":"final-review is still active but long-running","reason":"time_threshold","turns":29,"tokens":289455,"toolCount":62,"elapsedMs":240785}],"attemptedModels":["openai-codex/gpt-5.6-sol:max"],"modelAttempts":[{"model":"openai-codex/gpt-5.6-sol:max","success":true,"exitCode":0,"usage":{"input":518697,"output":40307,"cacheRead":10100608,"cacheWrite":0,"cost":8.852999,"turns":84}}],"sessionFile":"/Users/user/.pi/agent/sessions/--Users-user-projects-yinshi--/2026-09-04T04-44-52-550Z_01a06abb-dfc5-7c65-82bb-7c5f2081ee64/9796f5a0/run-0/session.jsonl","acceptance":{"status":"attested","evidenceStatus":"attested","explicit":false,"effectiveAcceptance":{"level":"attested","explicit":false,"inferredReason":["read-only task wording"],"criteria":[{"id":"criterion-1","must":"Return concrete findings with file paths and severity when applicable","evidence":["review-findings","residual-risks"],"severity":"required"}],"evidence":["review-findings","residual-risks"],"verify":[],"stopRules":[]},"inferredReason":["read-only task wording"],"criteria":[{"id":"criterion-1","must":"Return concrete findings with file paths and severity when applicable","evidence":["review-findings","residual-risks"],"severity":"required"}],"runtimeChecks":[],"verifyRuns":[],"childReport":{"criteriaSatisfied":[{"id":"criterion-1","status":"satisfied","evidence":"Three confirmed findings include severity, exact file locations, impact, correction, validation, and worker tier."}],"changedFiles":["backend/src/yinshi/services/broker_replica_artifact_effects.py","backend/src/yinshi/services/workspace_replica_publication.py","backend/tests/test_broker_replica_artifact_effects.py"],"testsAddedOrUpdated":["backend/tests/test_broker_replica_artifact_effects.py"],"commandsRun":[{"command":"cd backend && ../.venv/bin/python -m pytest tests/test_broker_replica_artifact_effects.py tests/test_broker_replica_lifecycle.py tests/test_workspace_replica_publication.py tests/test_broker_artifact_store.py -q","result":"passed","summary":"98 tests passed on the final unstaged candidate."},{"command":"cd backend && PYENV_VERSION=3.12.3 ruff format --check src/yinshi/services/broker_replica_artifact_effects.py src/yinshi/services/workspace_replica_publication.py tests/test_broker_replica_artifact_effects.py && PYENV_VERSION=3.12.3 ruff check src/yinshi/services/broker_replica_artifact_effects.py src/yinshi/services/workspace_replica_publication.py tests/test_broker_replica_artifact_effects.py","result":"passed","summary":"Three files were formatted. All scoped lint checks passed."},{"command":"git diff --check plus no-index checks for both untracked files","result":"passed","summary":"No whitespace errors found."},{"command":"inline real BrokerArtifactStore and WorkspaceReplicaPublicationStore effects probe","result":"passed","summary":"Real descriptor-backed ingest, verify, publish, absence reconciliation, and completed reconciliation passed."},{"command":"inline errno.EIO classification probe","result":"passed","summary":"Probe reproduced the defect as StageRejected:artifact_rejected."},{"command":"strict mypy","result":"not-run","summary":"Reported strict pass remained applicable after the formatting-only correction."},{"command":"git diff --cached --name-only","result":"passed","summary":"Output was empty."}],"validationOutput":["98 passed","3 files already formatted","All checks passed","real descriptor-backed ingest/verify/publish/reconcile path passed","actual=StageRejected:artifact_rejected","No staged files"],"residualRisks":["Recovered publication authority can be recorded without proving durable synchronization.","Transient filesystem failures can become permanent lifecycle rejection.","Incoming and lifecycle artifact size profiles can drift.","Production daemon wiring and later lifecycle stages were out of scope."],"noStagedFiles":true,"diffSummary":"Adds concrete ingest, verify, and publish effects, publication reconciliation, and focused tests.","reviewFindings":["high: backend/src/yinshi/services/workspace_replica_publication.py:1672-1696 - reconciliation mints synchronization-bearing authority without synchronizing recovered storage","high: backend/src/yinshi/services/broker_replica_artifact_effects.py:274-404 - lower storage OSError wrapping causes uncertain filesystem failures to become deterministic StageRejected outcomes","medium: backend/src/yinshi/services/broker_replica_artifact_effects.py:443-458 - constructor does not verify incoming artifact size-profile compatibility"],"manualNotes":"Review applies to the current unstaged working-tree candidate. Other dirty checkout changes were excluded."}},"toolCalls":[{"text":"read ~/.pi/agent/skills/software-design/SKILL.md","expandedText":"read ~/.pi/agent/skills/software-design/SKILL.md"},{"text":"ls {\"path\":\"/Users/user/projects/yinshi\"}","expandedText":"ls {\"path\":\"/Users/user/projects/yinshi\"}"},{"text":"$ git status --short --branch && printf '\\n--- top-level track...","expandedText":"$ git status --short --branch && printf '\\n--- top-level tracked rule files ---\\n' && find .. -name AGENTS.md -o -name CLAUDE.md -o -name CONTRIBUTING.md | head -50"},{"text":"read ~/projects/yinshi/CLAUDE.md","expandedText":"read ~/projects/yinshi/CLAUDE.md"},{"text":"read ~/projects/yinshi/PYTHON.md","expandedText":"read ~/projects/yinshi/PYTHON.md"},{"text":"read ~/.pi/agent/skills/software-design/references/red-flags.md","expandedText":"read ~/.pi/agent/skills/software-design/references/red-flags.md"},{"text":"find {\"pattern\":\"**/*artifact*\",\"path\":\"/User...","expandedText":"find {\"pat