mode":"live-card","repoRelation":"same","repoLabel":"yinshi"},"missionId":"26cf45e3-25dc-4f3c-9d3a-431acd3eea43","missionPath":"/Users/user/projects/yinshi/.pi-subagents/missions/26cf45e3-25dc-4f3c-9d3a-431acd3eea43.json","mission":{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"26cf45e3-25dc-4f3c-9d3a-431acd3eea43","title":"Read-only final review of current concrete broker replica artifact effects milestone in /Users/us...","objective":"Read-only final review of current concrete broker replica artifact effects milestone in /Users/user/projects/yinshi. Apply actual /Users/user/.pi/agent/skills/software-design/SKILL.md. Requirements: ingest apply/reconcile inspect exact pre-uploaded BrokerArtifactStore set and map typed IngestReceipt; verify uses open_incoming_async plus descriptor-backed verify_opened_artifact_set and recheck callback; publish apply uses pinned publication and maps authority-bound PublishReceipt; publish reconcile may mint authority only from a fully authenticated declaration and returns completed, conclusively not_applied, or stage-specific unknown. Request payload, context authority, artifact set digest, and immutable configured limits must match. Confirmed rejection -> deterministic StageRejected; uncertain storage/OS result -> StageOutcomeUnknown; cancellation propagates after underlying store drains. Effects never access SQLite. Public ReplicaInspectionReceipt remains non-authoritative. Review new broker_replica_artifact_effects.py, publication reconciliation method, focused tests, and relevant callers. Current checks: 98 focused/regression tests passed; scoped Ruff lint passed, strict mypy passed, diff check passed; final formatting-only correction applied after Ruff report. Production daemon wiring and later stages remain out of scope. Require remaining findings with location/impact/correction/validation, or explicit no-remediation statement. Do not modify.","status":"completed","createdAt":"2026-09-13T16:47:21.777Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-13T17:05:01.793Z","runs":[{"runId":"call_bkwNZwxV2iByXnzeJAZklPrm|fc_0212e7de83dbbd32016aa6d3930d5487d0a4e8f367fcc48551","mode":"workflow","agent":"final-review","status":"completed","startedAt":"2026-09-13T17:05:01.792Z","completedAt":"2026-09-13T17:05:01.792Z","usage":{"tokens":559004}}],"decisions":[],"artifacts":[{"kind":"output","path":"/Users/user/projects/yinshi/.pi-subagents/artifacts/9796f5a0_final-review_0_output.md"},{"kind":"other","path":"/Users/user/projects/yinshi/.pi-subagents/artifacts/9796f5a0_final-review_0_transcript.jsonl","description":"Child transcript"}],"receipts":[],"cwd":"/Users/user/projects/yinshi","ownerSessionId":"/Users/user/.pi/agent/sessions/--Users-user-projects-yinshi--/2026-09-04T04-44-52-550Z_01a06abb-dfc5-7c65-82bb-7c5f2081ee64.jsonl","summary":"Workflow completed.\n\nReturn:\n{\n  \"key\": \"artifact-effects-review\",\n  \"ok\": true,\n  \"runId\": \"9796f5a0\",\n  \"output\": \"## Review status\\n\\nBlocked. Three findings remain. Software-design skill loaded from required path and applied.\\n\\n### High: Reconciliation mints synchronization authority without synchronizing storage\\n\\nLocation:\\n\\n- `backend/src/yinshi/services/workspace_replica_publication.py:1672-1696`\\n- `backend/src/yinshi/services/workspace_replica_publication.py:1191-1225`\\n- `backend/src/yinshi/services/workspace_replica_publication.py:1492-1655`\\n\\n`reconcile_published_artifact_set` verifies storage, then creates a synchronization-bearing publication receipt. It never syncs final files, final directory, or publication root.\\n\\nA restart can observe a rename whose root sync never completed. Journal completion can then outlive artifacts after another crash.\\n\\nCorrection: synchronize pinned recovered state before minting authority. Recheck all identities after synchronization. Map synchronization failures to `ReplicaPublicationUnresolvedError`.\\n\\nRemediation tier: `worker-advanced`.\\n\\nValidation:\\n\\n- Reconcile a final left after rename-before-root-sync.\\n- Assert file, final-directory, and root sync ordering.\\n- Inject each sync failure. Require `publication_unknown`.\\n- Confirm no authority-bearing receipt appears before successful synchronization.\\n\\n### High: Operational filesystem failures become terminal rejections\\n\\nLocation:\\n\\n- `backend/src/yinshi/services/broker_replica_artifact_effects.py:274-280,319-330,367-378,397-404`\\n- `backend/src/yinshi/services/broker_artifact_store.py:234-245,679-695,772-790`\\n- `backend/src/yinshi/services/workspace_replica_publication.py:627-644,1492-1525,1686-1695`\\n\\nLower stores wrap broad `OSError` failures as rejected errors. Effects then persist deterministic stage rejection instead of unknown outcome.\\n\\nInjected `errno.EIO` during incoming-root inspection produced:\\n\\n```text\\nactual=StageRejected:artifa...","acceptance":{"status":"attested","evidenceStatus":"attested","explicit":false,"effectiveAcceptance":{"level":"attested","explicit":false,"inferredReason":["read-only task wording"],"criteria":[{"id":"criterion-1","must":"Return concrete findings with file paths and severity when applicable","evidence":["review-findings","residual-risks"],"severity":"required"}],"evidence":["review-findings","residual-risks"],"verify":[],"stopRules":[]},"inferredReason":["read-only task wording"],"criteria":[{"id":"criterion-1","must":"Return concrete findings with file paths and severity when applicable","evidence":["review-findings","residual-risks"],"severity":"required"}],"runtimeChecks":[],"verifyRuns":[],"childReport":{"criteriaSatisfied":[{"id":"criterion-1","status":"satisfied","evidence":"Three confirmed findings include severity, exact file locations, impact, correction, validation, and worker tier."}],"changedFiles":["backend/src/yinshi/services/broker_replica_artifact_effects.py","backend/src/yinshi/services/workspace_replica_publication.py","backend/tests/test_broker_replica_artifact_effects.py"],"testsAddedOrUpdated":["backend/tests/test_broker_replica_artifact_effects.py"],"commandsRun":[{"command":"cd backend && ../.venv/bin/python -m pytest tests/test_broker_replica_artifact_effects.py tests/test_broker_replica_lifecycle.py tests/test_workspace_replica_publication.py tests/test_broker_artifact_store.py -q","result":"passed","summary":"98 tests passed on the final unstaged candidate."},{"command":"cd backend && PYENV_VERSION=3.12.3 ruff format --check src/yinshi/services/broker_replica_artifact_effects.py src/yinshi/services/workspace_replica_publication.py tests/test_broker_replica_artifact_effects.py && PYENV_VERSION=3.12.3 ruff check src/yinshi/services/broker_replica_artifact_effects.py src/yinshi/services/workspace_replica_publication.py tests/test_broker_replica_artifact_effects.py","result":"passed","summary":"Three files were formatted. All scoped lint checks passed."},{"command":"git diff --check plus no-index checks for both untracked files","result":"passed","summary":"No whitespace errors found."},{"command":"inline real BrokerArtifactStore and WorkspaceReplicaPublicationStore effects probe","result":"passed","summary":"Real descriptor-backed ingest, verify, publish, absence reconciliation, and completed reconciliation passed."},{"command":"inline errno.EIO classification probe","result":"passed","summary":"Probe reproduced the defect as StageRejected:artifact_rejected."},{"command":"strict mypy","result":"not-run","summary":"Reported strict pass remained applicable after the formatting-only correction."},{"command":"git diff --cached --name-only","result":"passed","summary":"Output was empty."}],"validationOutput":["98 passed","3 files already formatted","All checks passed","real descriptor-backed ingest/verify/publish/reconcile path passed","actual=StageRejected:artifact_rejected","No staged files"],"residualRisks":["Recovered publication authority can be recorded without proving durable synchronization.","Transient filesystem failures can become permanent lifecycle rejection.","Incoming and lifecycle artifact size profiles can drift.","Production daemon wiring and later lifecycle stages were out of scope."],"noStagedFiles":true,"diffSummary":"Adds concrete ingest, verify, and publish effects, publication reconciliation, and focused tests.","reviewFindings":["high: backend/src/yinshi/services/workspace_replica_publication.py:1672-1696 - reconciliation mints synchronization-bearing authority without synchronizing recovered storage","high: backend/src/yinshi/services/broker_replica_artifact_effects.py:274-404 - lower storage OSError wrapping causes uncertain filesystem failures to become deterministic StageRejected outcomes","medium: backend/src/yinshi/services/broker_replica_artifact_effects.py:443-458 - constructor does not verify incoming artifact size-profile compatibility"],"manualNotes":"Review applies to the current unstaged working-tree candidate. Other dirty checkout changes were excluded."}}}},"isError":false,"timestamp":1789319102135}}
{"type":"custom_message","customType":"subagent_supervisor_request","content":"Subagent progress update.\nRun: 9796f5a0\nAgent: final-review\nChild index: 0\nChild intercom target: subagent-final-review-9796f5a0-1\n\nUPDATE: Final review found two material contract defects. Publication reconciliation mints synchronization-bearing authority without syncing final files, final directory, or root. Lower store APIs wrap non-conclusive OSError as rejection, so new effects terminalize injected EIO as StageRejected instead of stage unknown. Also reviewing an incoming-size-profile compatibility gap: effects constructor checks publication limits only, while BrokerArtifactStore size maxima can differ.","display":true,"details":{"id":"02586478-cdff-4f26-b8a8-e606ba0248ae","reason":"progress_update","expectsReply":false,"runId":"9796f5a0","agent":"final-review","childIndex":0},"id":"a1a3d1a2","parentId":"6b2f15b6","timestamp":"2026-09-13T17:05:02.145Z"}
