{"type":"message","id":"21bfb4a9","parentId":"5f9b1292","timestamp":"2026-09-13T17:18:06.365Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","thinkingSignature":"{\"id\":\"rs_0212e7de83dbbd32016aa6dac6290487d09bf8faca1b59adf4\",\"type\":\"reasoning\",\"content\":[],\"encrypted_content\":\"REDACTED\",\"summary\":[]}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_G3bLEQUmQH8jU1Fj6WWLtc5Q|fc_0212e7de83dbbd32016aa6dac6a57487d0bcad2447ed82f1cf","name":"subagent","arguments":{"workflowScript":"return runs.run('artifact-effects-rereview', {resume:'9796f5a0', task:'Re-review corrected current diff with prior findings and dispositions. (1) Recovered publication reconciliation now performs exact semantic inspection, then a drained synchronization pass that opens and pins all four final files, checks directory/content identities against inspection/declaration, fsyncs four files then final directory then root, and rechecks pins/root/final identities before minting ReplicaPublicationReceipt. Any sync failure maps to ReplicaPublicationUnresolvedError. Tests assert final six fsync types/order and sync-failure unknown. (2) BrokerArtifactStore now distinguishes confirmed missing/unsafe structure from operational OSError: root lookup/open and EIO-style artifact/set access become BrokerArtifactStoreUnresolvedError; FileNotFound and ELOOP/ENOTDIR unsafe objects remain rejected. Publication root/pinned/final access similarly distinguishes unresolved OS failure from confirmed unsafe state; publication generic staging failures no longer become rejection. Effects map EIO, ENOSPC, EMFILE and verify/publish/reconcile owner-unknown exceptions to stage-specific unknown. (3) BrokerArtifactStore exposes immutable limits; broker_artifact_limits_for_replica converts the configured ReplicaStoreLimits to exact incoming semantic maxima while transport-only chunk/timeout remain independent; effects reject broader/narrower/aggregate mismatches for incoming and publication. Tests cover narrower profile and differing transport settings. Current checks: 72 focused tests passed; scoped Ruff lint/format, strict mypy, py_compile, diff check passed. Read actual diff. Require any finding with location/impact/correction/validation, or explicitly no remediation. Do not modify.'})","async":false,"timeoutMs":1800000,"cwd":"/Users/user/projects/yinshi","chatProgress":"auto"}}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.6-sol","usage":{"input":568,"output":390,"cacheRead":234752,"cacheWrite":0,"reasoning":8,"totalTokens":235710,"cost":{"input":0.00284,"output":0.0117,"cacheRead":0.117376,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.131916}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1789319874675,"responseId":"resp_0212e7de83dbbd32016aa6dac34e5887d08a9d2b553f99e691","rawStopReason":"completed"}}
