nresolved OS failure from confirmed unsafe state; publication generic staging failures no longer become rejection. Effects map EIO, ENOSPC, EMFILE and verify/publish/reconcile owner-unknown exceptions to stage-specific unknown. (3) BrokerArtifactStore exposes immutable limits; broker_artifact_limits_for_replica converts the configured ReplicaStoreLimits to exact incoming semantic maxima while transport-only chunk/timeout remain independent; effects reject broader/narrower/aggregate mismatches for incoming and publication. Tests cover narrower profile and differing transport settings. Current checks: 72 focused tests passed; scoped Ruff lint/format, strict mypy, py_compile, diff check passed. Read actual diff. Require any finding with location/impact/correction/validation, or explicitly no remediation. Do not modify.","status":"completed","createdAt":"2026-09-13T17:18:06.483Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-13T17:18:07.227Z","runs":[{"runId":"call_G3bLEQUmQH8jU1Fj6WWLtc5Q|fc_0212e7de83dbbd32016aa6dac6a57487d0bcad2447ed82f1cf","mode":"workflow","status":"completed","startedAt":"2026-09-13T17:18:07.227Z","completedAt":"2026-09-13T17:18:07.227Z"}],"decisions":[],"artifacts":[],"receipts":[],"cwd":"/Users/user/projects/yinshi","ownerSessionId":"/Users/user/.pi/agent/sessions/--Users-user-projects-yinshi--/2026-09-04T04-44-52-550Z_01a06abb-dfc5-7c65-82bb-7c5f2081ee64.jsonl","summary":"Workflow completed.\n\nReturn:\n{\n  \"key\": \"artifact-effects-rereview\",\n  \"ok\": true,\n  \"runId\": \"38ba37e3\",\n  \"output\": \"Revived foreground subagent from 9796f5a0.\\nRevived run: 38ba37e3\\nAgent: final-review\\nSession: /Users/user/.pi/agent/sessions/--Users-user-projects-yinshi--/2026-09-04T04-44-52-550Z_01a06abb-dfc5-7c65-82bb-7c5f2081ee64/9796f5a0/run-0/session.jsonl\\nAsync dir: /var/folders/sp/rk1j_1ws7rqdyg8245gpw5hh0000gn/T/pi-subagents-uid-501/async-subagent-runs/38ba37e3\\nIntercom target: subagent-final-review-38ba37e3-1 (if registered)\\nStatus if needed: subagent({ actio