{"type":"message","id":"9682fc5b","parentId":"539efb62","timestamp":"2026-09-13T18:59:50.141Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"**Planning worker task delegation**\n\n**Starting worker with clean test environment**","thinkingSignature":"{\"id\":\"rs_0212e7de83dbbd32016aa6f293cdfc87d0a9f3c65c8092291b\",\"type\":\"reasoning\",\"content\":[],\"encrypted_content\":\"REDACTED\",\"summary\":[{\"type\":\"summary_text\",\"text\":\"**Planning worker task delegation**\"},{\"type\":\"summary_text\",\"text\":\"**Starting worker with clean test environment**\"}]}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_RzM5R4sW6KdYSqaZXiyVhngA|fc_0212e7de83dbbd32016aa6f298cd6887d0972371357dbb9e93","name":"subagent","arguments":{"workflowScript":"return runs.run('replica-composition-source', {agent:'worker-advanced', task:'Implement production broker replica composition in /Users/user/projects/yinshi, no commit. This is a bounded source+focused test task. Architecture is settled; do not inspect unrelated dirty files. Read only execution_daemons.py, execution_broker.py control class, broker_replica_journal.py constructor/status vocab, broker_replica_lifecycle.py effects/coordinator APIs, broker_replica_artifact_effects.py, broker_artifact_store.py, workspace_replica_publication.py, root_launcher.py layout, artifact_upload_daemon.py fixed root, and tests/test_execution_daemons.py.\\n\\nAdd to execution_daemons.py (or one small new helper module if needed): fixed replica journal path /var/lib/yinshi/control/broker-replica-journal.sqlite3, incoming root /var/lib/yinshi/artifact-incoming, publication root /var/lib/yinshi-launcher/staging. Add lifecycle env+CLI gate and seven independent stage env+CLI gates, all conjunction explicit && env true and default false. Build BrokerService unchanged plus BrokerControlService, BrokerReplicaJournal bound to DEFAULT_REPLICA_STORE_LIMITS digest and exact keys, BrokerReplicaLifecycleCoordinator with BrokerReplicaArtifactEffects for first three and fail-closed effects for last four. Gate wrapper: disabled apply StageRejected using stage-valid status and deterministic receipt ID; disabled reconcile StageOutcomeUnknown using valid stage-specific reason. Unfinished admission/drain/export/reclaim remain fail closed even if stage gate true: apply rejected, reconcile unknown. Enabled first three delegate. Build all components even lifecycle disabled. Share loaded keys. Return a composition object so _run_broker can call launch_service.recover_startup(), await coordinator.recover_incomplete(), then serve BrokerControlService. Generalize handler typing via protocol application_uid+handle. Preserve disabled lifecycle response-before-authority and exact executor.launch behavior. No SQLite handles across await.\\n\\nAdd focused tests, preferably new backend/tests/test_broker_production_composition.py to minimize conflicts: default/env conjunction for lifecycle and all seven stage gates; malformed env config; fixed roots/journal/limits/key binding through monkeypatch or inspectable composition fields; disabled apply/reconcile and unfinished enabled failclosed; recovery occurs before _run_daemon; production top-level service is BrokerControlService. Existing tests must pass. Run focused pytest, Ruff check/format-check, strict mypy changed source, py_compile, diff check. If TDD Guard blocks edits, return exact parent-applicable edit packet. Do not modify any other files.', cwd:'/Users/user/projects/yinshi', acceptance:{level:'checked', evidence:['changed-files','tests-added','commands-run','validation-output','residual-risks']}})","async":false,"timeoutMs":1800000,"turnBudget":{"maxTurns":24,"graceTurns":4},"toolBudget":{"soft":45,"hard":70,"block":["read","grep","find","ls"]},"cwd":"/Users/user/projects/yinshi","chatProgress":"auto"}}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.6-sol","usage":{"input":215,"output":801,"cacheRead":114176,"cacheWrite":0,"reasoning":155,"totalTokens