ssions/f84edcb6-893d-46d6-bb88-d4cf281fb3e6.json","mission":{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"f84edcb6-893d-46d6-bb88-d4cf281fb3e6","title":"Independent read-only final review of the current production-composition diff in /Users/user/proj...","objective":"Independent read-only final review of the current production-composition diff in /Users/user/projects/yinshi. Do not modify, stage, or commit. Original Phase 6 request: wire authenticated replica.lifecycle into the production broker daemon using the accepted journal/coordinator/artifact effects, keep executor.launch unchanged, preserve disabled-before-authority behavior, make lifecycle and seven stage gates independently default-disabled, and keep unfinished admission/drain/export/reclaim fail closed.\n\nApproved design: BrokerControlService owns authenticated request-type dispatch; BrokerService remains unchanged. Production builds BrokerReplicaJournal at fixed /var/lib/yinshi/control/broker-replica-journal.sqlite3, incoming store at /var/lib/yinshi/artifact-incoming, publication at /var/lib/yinshi-launcher/staging. Journal binds request key/current response key and exact DEFAULT_REPLICA_STORE_LIMITS digest. Artifact effects handle ingest/verify/publish. Each stage has explicit CLI + separate YINSHI_REPLICA_STAGE_<STAGE>_ENABLED env conjunction. Lifecycle has its own conjunction. Disabled apply is deterministic stage-valid rejection; disabled reconcile is stage-valid unknown. Unfinished later effects reject apply and return unknown reconciliation even if their stage flag is true. Startup order: legacy-v1 inspection, composition, synchronous launch recovery, awaited serial replica recovery, socket service. No SQLite handle may cross await. Persistence errors escape.\n\nCritical invariants: lifecycle disabled response occurs before lifecycle authority parsing; same raw signed frame reaches coordinator when enabled; executor.launch behavior unchanged; roots/keys/limits are fixed and broker-owned; authority cannot choose paths/resources; all seven effects present; no support is fabricated; default systemd startup has no enabling flags and therefore remains disabled. Stage gate env names must be independent from root launcher prepare/reclaim and upload gates.\n\nActual changed files for this milestone: backend/src/yinshi/execution_daemons.py and backend/tests/test_execution_daemons.py. Relevant callers: broker_main/_run_broker/broker_connection_handler, BrokerControlService, BrokerReplicaLifecycleCoordinator, BrokerReplicaJournal, BrokerReplicaArtifactEffects, artifact upload daemon and root launcher constants. Current checks: 223 focused journal/lifecycle/control/daemon/artifact/publication tests passed; scoped Ruff lint+format, strict mypy, py_compile, diff check passed.\n\nApply the loaded /skill:software-design content: prioritize deep modules, information hiding, distinct abstraction levels, complexity pulled down, precise names, consistent obvious behavior; review shallow modules, information leakage, temporal decomposition, pass-throughs, overexposure, conjoined methods, repetition, vague names, special-general mixture, nonobvious behavior, and excessive exception paths.\n\nRead the actual diff and relevant callers. Return findings ordered by severity. Every finding must include location/affected requirement, impact, proposed correction, and validation. If no findings remain, explicitly say no remediation is needed. Include residual risks.","status":"completed","createdAt":"2026-09-13T19:26:43.500Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-13T19:47:19.183Z","runs":[{"runId":"call_K6zRYBQMgnCQ0PomizUstTkk|fc_0212e7de83dbbd32016aa6f8e540d887d0850a55bb2d24a774","mode":"workflow","agent":"final-review","status":"completed","startedAt":"2026-09-13T19:47:19.183Z","completedAt":"2026-09-13T19:47:19.183Z","usage":{"tokens":701674}}],"decisions":[],"artifacts":[{"kind":"output","path":"/Users/user/projects/yinshi/.pi-subagents/artifacts/94419067_final-review_0_output.md"},{"kind":"other","path":"/Users/user/projects/yinshi/.pi-subagents/artifacts/94419067_final-review_0_transcript.jsonl","description":"Child transcript"}],"receipts":[],"cwd":"/Users/user/projects/yinshi","ownerSessionId":"/Users/user/.pi/agent/sessions/--Users-user-projects-yinshi--/2026-09-04T04-44-52-550Z_01a06abb-dfc5-7c65-82bb-7c5f2081ee64.jsonl","summary":"Workflow completed.\n\nReturn:\n{\n  \"key\": \"production-composition-review\",\n  \"ok\": true,\n  \"runId\": \"94419067\",\n  \"output\": \"## Review result\\n\\nBlocked. One high-severity finding remains. Remediation is required.\\n\\n## Finding\\n\\n### High: Aggregate lifecycle deadline can preempt valid stages\\n\\n**Location**\\n\\n- `backend/src/yinshi/execution_daemons.py:98-102`\\n- `backend/src/yinshi/execution_daemons.py:832-841`\\n- `backend/src/yinshi/execution_daemons.py:1180-1186`\\n- `backend/src/yinshi/services/broker_replica_lifecycle.py:404-415`\\n- `backend/src/yinshi/services/broker_replica_lifecycle.py:442-501`\\n- Missing coverage: `backend/tests/test_execution_daemons.py:1162-1172`\\n\\n**Affected requirement**\\n\\nProduction lifecycle correctness, bounded failure handling, and unchanged `executor.launch` behavior.\\n\\n**Impact**\\n\\nThree concrete stages run serially before fail-closed admission. Each receives 40 seconds, while the whole connection receives only 120 seconds.\\n\\n`3 * 40 == 120`. No budget remains for frame reading, ownership, journal commits, or response draining.\\n\\nOuter timeout cancels coordinator. Coordinator persists terminal `cancellation_unknown`, then rethrows. Caller receives no initial response. Retries only replay unresolved authority.\\n\\nScaled coordinator probe reproduced this outcome. Two individually in-budget effects started before outer cancellation persisted:\\n\\n```text\\n{'code': 'cancellation_unknown', 'stage': 'verify', 'state': 'unresolved'}\\n```\\n\\n**Proposed correction**\\n\\nMove total request deadlines behind authenticated dispatch. Keep existing launch deadlines unchanged.\\n\\nGive lifecycle a separate aggregate deadline above all serial stage limits, ownership wait, persistence, and response delivery. Keep a larger transport safety ceiling.\\n\\n**Remediation plan**\\n\\nUse `worker-advanced`. Timeout, cancellation, persistence, and dispatch guarantees interact.\\n\\n**Required checks**\\n\\n- Assert lifecycle aggregate budget is strictly neste...","acceptance":{"status":"attested","evidenceStatus":"attested","explicit":false,"effectiveAcceptance":{"level":"attested","explicit":false,"inferredReason":["read-only task wording"],"criteria":[{"id":"criterion-1","must":"Return concrete findings with file paths and severity when applicable","evidence":["review-findings","residual-risks"],"severity":"required"}],"evidence":["review-findings","residual-risks"],"verify":[],"stopRules":[]},"inferredReason":["read-only task wording"],"criteria":[{"id":"criterion-1","must":"Return concrete findings with file paths and severity when applicable","evidence":["review-findings","residual-risks"],"severity":"required"}],"runtimeChecks":[],"verifyRuns":[],"childReport":{"criteriaSatisfied":[{"id":"criterion-1","status":"satisfied","evidence":"High-severity deadline finding identifies exact source and test locations, impact, correction, worker tier, and required validation."}],"changedFiles":["backend/src/yinshi/execution_daemons.py","backend/tests/test_execution_daemons.py"],"testsAddedOrUpdated":["backend/tests/test_execution_daemons.py"],"commandsRun":[{"command":"cd backend && PYTHONDONTWRITEBYTECODE=1 ../.venv/bin/python -m pytest -p no:cacheprovider -q tests/test_broker_replica_journal.py tests/test_broker_replica_lifecycle.py tests/test_broker_control_dispatch.py tests/test_execution_daemons.py tests/test_broker_replica_artifact_effects.py tests/test_broker_artifact_store.py tests/test_workspace_replica_publication.py","result":"passed","summary":"223 passed with one unrelated Authlib deprecation warning."},{"command":"assert 3 * BROKER_EFFECT_TIMEOUT_SECONDS < CONNECTION_TIMEOUT_SECONDS","result":"failed","summary":"AssertionError showed (120.0, 120.0)."},{"command":"scaled BrokerReplicaLifecycleCoordinator serial-stage deadline probe","result":"passed","summary":"Outer timeout preempted in-budget stages and persisted cancellation_unknown."},{"command":"git diff --cached --name-only","result":"passed","summary":"No staged files."}],"validationOutput":["Focused final working-tree candidate: 223 passed, 1 warning in 80.02s.","Stage gate names were unique and disjoint from launcher prepare, launcher reclaim, and upload gates.","Aggregate deadline check failed because three stage ceilings equal the whole connection ceiling.","Scaled probe persisted error state cancellation_unknown during serial in-budget execution."],"residualRisks":["Live Linux systemd and fixed-root ownership behavior was source-reviewed only.","Fixed path policy is duplicated across several modules and deployment files.","Both milestone files are untracked relative to HEAD.","Unrelated dirty working-tree paths were outside review scope."],"noStagedFiles":true,"diffSummary":"Production broker composition adds lifecycle dispatch, fixed journal and artifact stores, seven stage gates, fail-closed later effects, and ordered recovery.","reviewFindings":["high: backend/src/yinshi/execution_daemons.py:98-102,832-841,1180-1186 - three serial 40-second lifecycle stages share a 120-second connection deadline, causing outer cancellation and terminal unresolved authority."],"manualNotes":"Review applies to current working-tree hashes bb06e6e8a89f467877a39bdce713d953a615ad976e24725bfc36d7cea3678914 and 2992c37bf52c5b82ee7b79d13f884aceaad706ab45b7b6bc8e2ba2011439335c."}}}},"isError":false,"timestamp":1789328839363}}
