ant assertions. Focused aggregate checks: 250 tests passed; scoped Ruff lint passed, format needs only one already-corrected one-line change, strict mypy and py_compile passed, diff check passed. Inspect actual corrected diff including execution_broker.py, broker_stdio_relay.py and their tests. Confirm executor.launch raw dispatch behavior remains unchanged except equivalent authenticated route-local 120-second ceiling. Require any finding with location/impact/correction/validation, or explicitly no remediation. Do not modify.","status":"completed","createdAt":"2026-09-13T19:53:45.214Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-13T19:53:45.898Z","runs":[{"runId":"call_PNKFGXFUkL265w1Uh08xvO7K|fc_0212e7de83dbbd32016aa6ff40971487d0b808ae756bf95ab4","mode":"workflow","status":"completed","startedAt":"2026-09-13T19:53:45.898Z","completedAt":"2026-09-13T19:53:45.898Z"}],"decisions":[],"artifacts":[],"receipts":[],"cwd":"/Users/user/projects/yinshi","ownerSessionId":"/Users/user/.pi/agent/sessions/--Users-user-projects-yinshi--/2026-09-04T04-44-52-550Z_01a06abb-dfc5-7c65-82bb-7c5f2081ee64.jsonl","summary":"Workflow completed.\n\nReturn:\n{\n  \"key\": \"production-composition-rereview\",\n  \"ok\": true,\n  \"runId\": \"aed4b752\",\n  \"output\": \"Revived foreground subagent from 94419067.\\nRevived run: aed4b752\\nAgent: final-review\\nSession: /Users/user/.pi/agent/sessions/--Users-user-projects-yinshi--/2026-09-04T04-44-52-550Z_01a06abb-dfc5-7c65-82bb-7c5f2081ee64/94419067/run-0/session.jsonl\\nAsync dir: /var/folders/sp/rk1j_1ws7rqdyg8245gpw5hh0000gn/T/pi-subagents-uid-501/async-subagent-runs/aed4b752\\nIntercom target: subagent-final-review-aed4b752-1 (if registered)\\nStatus if needed: subagent({ action: \\\"status\\\", id: \\\"aed4b752\\\" })\\n\\nThe async run is detached and running in the background.\\nYou are in an interactive session. By default, return control to the user now; Pi will wake you on completion when the run finishes or needs attention. Do NOT call subagent_wait() me