\"**Identifying schema limitations and architecture gaps**\"}]}"},{"type":"thinking","thinking":"**Updating plan due to critical blocker**","thinkingSignature":"{\"id\":\"rs_0212e7de83dbbd32016aa7060b9a2887d0bddd9e829e48740f\",\"type\":\"reasoning\",\"content\":[],\"encrypted_content\":\"REDACTED\",\"summary\":[{\"type\":\"summary_text\",\"text\":\"**Updating plan due to critical blocker**\"}]}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_6Rhb9FspOqOXUdFCT5v0n9L1|fc_0212e7de83dbbd32016aa7060c38d887d08d9ac4c7849fa115","name":"contact_supervisor","arguments":{"reason":"progress_update","message":"UPDATE: Architecture inspection found a fundamental blocker. Current `replica.lifecycle` coordinator auto-runs admission directly into drain under a 40-second stage deadline. No executor entry point, work command, application-to-runtime channel, or durable continuation request exists. A launched executor would be drained before any workload. Current publication root also conflicts with root `prepare`: publication contains three artifact files, while root staging requires exactly `repo` and `home`. Recommendation will keep later effects fail-closed and require separate materialization/runtime-control milestones plus a product decision for the admitted execution interval."}}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.6-sol","usage":{"input":1947,"output":1714,"cacheRead":171776,"cacheWrite":0,"reasoning":1575,"totalTokens":175437,"cost":{"input":0.009735,"output":0.05142,"cacheRead":0.08588799999999999,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.14704299999999998}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1789330906375,"responseId":"resp_0212e7de83dbbd32016aa705db059087d0b1b47158f15218ae","rawStopReason":"completed"}}
